<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ISA" style="id">- Tsishingini (tsw)</book>
  <para style="h">Ishaya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ish</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ishaya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ishaya</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ishaya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ishaya</para>
  <para style="is">Ucuɗuwu wa aatagada a nda</para>
  <para style="ip">Aatagada a Ishaya a̱ tsura̱ aala diga uba̱ta̱ u vumava̱sula̱ o ro a ɗa a na a yuwain wuma a mantsa ma a'wan ukpakukupa kunla̱ (800) kafu a matsan Yesu. A ta gura ne'eshe aatagada'a ba̱ta̱ ta'atsu tsunda.</para>
  <para style="ip">1) A̱ɗiva̱ 1-39 u ta̱ a ɗa o tsugono tsa Yahuda vu upasu wa̱ na̱shi e iɗa ya Isra'ila. A mantsa'a, Yahuda ta̱ tsura̱sa̱ izami yi nla̱ngi diga e iɗa i ro i na i ri nu ucira za va aala Asuriya. Ishaya ene ta̱ udamu wa Yahuda nu ucira wa Asuriya goon ɗa shi, amma a̱ba̱jini o udamu a̱ yi ɗa unusu wi iɗa'a nu ulambu u tsutoni tsa̱ yi na̱ A̱sula̱, oɓolo nu ulambu u mazuwa mo okolo e le uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi. A̱tsuma̱ adanshi a̱ yi vumava̱sula̱'a̱ u yuwan ta̱ ulinga ni idanshi yi iroci, adama u rono ugbozu wa ama e iɗa'a na azagbain e le a na a yuwan wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ oɓolo nu uge'etosu wa amayun. U rono le ta̱ atsuvu adansa, ulambu u tsutoni na adanshi a̱ A̱sula̱ u ta̱ ta̱wa̱ le nu ukototosu na atakaci. Ishaya yuwan ta̱ adanshi e ikaka adama a mantsa ma na za ro diga o ugundo wa̱ Da̱wuda a̱ ta̱wa̱ na o'wo mogono ma amayun.</para>
  <para style="ip">2) A̱ɗiva̱ 40-55 a̱ ta̱ a ɗa a mantsa ma na ama na̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱ ri e iɗa i tsugbashi a Babila. Uba̱ta̱'a̱ o uta̱ ta̱ okolo nu ulambu u wuma. Vumava̱sula̱'a̱ u yuwan ta̱ adanshi e ikaka adansa, A̱sula̱ a ta wawa ama a̱ yi reve u ka̱mba̱to le o u'wa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima adama a fara wuma usa'avu. A̱ba̱jini adanshi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ɗiva̱ a nda a̱ yi ɗa, A̱sula̱ A̱sulazuva alabari a ɗa, ucira wa̱ yi e ekere a ama a̱ yi u ta̱ uba̱ta̱ wu ulinga wa alajiya adanshi A̱sulazuva e ekere a nɗa suru, aza a na a̱ tsura̱ aba'un adama aza a Isra'ila. Pasu na yuwain adanshi adama &lt;&lt;Aagbashi A̱sulazuva&gt;&gt; a̱ ta̱ pe a̱tsuma̱ o uguzu wa akuci a nzuwulai a na a la'a revei.</para>
  <para style="ip">3) A̱ɗiva̱ 56-66 a̱ ta̱ a ɗa alabari ama a na a̱ ka̱mba̱i Urishelima ɗa, waru a ta adanshi a na A̱sula̱ a̱ ta̱ shiton nzuwulai ma̱ yi e ekere a ama a̱ yi. A̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ ta̱ ugbozu a mayan mo ulinga wa̱ a̱ɓula̱, nu uge'etosu wa amayun, oɓolo na̱ tsutoni nu Urana u Wivuwun wa Ajuma, na̱ mayan ma̱ kucci oɓolo na̱ avasa. Upasu u ro a̱tsuma̱ a aatagada'a na ri ulobonu fo a̱ yi ɗa 61:1-2, e le idanshi i na Yesu yuwain adanshi na̱ le a mantsa ma na u revetyoi aciya̱yi alanga eteshe adama u roco a na e ɗe niyi adama a̱ga̱nda̱.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ili i na i ri pe a̱tsuma̱ a aatagada a nda</para>
  <para style="io1">Morono ma atsuvu na̱ nzuwulai 1:1-12:6</para>
  <para style="io1">Oforo a nɗa 13:1-23:18</para>
  <para style="io1">Uge'etosu wa̱ A̱sula̱ a aci a nɗa 24:1-27:13</para>
  <para style="io1">Uda̱shiwu u mo rono ma atsuvu na̱ nzuwulai 28:1-35:10</para>
  <para style="io1">Mogono Hezekiya va Yahuda na̱ Asuriya 36:1-39:8</para>
  <para style="io1">Ikaka yi isa'ani na̱ mazuwa mo okolo 40:1-55:13</para>
  <para style="io1">Morono ma atsuvu na̱ nzuwulai 56:1-66:24.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ISA 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 1:1" />Apa alavu alavu a na Ishaya ulobo wa Amoz we enei adama a Yahuda na̱ Urishelima a yashi i tsugono tsa Uziya na̱ Jotam na̱ Ahaz na̱ Hezekiya ngono ma Yahuda.<verse eid="ISA 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iɗa ya aciyogbamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 1:2" />Uwwa, a̱vu zuva! Vu polo atsuvu, a̱vu uvaɗi! Adama a na A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ adanshi: &lt;&lt;N kungwato ta̱ muwun a̱vu n 'ya̱sa̱n le, agba reve a̱ 'ya̱sa̱a̱n mu aci. <verse eid="ISA 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 1:3" />Nan vi iluma reve ta̱ za na ri na̱ a̱yi, mololi waru me reve ta̱ ukungulu wu za na ri na̱ a̱yi, amma Isra'ila reve shi, ama a̱ va̱ a̱ ri nu urevu shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 1:4" />Ayya, iɗa yu unusu! Ama a na a̱ ri utanuwu ni iwuya, muwun ma̱ a̱za̱ e iwuya, muwun n na n la̱nga̱i, aza a na a lyawai A̱sulazuva, aza a na a tarai Za va Akiza a Isra'ila ili i ro shi, a̱vu a vadalaa yi ucina̱. <verse eid="ISA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 1:5" />O una̱ wu nyen yoo ronusoo aciya̱ɗu ma̱ga̱la̱? O una̱ wu nyen yaa lyuwa elime na aciyogbamu? Aci a̱ ɗu suru a̱ ta̱ wamatowun, okolo a̱ ɗu suru waru a̱ ta̱ a̱ mɓa̱la̱. <verse eid="ISA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 1:6" />Diga a apata a ana a̱ ɗu hali a̱ tyo a aci a̱ ɗu ko uba̱ta̱ u ri gbaga shi, she antsu na̱ wufuru na ajakata, a̱ za̱'wa̱ le shi ko gba a̱ nla̱ le shi ko a̱ tsun le mani'in shi. <verse eid="ISA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 1:7" />Iɗa i ɗu yo o'wo ta̱ ofoli, a̱ kula̱to ta̱ ilyuci i gbagbain i ɗu, e esu a̱ ɗu a ɗa omocin aa gasasa a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ ɗu, ofoli e iɗa cine omocin o tsu kototo iɗa. <verse eid="ISA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 1:8" />Reve a lyawa Usheli Sihiyona a̱ nde'en tsa̱ ma̱va̱li o uɗuma̱ wa̱ inabi, tso oogodo o uɗuma̱ wo oɗyoryo, tsa̱ lyuci na a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱i nu uvon. <verse eid="ISA 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 1:9" />Na̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a̱ shi a lyawaa tsu akapi wuma shi, tsu shi to o'wo tso Sodom na̱ Gomora. <verse eid="ISA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 1:10" />Uwwai adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱ɗu aza a tsugbain tso Sodom; poloyi uritosu wa̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu atsuvu a̱ɗu ama a̱ Gomora! <verse eid="ISA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 1:11" />&lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa a̱bunda̱ e ikucci i ɗu yaa munaa mu?&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dansa. Kucci vu ukula̱tosu ɗu va̱ a̱giri'i na̱ za mani'in vi inama i na i ri na̱ lipu a rawa mu ta̱. Maa uwwusa majin ma mpasa mo ogono e inan i ɗu ko vi ikyon ko vu mgbele n ɗu shi. <verse eid="ISA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 1:12" />A mantsa ma na i ta̱wa̱i a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ va̱ zane ɗa zuwa nɗu wudasu wu kowo va̱? <verse eid="ISA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 1:13" />Lyawai a̱ ta̱wusa̱a̱ mu na̱ kucci ve pere! Ili i ma̱guru i ɗu ili i tsugya tsa ɗa e ekere a̱ va̱. A̱buki o woto sa'avu na Ashibi na̱ wivuwun, maa gura kaɓa asuvu ni iɓolo i la̱nga̱ yi iwuya i ɗu shi. <verse eid="ISA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 1:14" />Okolo a̱ va̱ a 'yuwan ta̱ a̱buki o woto sa'avu ɗu oɓolo na̱ a̱buki a na a zuwai. O o'wo mu ta̱ itana, n kuna̱ ta̱ ni itana i le. <verse eid="ISA 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 1:15" />Nni i 'ya̱sa̱n ekere a̱ ɗu zuva, n to sokoo ɗu urewesu u va̱. Ko ni i yuwan avasa lon, moo polo atsuvu shi, adama a na ekere a̱ ɗu a̱ ta̱ tapu na̱ mpasa. <verse eid="ISA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 1:16" />Sa'ai i ka̱mbuwa̱ aciya̱ɗu cece. Tawai linga vi iwuya i ɗu a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ va̱! Lyawai mayan me iwuya. <verse eid="ISA 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 1:17" />Ritoi mayan me mejege! Zamiyi amayun i kamba aza a na oo ɓongishi. Piriya̱yi mkpa'an, reve yi isawaan nruna̱. <verse eid="ISA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 1:18" />&lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱i gogo tsu yuwain a̱sa̱la̱,&gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai. &lt;&lt;Ko na̱ shi unusu u ɗu u ri ushili san, o to o'wo u'uri puwu tsa̱ tsikilu, ko na̱ a̱ shi ushili tsa mpasa, o to o'wo tsa̱ a̱punda̱ a̱ uri. <verse eid="ISA 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 1:19" />Ni i ri ufoɓu waru i yuwan tsutoni, i ta lyuwa ili i na i la'ai ulobonu yi iɗa'a, <verse eid="ISA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 1:20" />agba ni i 'yuwan a̱vu i yuwaan mu aciyogbamu, a ta lyuwa ɗu na̱ matsun me pe'eni.&gt;&gt; Adama a na una̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva u ɗa u yuwain adanshi. <verse eid="ISA 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 1:21" />Ka̱lyuwa̱i cine lyuci va̱ a̱ɓula̱ ka̱mba̱i aashakala! U shi ta̱ tapu na amayun waru a̱ɓula̱ a̱ shi ta̱ pe tapu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi, agba gogo a̱za̱ a̱ mona a ɗa a̱ ri pe. <verse eid="ISA 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 1:22" />Azurufa va̱ wu na shi can wo o'wo ta̱ accaka a azurufa, masayan ma na ma la'ai uyo'o ma̱ wu a̱ sula̱ yi ta̱ na̱ mini. <verse eid="ISA 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 1:23" />Azagbain a̱ wu aza a aciyogbamu a ɗa, n'utsa̱ me evu. Suru nle a ciga ta̱ u'ushishi wu utowusu wu una̱, ne e izami yu uneꞌe u yipalishi. A̱a̱ pirishiya̱ mkpa'an shi, a tsu zuwaa addama a amayun a̱ nruna̱ atsuvu shi. <verse eid="ISA 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 1:24" />Adama o ndolo Zagbain, A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva, Za vu Ucira va Isra'ila, a damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Ili i ro yi lo shi, n ta̱ cu'waan n'yuwatan n va̱ upan u va̱ n tsupa e ekere a aza a na a̱ ri a̱ nla̱ngi na̱ a̱mu. <verse eid="ISA 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 1:25" />N ta vadala ukere u va̱ a̱ nla̱ngi na̱ a̱vu, n ta pisha wu mu uta̱a̱ accaka a̱ wu tsa aringasa a̱vu mu uta̱a̱ idaba ya̱ wu suru. <verse eid="ISA 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 1:26" />N ta̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ a̱za̱ o uge'etosu wa̱ wu tsa̱ a̱za̱ o ufaru, na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ a̱sa̱la a̱ wu tsa̱ a̱za̱ o ufaru. Na a yuwan ne ɗaɗa ee ɗe wu Lyuci Gbain va̱ A̱ɓula̱, Lyuci Gbain va Amayun.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 1:27" />A ta tsupaa Sihiyona o ure u mejege, aza a na a vadalai waru na̱ a̱ɓula̱. <verse eid="ISA 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 1:28" />Agba aza a aciyogbamu na̱ a̱za̱ o unusu a̱ ta̱ rukutsa̱ le oɓolo, aza a na waru a lyawai A̱sulazuva o to koto. <verse eid="ISA 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 1:29" />&lt;&lt;I ta uwwa wono adama a ɗanga oku na yaa uwwusa uyo'o u vama u le; a ta ca ɗu wono adama a̱ a̱rumbu a na i ɗangwai. <verse eid="ISA 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 1:30" />Adama a na i to o'wo tso uɗanga u oku u na a̱vu'un a̱ yi a kpanlai, i to o'wo tsa̱ a̱a̱rumbu a na a̱ ri na̱ mini shi. <verse eid="ISA 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 1:31" />Waru za vu ucira to o'wo tsa̱ a̱'yuwa̱, ulinga wa̱ yi waru tsu ugasu wa akina ele ra a̱ ta̱ kula̱ oɓolo, babu za na a̱a̱ kimusa̱ akina'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ISA 2" />
  <para style="s">Masasan ma̱ A̱sulazuva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 2:1" />Apa nda ikaka i na Ishaya ulobo wa Amoz u ushiyi adama a Yahuda na̱ Urishelima:<verse eid="ISA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 2:2" />A̱tsuma̱ a rana vu ukosu masasan ma̱ a̱a̱'isa̱ ma̱ A̱sulazuva mo to o'wo tso mogono ma nsasan. A̱ ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱n yi u la'a agaɗi suru, nɗa suru n te yene a̱ tyo pe. <verse eid="ISA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 2:3" />Nɗa ma̱ a̱bunda̱ n ta̱ ta̱wa̱ n damma, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱i tsu gawain a̱ tyo a masasan ma̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱ tyo o u'wa wa̱ A̱sula̱ a Yakubu, adama u roco tsu ure wa̱ yi, tsa̱ra̱ tsu walai o ure wa̱ yi.&gt;&gt; Adama a na uritosu u to uta̱ diga Sihiyona, adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva waru diga Urishelima. <verse eid="ISA 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 2:4" />U te ge'eto nɗa na̱ nɗa, reve u zuwa ama na̱ a̱bunda̱ e reme nsa̱lula̱i. A̱ ta ruma mutsun mu pe'eni n le a̱ ka̱mba̱to le a̱ba̱ri, mbata n le waru mutsun n wukoɗu we eten. Iɗa ya̱a̱ da̱shi 'ya̱sa̱n matsun me pe'eni o uvon ni iɗa i ro waru shi, ko gba waru a̱ da̱shi rito cine aa yuwan uvon shi. <verse eid="ISA 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 2:5" />Ugundo wa Yakubu, ta̱wa̱i tsu yuwain mmalu a̱tsuma̱ e ekan a̱ A̱sulazuva.<verse eid="ISA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Urana wa̱ A̱sulazuva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 2:6" />Vu vari ta̱ ama a̱ wu ugundo wa Yakubu, adama a na a̱ ri tapu ni ili yo oboci diga upasu wa asana na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yindi tsa aza a Filistiya, waru o to ɓoluso ekere no omocin. <verse eid="ISA 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 2:7" />Iɗa i le i ta̱ tapu na̱ azurufa na̱ zinariya, utsuru u le u ri na̱ a̱tyo shi. Iɗa i le i ta̱ tapu ni ido, ikeke yi ido i le i ri na̱ a̱tyo shi. <verse eid="ISA 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 2:8" />Iɗa i le i ta̱ tapu na̱ a̱ma̱li, a̱ ta̱ ka̱ɗa̱tosa̱ ili i na a yuwain ne ekere e le, a̱ ta̱ ka̱ɗa̱tosa̱ ili i na akatsu le a yuwain. <verse eid="ISA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 2:9" />Adama o ndolo a ɗa a̱a̱ ka̱ɗa̱to vuma, waru a tarai vaɗilima̱ ili shi. She vu yuwaan le gafura wan! <verse eid="ISA 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 2:10" />Walai a̱ tyo a̱tsuma̱ a atali, i pa'an a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ma̱buta̱ me iɗa, i pa'an upan wa̱ A̱sulazuva na̱ tsugbain tsu ucira wa̱ yi! <verse eid="ISA 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 2:11" />A̱ ta̱ ka̱ɗa̱to esu a za va aciyogbamu uvaɗu wa ama waru wo o'wo ili i wono. O urana u ndolo A̱sulazuva a ɗa goon za tsugbain lon. <verse eid="ISA 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 2:12" />Adama a na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a zuwa ta̱ urana adama a aza a aciyogbamu suru na̱ a̱za̱ o uvaɗu suru, na aza a na suru a̱a̱ 'ya̱susa̱n zuva a̱ ta̱ ka̱ɗa̱to le, <verse eid="ISA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 2:13" />na̱ ɗanga sida va Lebanon suru, a̱za̱ o uga'an, oɓolo na̱ ɗanga oku va Bashan suru, <verse eid="ISA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 2:14" />na̱ nsasan mu uga'an suru na agaɗi o uga'an suru, <verse eid="ISA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 2:15" />na adama a atsura o uga'an suru na̱ ɓaɓu vu ucira suru, <verse eid="ISA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 2:16" />na adama a antsun a gbagbain a Tarshishi na antsu a sa'ani a gbagbain suru. <verse eid="ISA 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 2:17" />A̱ ta̱ ka̱ɗa̱to aciyogbamu a vuma, nu uvaɗu wa ama waru. O urana u ndolo A̱sulazuva a ɗa goon za tsugbain lon, <verse eid="ISA 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 2:18" />a̱ma̱li gba a̱ ta̱ puwa̱n suru suru. <verse eid="ISA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 2:19" />Ama a ta uwa a̱ a̱ba̱nu a atali na̱ a̱ a̱nci e iɗa adama o wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva nu ucira u tsugbain tsa̱ yi, a mantsa ma na u 'yoyin adama u ca uvaɗi wovon. <verse eid="ISA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 2:20" />O urana u ndolo vaɗilima̱ ta variyaa a̱ga̱ɗa̱ no ogyon a̱ma̱li a azurufa na aza a zinariya e le, a̱ma̱li a na a yuwayin aciyele adama a̱ a̱ga̱nda̱. <verse eid="ISA 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 2:21" />A ta uwa a̱ a̱ba̱nu a atali nu upa'atan wa aatali adama o wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva nu ucira u tsugbain tsa̱ yi, a mantsa ma na u 'yoyin adama u ca uvaɗi wovon. <verse eid="ISA 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 2:22" />Lyawai a zuwusaa vaɗilima̱ ucira u ɗu, za na wivuwun wa̱ yi wa'a ɗa. Nye i ɗa a̱ ri?<verse eid="ISA 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ISA 3" />
  <para style="s">Uge'etosu wa̱ Urishelima na̱ Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 3:1" />Uwwai nda, Zagbain, A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva, a̱ ta̱ pura̱ diga Urishelima na̱ Yahuda ili i na aa zuwusaa ucira suru, ni ilyalya na̱ mini suru, <verse eid="ISA 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 3:2" />na̱ nan yali na̱ a̱soja na̱ a̱za̱ o uge'etosu na ama̱sula̱, no oboci na̱ mbara, <verse eid="ISA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 3:3" />na̱ nan yali a̱ a̱soja a kupoton na aza a tsugbain, na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ a̱sa̱la̱ na aza a na a gurai ulinga wu ukere na aza a avasa a̱ a̱ma̱li. <verse eid="ISA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 3:4" />Reve n zuwa olobo o o'wo azagbain e le, muwun n kekeꞌen n ɗa moo o'wo azagbain e le. <verse eid="ISA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 3:5" />Ama o to ɓongiloi, vuma na̱ vuma, vuma na̱ moron ma̱ nden ma̱ yi. Muwun n ta yuwaan mbara adanshi na aciyogbamu, za na ri ili i ro shi u ta tara zagbain ili ye pere. <verse eid="ISA 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 3:6" />Vuma te reme mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun ma̱ yi, a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;A na vu ri nu utugu u gbain, voo o'wo zagbain tsu. Vu yuwan tsugbain tso oɓolo a na a̱ riya̱i nda!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 3:7" />Agba o urana u ndolo u ta saala u damma, &lt;&lt;N ri na̱ a̱guma̱ shi. N ri ni ilyalya ko utugu u gbain o u'wa u va̱ shi. She i zuwa mu zagbain va ama wan!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 3:8" />Urishelima ta̱ɗa̱tsa̱ ta̱, Yahuda riya̱ ta̱. Adama a na adanshi e le nu ulinga u le u ta̱ nla̱ngi na̱ A̱sulazuva, a tara tsugbain tsa̱ yi ili shi e esu a̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 3:9" />Adama a na urewesu u le u ge'eto le ta̱. A ta yuwusan unusu u le a alanga eteshe tso Sodom, oo sokosu shi. A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a ta cina le! O ronoo ta̱ aciyele iwuya. <verse eid="ISA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 3:10" />Dammai a̱za̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱ u ta̱ da̱na̱ lafiya ne ele, adama a na a ta lyuwa atsupu e melen me le. <verse eid="ISA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 3:11" />A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a ta cina za vi iwuya! Iwuya i ta cina le! Ili i na ekere e le a yuwain a̱yi ɗa aa yuwaan le. <verse eid="ISA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 3:12" />Ama a̱ va̱, muwun n ɗa moo ɓongishi le, a̱ma̱ci a ɗa waru aa yuwusan tsugbain tse le. Ayya ama a̱ va̱, aza a na oo ronuso ɗu aɗanga a̱ ta̱ pusa̱sun ɗu, a ta zuwusa ɗu a ɓatsasa ure. <verse eid="ISA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 3:13" />A̱sulazuva a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ ta̱ na adanshi a̱ ɗu uba̱ta̱ wu uge'etosu, a̱yi ɗa wee ge'eto nɗa. <verse eid="ISA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 3:14" />A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ na adanshi a nda a aci a mbara na azagbain a ama a̱ yi: &lt;&lt;A̱ɗu ɗa i lungusa̱i uɗuma̱ u ina̱bi, itana i na i usai a 'wa va alambi a̱ ta̱ a 'wa ɗu. <verse eid="ISA 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 3:15" />Nye i zuwai yaa minjirisa ama a̱ va̱ yaa gburusa̱ urewesu wa alambi?&gt;&gt; Zagbain ɗa dammai, A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva. <verse eid="ISA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 3:16" />A̱sulazuva a damma ta̱, &lt;&lt; A̱ma̱ci a̱ Sihiyona a̱ ta̱ na aciyogbamu, a yuwusan mmalu na̱ yinlu mishin, a̱ a̱ka̱nla̱ ne esu a̱ wulumusa̱ a dasasa ana u ta̱ ta̱ na̱ nshingi a yuwusan ilama a ana e le. <verse eid="ISA 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 3:17" />Adama o ndolo A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na apinyo a aci a̱ a̱ma̱ci a Sihiyona, A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ ka̱mba̱to aci e le ogbondo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 3:18" />O urana u ndolo A̱sulazuva a ta kasa a̱ma̱ci a̱ Urishelima nu ulobonu u le, nshingi ma ana n le ni ili i tsusheli ya aci e le ni iliyinlu oroci o woto. <verse eid="ISA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 3:19" />Ni iliyatsuvu na̱ nshingi na apalutsu, <verse eid="ISA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 3:20" />no okokolo na akani a ana ni igbakala ni ikuluba ya aturare ni ilawo i le, <verse eid="ISA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 3:21" />na̱ nkawani mu urotsu ma akatsu na̱ nkawani n vunu, <verse eid="ISA 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 3:22" />na̱ a̱tugu a sa'ani e le na̱ a̱tugu o uga'an e le na apalutsu ni itsa̱n, <verse eid="ISA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 3:23" />na amuna e lelele na̱ a̱tugu o okoro ni igele ni i showe.<verse eid="ISA 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 3:24" />O una̱ u ma̱guru she ushamu u ɗa wa̱a̱ da̱na̱ lo, o una̱ u gbakala she amunga, o una̱ wa̱ a̱nji a maɗava ma sa'ani she ogbondo, waru o una̱ wa̱ a̱tugu e ikebe she akashi, o una̱ wu ulobonu she urotsu. <verse eid="ISA 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 3:25" />Ali a̱ wu a̱ ta̱ kuwa̱ na̱ matsun me pe'eni, a̱za̱ o uvon a̱ wu waru a̱tsuma̱ o uvon. <verse eid="ISA 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 3:26" />Na̱ntsu va̱ yi ta yuwan mesun na̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu. Wa̱wa̱wa̱ ɗa wa̱a̱ da̱nu e iɗa.<verse eid="ISA 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ISA 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 4:1" />O urana u ndolo a̱ma̱ci e cindere e te reme vali ta̱ a̱vu a damma, &lt;&lt;Tsu ta lyuwa ilyalya i tsu reve tsu yuwaan aciya̱tsu itana. A̱yi de lyawa e ɗesu tsu na ala a̱ wu. Vu tawa tsu wono!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eten a̱ A̱sulazuva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 4:2" />O urana u ndolo Ototopi a̱ A̱sulazuva a ta yuwan ulobonu na̱ tsugbain, waru umatsun wi iɗa'a u to o'wo ili ya awayo ni ili i sa'ani ya aza a Isra'ila a na a pasai. <verse eid="ISA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 4:3" />Aza a na a pasai a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Sihiyona, aza a na a buwai a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima, e te ɗe le aza a akiza, aza a na suru a ɗanai ala e le aza na a̱ ri wuma a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima. <verse eid="ISA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 4:4" />A mantsa'a Zagbain ta̱ za̱'wa̱ a̱shinda̱ a̱ a̱ma̱ci a Sihiyona, u ta tasa adaɓa a mpasa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima na̱ ruhu vu uge'etosu na̱ ruhu va akina. <verse eid="ISA 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 4:5" />Reve A̱sulazuva aa yuwan eleshe nu urana zuva Masasan ma̱ Sihiyona suru na aza a na oo ɓolotosu ɗe. Na ayin waru a̱vu u yuwan mikyon ne ekan a akina. Amayun tsugbain tsa̱ yi tsu ta̱ ɓa̱ru iɗa suru. <verse eid="ISA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 4:6" />Tsugbain tsa̱ yi tsu to o'wo oogodo a na aa ca ululu a mantsa mo usuɗawu wu urana, nu ukafata nu upa'atan u wunla̱ ni iro'i.<verse eid="ISA 4:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ISA 5" />
  <para style="s">Ishipa yu uɗuma̱ u ina̱bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 5:1" />Lyawa n canaa icigi i va̱ ishipa adama o uɗuma̱ u ina̱bi wa̱ yi. Icigi i va̱ i shi ta̱ nu uɗuma̱ u ina̱bi wu umuli a̱ nge'en ma aagaɗi. <verse eid="ISA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 5:2" />U ka̱pa̱ yi ta̱ reve wu tawa atali, a̱vu wu shuwa̱ ataci a ina̱bi a sa'ani. Reve u suwa pe aburu e ipiri, a̱vu waru u ka̱pa̱ uba̱ta̱ u mapisha ma̱ ina̱bi. Reve u zuwa okolo u tsura̱ ina̱bi sa'ani, agba a̱vu u matsan ina̱bi vu una. <verse eid="ISA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 5:3" />&lt;&lt;Gogo nda a̱ɗu aza a na a̱ ri nden Urishelima na ama a Yahuda, ge'eto numu nu uɗuma̱ u ina̱bi u va̱. <verse eid="ISA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 5:4" />Ili i ro i ta̱ lo i na n shi a yuwaan uɗuma̱ u ina̱bi u va̱ i na i la'ai i na n yuwaan niyi? Ana n zuwai okolo n tsura̱ ina̱bi sa'ani, nye i zuwai u matsain ina̱bi vu una? <verse eid="ISA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 5:5" />Gogo n ta damma ɗu ili i na maa yuwan nu uɗuma̱ u ina̱bi u va̱. N ta tawa yi ugeshete wa̱ yi, a̱vu gba a̱ rukutsa̱ yi. N to polo uɓaɓu wa̱ yi, a̱vu gba a dadasa yi. <verse eid="ISA 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 5:6" />N to o'woto yi ili ye pere, oo koɗo ko aa cimba yi shi, reve ma̱lyo na awanda a shiwan pe. A̱vu n zuwa eleshe a̱ kuɗa̱ o ro'o pe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 5:7" />Adama a na uɗuma̱ wa̱ ina̱bi wa̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva iɗa ya Isra'ila i ɗa, ama a Yahuda waru ele ɗa a̱sha̱ a na u shuwa̱i na waa uwwusa uyo'o u le. U zuwa ta̱ okolo we ene umatsun wa amayun, o una̱ u ndolo she wocosu wu mpasa, u zuwa ta̱ okolo we ene a̱ɓula̱, o una̱ u ndolo she mesun ma̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱.<verse eid="ISA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱tsuma̱lima̱ nu uge'etosu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 5:8" />A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a ta cina aza a na a̱a̱ da̱shishi aciyele 'wa a̱ tyo a 'wa ni iɗa a̱ tyo e iɗa hali ko ure u buwa adama a nanza shi, she a̱ɗu goon a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa'a.<verse eid="ISA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 5:9" />A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a kucina ta̱ a atsuvu a̱ va̱, &lt;&lt;Amayun 'wa na̱ a̱bunda̱ o to o'wo ofoli, 'wa gbagbain sa'ani sa'ani babu za na a̱a̱ da̱nu pe. <verse eid="ISA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 5:10" />Uɗuma̱ u ina̱bi wu uritowu kupa u ta matsan bat ta̱li goon. Waru nkundatsu kupa mi icu'un n ta matsan makundatsu ma̱ ta̱ goon.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 5:11" />A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a ta cina aza a na a̱a̱ 'yosun na̱ wasasa e izami i ma̱ra̱, aza a na ayin a tsu ɓatsa hali she na̱ ma̱ra̱ ma̱ tsura̱ le. <verse eid="ISA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 5:12" />Aza a na a̱ ri ni ikumburu i le ni igaraya ni iwakacau, ni igbala na̱ ma̱ra̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱buki. Agba a tara ili i na A̱sulazuva a yuwain ili i ro shi, waru a ca yi tsugbain a̱tsuma̱ e ili i na aa yuwusan shi ko ee ene ulinga we ekere a̱ yi shi. <verse eid="ISA 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 5:13" />Adama o ndolo a̱ ta̱ pura̱ ama a̱ va̱ nu uvon adama o ulambu wu urevu u ndolo. Azagbain e le a̱ ta̱ kuwa̱ na ambulu, akapi a ama waru na akuli. <verse eid="ISA 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 5:14" />Adama o ndolo ukwisa̱ u da̱shi ta̱ maluwa a̱vu u kpa̱tu'wa̱ una̱ wa̱ yi babu a̱tyo, azagbain a̱ Urishelima na akapi a ama a̱ ta̱ cipa̱ a̱ tyo pe, oɓolo na̱ a̱za̱ e elemu pe. <verse eid="ISA 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 5:15" />Ne ɗa a̱a̱ ka̱ɗa̱to vaɗilima̱ suru, aza a aciyogbamu waru o sowo wono. <verse eid="ISA 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 5:16" />Agba A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a̱ ta̱ tsura̱ tsugbain adama a amayun a̱ yi. A̱sula̱ a akiza o to roco a̱yi za va akiza ɗa o ulinga wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ a̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 5:17" />Reve mukyokyon n yuwan alyuna pe tsu uba̱ta̱ wa alyuna u le, omocin waru a ta lyuwa ilyalya o okongo a̱ a̱za̱ o utsuru. <verse eid="ISA 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 5:18" />A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a ta cina aza a na oo ronuso unusu na ala e epen, she damma na amunga e keke vi ido, <verse eid="ISA 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 5:19" />aza a na aa dansa, &lt;&lt;Lyawa A̱sula̱ a̱ jika̱, lyawa u jika̱ ulinga wa̱ yi adama tse ene yi. Lyawa ifoɓi ya Akiza a Isra'ila i rawa adama tsu reve yi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 5:20" />A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a ta cina aza a na ee ɗesu iwuya isa'ani, isa'ani waru iwuya. Waru i ta̱ ka̱mbuwusa̱ irumbu ekan, ekan waru irumbu. Aza a na waru a̱a̱ ka̱mbuwusa̱ okono peme, peme waru okono. <verse eid="ISA 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 5:21" />A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a ta cina aza a na aa tarasa e esu e le a̱ ta̱ nu ugbozu nu urevu a̱ yindi i le. <verse eid="ISA 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 5:22" />A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a ta cina ngono mo oso m ma̱ra̱, na̱ ngono moɓolo m ma̱ra̱, <verse eid="ISA 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 5:23" />aza a na aa lyawusa a̱za̱ o unusu nu u'ushishi wu utosu wu una̱, a̱vu a putsa aza a na a̱ ri nu unusu shi mejege me le. <verse eid="ISA 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 5:24" />Adama o ndolo cine elentsu a akina o tsu soɗu tsi'yuwa̱ cine waru ogozo o u'yewu a̱ tsu puwa̱n a̱tsuma̱ a akina, ne ɗa aralu e le aa shama, reve yipa̱lu i le yi 'yawan tsa̱ ma̱buta̱, adama a na a 'yuwain wila̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva waru a tara adanshi a Za va Akiza a Isra'ila ili i ro shi. <verse eid="ISA 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 5:25" />Adama o ndolo upan wa̱ A̱sulazuva u puna̱ ta̱ a aci a ama a̱ yi, waru u 'ya̱sa̱n ta̱ ukere wa̱ yi a̱vu u ga̱la̱ le. A̱vu nsasan n jinga̱ɗa̱, reve lipu va̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱ o o'wo tse everi e memere me re. Suru ni ili i nda upan wa̱ yi u koto shi, ukere wa̱ yi u buwa ta̱ wuba̱ruwu. <verse eid="ISA 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 5:26" />U ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱sa̱n atuta adama a nɗa ma alanga, reve wi ivula̱a̱ aza a na a̱ ri o ukosu wu uvaɗi, ka̱lyuwa̱ gba a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ ni ilaɗi lon. <verse eid="ISA 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 5:27" />Ko za a̱tsuma̱ e le a̱a̱ kuna̱ ko u ta̱ɗa̱tsa̱ shi, ko za ta̱ a̱a̱ gba̱ɗi ko u lantsa shi. Waru ko gbakala a̱a̱ ba̱ɗa̱ shi ko sheru va atan aa taɓa shi. <verse eid="ISA 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 5:28" />Aya e le a̱ ta̱ ucembeɗu, tan le unyu'un, okotsu e ido i le tsi irumu, a̱ga̱nda̱mu e ikeke yi ido i le tsa̱ lipa̱. <verse eid="ISA 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 5:29" />Yorori i le tsa kamu, o tso oruwo ta̱ tsa̱ muwun mi ikamu, a̱ tsu gugwa̱ ta̱ reve e reme ili reve a tanu, agba ko za aa gura wawa le shi. <verse eid="ISA 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 5:30" />O urana u ndolo a̱ ta̱ gugwa̱ a aci a̱ Urishelima tsu uɗyo u mala. Waru na̱ vuma ka̱lyuwa̱ iɗa, u ta̱ gba e ene irumbu na̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱, waru eleshe a ta zuwa ekan o o'wo irumbu.<verse eid="ISA 5:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ISA 6" />
  <para style="s">Ɗewu va Ishaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 6:1" />A aa'wan a na Mogono Uziya kuwa̱i, me ene ta̱ Zagbain nden o ootogu o tsugono na̱ tsugbain lon, a̱vu elentsu a̱ a̱tugu a̱ yi o shiton a̱a̱'isa̱. <verse eid="ISA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 6:2" />Reve nan serafin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ele ili i wuma ya zuva i ɗa i na i ri a madala</char></note> e isawan zuva va̱ yi koyan ɗa ne evelu a̱ ta̱li, ne evelu e re a ɗa a palai urewesu u le, ne ejere a ɗa waru a palai ana e le, ne ejere a ɗa waru a tsu 'yawaan. <verse eid="ISA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 6:3" />Reve e reme nɗelei, &lt;&lt;Akiza, akiza, akiza, A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva! Uvaɗi suru u shiwan ta̱ na̱ tsugbain tsa̱ yi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 6:4" />Reve adama o ucira u mesun wu ɗyo le a̱vu akpata a̱ na̱ntsu a̱ jinga̱ɗa, a̱vu a̱a̱'isa̱'a̱ a shiwan na̱ mikyon.<verse eid="ISA 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 6:5" />Reve n sala, &lt;&lt;A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a cina mu ta̱! Aɗa a̱ va̱ o koto ta̱! Adama a na a̱mu vuma ɗa na ri nu una̱ wi idaba, waru n ta̱ nden e memere ma ama a na na̱ le ri idaba, adama a na esu a̱ va̱ e ene ta̱ Mogono, A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 6:6" />Reve za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a nan serafin wu 'yawan a̱ ta̱wa̱ ya̱'a̱ va̱ na akinkina a na a̱ ri na akina o ukere wa̱ yi, za na u tarai a masa'a na akana. <verse eid="ISA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 6:7" />A̱vu u ju'wa̱n una̱ u va̱ na̱ a̱yi reve u damma, &lt;&lt; A̱yi ɗa nda, ili i nda i ju'wa̱in una̱ wa̱ wu, a tawa ta̱ unusu wa̱ wu, waru a tara ta̱ ume wu unusu wa̱ wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 6:8" />Reve mu uwwa uɗyo wu Zagbain a dansa, &lt;&lt;Zane ma̱a̱ lyungu? Zane ɗa a̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ adama a̱ tsu?&gt;&gt; Reve n damma, &lt;&lt;A̱mu ɗa nda. Lyungu mu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 6:9" />Reve u damma, &lt;&lt;'Ya̱wa̱ vu damma ama a nda: &lt;Yu uwwusa, agba babu tsura̱ urevu. Ye eneshe, agba babu reve.&gt; <verse eid="ISA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 6:10" />Zuwa okolo a ama a nda a̱ da̱mba̱lya̱, atsuvu e le waru ume, esu e le waru a̱ rumba̱na̱. A̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱ e ene ne esu e le, a uwwa na atsuvu e le, e reve no okolo e le, reve a vadala a̱vu a̱ ka̱mba̱to le gbaga wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 6:11" />Reve me ece, &lt;&lt;Hali a̱ tyo mantsa ma̱ ne Zagbain?&gt;&gt; A̱vu u usu, &lt;&lt;Hali she ni ilyuci yo o'wo ofoli babu za na a̱a̱ da̱nu pe, hali she na̱ 'wa vo o'wo babu ko vuma, iɗa waru yo o'wo ofoli, <verse eid="ISA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 6:12" />hali she na̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ gba̱ra̱ koyan ɗa alanga, reve a lyawa iɗa'a suru suru. <verse eid="ISA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 6:13" />Ko na̱ shi za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a kupa a ɗa buwai pe, a̱ ta̱ da̱shi kula̱to yi. Amma u to o'wo tsu ɗanga oku aza a na nkyun n le n tsu pasa ko na̱ shi o koɗo le, ne ɗa ugundo wa akiza woo o'wo ikyun e iɗa'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 6:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ISA 7" />
  <para style="s">Iroci ya Imanuwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 7:1" />A mantsa ma na Ahaz ulobo wa̱ Jotam ulobo wa Uziya u shi mogono ma Yahuda, reve Rezin mogono ma Aram na̱ Peka ulobo wa Remaliya mogono ma Isra'ila a gawan adama a yuwan uvon na̱ Urishelima, agba a gura lyuwa yi shi.<verse eid="ISA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 7:2" />Ana a dammai u'wa wa̱ Da̱wuda, &lt;&lt;Aram ɓolo ta̱ aciya̱yi na̱ Ifiramu,&gt;&gt; ɗaɗa okolo a Ahaz na ama a̱ yi e je'ein cine ɗanga va̱ a̱a̱rumbu tsu jinga̱ɗa̱ nu upepu.<verse eid="ISA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 7:3" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma Ishaya, &lt;&lt;Uta̱ vu ga'an na̱ Ahaz, a̱vu nu ulobo wa̱ wu Shiya Jashub, o ukosu wu uyene u Mala mo Gon, o ure a̱ tyo Uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱za̱ a̱ Wuza̱'u. <verse eid="ISA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 7:4" />Vu damma yi, &lt;Yuwan ugbozu, vu voton ugbozu she vu uwwa wovon wan. She vu kuɗa okolo adama o usuɗuwu wa akina a̱ mugba̱ta̱ n re nda wan, adama a̱ ma̱puna̱ mo upan ma̱ Rezin na̱ Aram na̱ za vu ulobo wa Remaliya wan.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 7:5" />Adama a na Aram na̱ Ifiramu nu ulobo wa Remaliya o foɓoo ɗu ta̱ iwuya, a dansa, <verse eid="ISA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 7:6" />&lt;&lt;Lyawa tsu ka̱nda̱ruwa̱i Yahuda nu uvon, lyawa tsu lyuwa niyi tsu ne'eshen niyi, a̱vu tsu zuwai ulobo wa Tabeyel wo o'wo mogono ma̱ yi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 7:7" />Suru na̱ ne apa nda ili i na A̱sulazuva Zagbain dammai, &lt;&lt; &lt;Ili i nda yee isawan shi waru waa yuwan shi, <verse eid="ISA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 7:8" />adama a na Dimaska ɗa zagbain va Aram, zagbain va Dimaska waru Rezin ɗa. A̱tsuma̱ a a'wan kupota̱li no ozo o ton a ta kacara Ifiramu hali na a̱a̱ da̱shi buwa iɗa shi. <verse eid="ISA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 7:9" />Aci a Ifiramu Samariya ɗa, waru aci a Samariya ulobo wa Remaliya u ɗa. Ni yi isawaton okolo a̱ ɗu shi, yaa gura isawan shi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 7:10" />Reve A̱sulazuva a yuwisan adanshi na̱ Ahaz, <verse eid="ISA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 7:11" />&lt;&lt;Ve ece A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ wu iroci, ko diga uba̱ta̱ u na u la'ai a̱ru'un ko ɗe zuva na la'ai alanga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 7:12" />Amma Ahaz damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Mee ece shi, waru ma̱a̱ lyungwa̱ A̱sulazuva shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 7:13" />A̱vu Ishaya damma, &lt;&lt;Uwwai u'wa wa̱ Da̱wuda! Ankuri a ama a na ya̱a̱ lyungusa̱ u rawa ne shi? I ciga ta̱ i lyungwa̱ ankuri a̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱ fo? <verse eid="ISA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 7:14" />Adama o ndolo Zagbain na aciya̱yi u ta ca ɗu iroci, usheli u na koto u revei vali shi u ta yuwan a̱a̱tsuma̱, a̱vu u matsan ulobo, a̱vu u ca yi aala Imanuwe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Urevu wa Imanuwe a̱yi ɗa &lt;&lt;A̱sula̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱tsu.&gt;&gt;</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 7:15" />U to sowo maani ma̱ a̱ga̱ɓa̱ ni ishiki, a mantsa ma na wee reve 'yuwan iwuya a̱vu u ɗangwa isa'ani. <verse eid="ISA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 7:16" />Agba kafu mantsa ma na ulobo'o wee reve 'yuwan iwuya a̱vu u ɗangwa isa'ani, ngono n re nda n na maa casu wu wovon a̱bunda̱ lo'on nɗa n le n to o'wo ofoli. <verse eid="ISA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 7:17" />A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ wu na ama a̱ wu nu u'wa wa dada va̱ wu cu'un vu rana na koto a yuwain shi diga a mantsa ma na Ifiramu kakasai na̱ Yahuda, u ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ mogono ma Asiriya!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 7:18" />O urana u ndolo A̱sulazuva a̱ ula̱a̱ ayun a na a̱ ri o utyo wu ɗolu va Masar ni ishiki yi iɗa ya Asiriya. <verse eid="ISA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 7:19" />Reve a̱ ta̱wa̱ suru a̱ va̱la̱ a̱ ka̱ri na̱ pa'atan va atali no ogozo a awanda nu usowoto u mini suru. <verse eid="ISA 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 7:20" />O urana u ndolo Zagbain o to kopo utanu diga mavada mo Uɗolu'u, Mogono ma Asiriya, u linga na̱ a̱yi u puna aaci a̱ wu ne eleme a ana a̱ wu, a̱vu waru u tawa ntsuka̱ ma̱ wu fo. <verse eid="ISA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 7:21" />O urana u ndolo vuma ta zuwa ma̱dindim ma̱ ta̱ ni ikyon i re. <verse eid="ISA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 7:22" />Agba adama a maani ma̱ a̱bunda̱ ma na aa casu, u to sowo maani ma̱ a̱ga̱ɓa̱. Na amayun aza a na a pasai pe e iɗa'a suru o to sowo maani ma̱ a̱ga̱ɓa̱ ni ishiki. <verse eid="ISA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 7:23" />O urana u ndolo, uba̱ta̱ biti uba̱ta̱ u na u shi na ataci ukpakukupa (1,000), a na a rawai shekel azurufa ukpakukupa (1,000), u to o'wo uba̱ta̱ u ma̱lyo na awanda. <verse eid="ISA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 7:24" />Ama a̱ ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱ ɗe na̱ tan na aya adama a na iɗa'a i ta shiwan na̱ ma̱lyo na awanda. <verse eid="ISA 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 7:25" />Agba agaɗi a na a̱ shi a cimbusa nu ugalatsu, i buwa a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ ɗe shi o wovon u ma̱lyo na awanda, amma o to o'wo uba̱ta̱ u na a lyawai inan ni ikyon waru a̱a̱ da̱na̱ a agara.<verse eid="ISA 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ISA 8" />
  <para style="s">Asuriya itana yu ulinga ya̱ A̱sulazuva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 8:1" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma mu, &lt;&lt;Tara aakpata e iɗana a gbain, a̱vu vu yuwan ɗe iɗana na̱ maɗanutsu ma ndana, Za va Maha-Shalal-Hash-Baz.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na̱ Tsuyahuda urevu wa aala a nda a̱yi ɗa &lt;&lt;A̱a̱ riya̱a̱ nu uvon ni ilaɗi reve a̱ pura̱ itana i le&gt;&gt;</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 8:2" />Waru n te ɗe Uriya ganu na̱ Zakariya ulobo wa Jeberekiya aza a na maa gura zuwaa ucira o o'wo mu esu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 8:3" />Reve n von na̱ ka va̱, vumava̱sula̱, a̱vu u yuwan a̱a̱tsuma̱ ɗaɗa u matsain ulobo. A̱vu A̱sulazuva a damma mu, &lt;&lt;Ca yi aala Maha-Shalal-Hash-Baz. <verse eid="ISA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 8:4" />Kafu ulobo'o u reve cine waa damma &lt;Dada va̱&gt; ko &lt;Mma va̱,&gt; mogono ma Asuriya ma̱ ta̱ pura̱ utsuru wa Dimaska na̱ za va Samariya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 8:5" />A̱vu A̱sulazuva a yuwisan adanshi na̱ a̱mu, <verse eid="ISA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 8:6" />&lt;&lt;Adama a na ama a nda a 'yuwain mini ma̱ Shilowa ma na mee yeneshe ben, a̱vu a yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ na̱ Rezin nu ulobo wa Remaliya waru, <verse eid="ISA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 8:7" />adama o ndolo a̱yi ɗa nda, a̱mu Zagbain n ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ le na̱ mini ma gbain mo ucira mo Uɗolu wa̱ Yufireti, mogono ma Asuriya oɓolo nu ucira u tsugbain tsa̱ yi suru. U to shiton uba̱ta̱ suru hali u pasa nge'en ma̱ yi suru, <verse eid="ISA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 8:8" />reve u yene a uwa a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda, u ta shiwan o utula̱i pe hali u rawa a̱ yinlu. Evelu a̱ wuba̱ruwu a̱ yi a ta pala a̱tyo e iɗa ya̱ wu, Imanuwe!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 8:9" />Ɓolotoi a̱ɗu ama a nɗa n ro a̱vu o una ɗu! Poloi atsuvu a̱ɗu nɗa ma alanga. Foɓoi uvon, agba o to kototo ɗu! Foɓoi uvon, a̱vu o una ɗu! <verse eid="ISA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 8:10" />Sa̱la̱la̱i agba u to o'wo pere, yuwain adanshi, agba wee isawan shi, adama a na A̱sula̱ a̱ ta̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱tsu.<verse eid="ISA 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wovon wa̱ A̱sula̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 8:11" />A̱sulazuva a yuwan ta̱ adanshi na̱ a̱mu nu ukere wu ucira wa̱ yi oɓolo na̱ a̱mu a ɓarasa mu she n kuru ure wa ama a nda wan. U damma ta̱, <verse eid="ISA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 8:12" />&lt;&lt;She vu usu vu ɗe ili i na suru ama a nda ee ɗesu nsata, nsata wan. She vu uwwa wovon wi ili i na ama a nda aa uwwusa wovon wan waru she vu suma yi wan. <verse eid="ISA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 8:13" />A̱mu A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a̱yi ɗa za va akiza, a̱yi ɗa vaa uwwa wovon, a̱yi ɗa za na vaa suma. <verse eid="ISA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 8:14" />U to o'wo a̱a̱'isa̱, agba e ekere a 'wa re va Isra'ila u to o'wo le aatali o uta̱ɗa̱tsa̱sa̱ na aatali a na a̱ tsu ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ a̱risa̱. Uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Urishelima u to o'wo le maza na̱ yakuru. <verse eid="ISA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 8:15" />Ama na̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱ ta̱ ta̱ɗa̱tsa̱, a̱ ta̱ riya̱ a̱vu a kuɗa, a ta azu le a̱vu e reme le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 8:16" />Guza̱i adanshi a̱ va̱ a̱vu i ca ojoro a̱ va̱ uritosu u va̱. <verse eid="ISA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 8:17" />N to puro A̱sulazuva, za na oo sokosu u'wa wa Yakubu urewesu wa̱ yi. N ta zuwa ucira u va̱ ya̱'a̱ yi.<verse eid="ISA 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 8:18" />A̱mu ɗa nda na̱ muwun n na A̱sulazuva a ca numu. Tso o'wo ta̱ iroci no oroci a tsuɓari a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva, za na ri nden a Masasan ma̱ Sihiyona.<verse eid="ISA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 8:19" />Reve na ama a damma ɗu i 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wo oboci na̱ a̱kwisa̱kwisa̱ aza a na a tsu yuwan adanshi tsa̱ ididi na̱ yemenu, ama a̱a̱ bungi e ekere a̱ A̱sula̱ e le shi? Adama a̱ nye a̱ bungishi e ekere a̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱ o una̱ wa aza a wuma? <verse eid="ISA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 8:20" />A̱ bungi uritosu na adanshi a̱ A̱sula̱! Na aa yuwan adanshi adama a adanshi a nda shi, a̱a̱ tsura̱ ekan a wuma u le shi. <verse eid="ISA 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 8:21" />A̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ a agara a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa'a a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ na ambulu. Reve no o sowo ambulu, a ta yuwan upan lon a̱vu a yuwan adanshi a vama e ekere o mogono me le na̱ A̱sula̱ e le. A̱ ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱n urewesu u le a̱ ka̱lyuwa̱ zuva. <verse eid="ISA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 8:22" />Reve a̱ ka̱lyuwa̱ iɗa, reve e ene a̱tsuma̱lima̱ can ni irumbu, mɓa̱la̱ n wovon lon, a̱vu a̱ ca̱co le a̱tsuma̱ e irumbu pici.<verse eid="ISA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ISA 9" />
  <para style="s">A matsaan tsu ta̱ Mawun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 9:1" />Suru na̱ ne, irumbu i to koto uba̱ta̱ wa aza a na a̱ ri nden a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱. Ɗe a̱ca̱pa̱ u ka̱ɗa̱to ta̱ iɗa ya Zebulun ni iɗa ya Nafutali, agba ɗe elime u ta ca Ga̱lili va Atakpaci tsugbain, upasu u na u remei o ure u mala'a mavada mo upasu wa̱ Urudu'u.<verse eid="ISA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 9:2" />Ama a na a̱ ri a mmalu a̱tsuma̱ e irumbu e ene ta̱ ekan a gbain, aza a na a̱ ri nden a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa yi irumbu pici ekan e ikana le ta̱. <verse eid="ISA 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 9:3" />Vu da̱shi iɗa'a a̱bunda̱, vu da̱shi yi ma̱za̱nga̱. A ta yuwusan ma̱za̱nga̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ wu cine ama a tsu yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ a mantsa mo ugasa, cine ama a tsu yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ ne e ne'sheshen ili i na a̱ pura̱i uba̱ta̱ wu uvon. <verse eid="ISA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 9:4" />Adama a na vu kuɗa ta̱ a̱a̱gba̱la̱ a̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ e le na aɗanga a na a̱ ri upaɗalu a avangaci e le, aɗanga a aza a na oo ɓongishi le vu kuɗa le ta̱ tso o urana wa Midiya. <verse eid="ISA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 9:5" />Adama a na atan a̱ soja vu uvon suru na a a̱ ri a mmalu na̱ mesun mo uvon nu utugu u na suru u la̱nga̱i na̱ mpasa, a̱ ta̱ kula̱to yi, o to o'wo mani'in ma madaɓa ma akina. <verse eid="ISA 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 9:6" />Adama a na a matsaan tsu ta̱ mawun, a ca tsu ta̱ ulobo, waru tsugbain tsu ta̱ da̱na̱ o uvangaci wa̱ yi. Waru e te ɗe yi Za va̱ A̱sa̱la̱ va Asalama, A̱sula̱ o Uvon, Dada na ri nu Ukosu shi, Mogono ma̱ Nden ma Asuvu. <verse eid="ISA 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 9:7" />Uda̱shishi u tsugbain tsa̱ yi na̱ nden ma asuvu wa̱a̱ da̱na̱ na̱ a̱tyo shi. U ta yuwan tsugono o ootogu o tsugono tsa̱ Da̱wuda nu uba̱ta̱ u tsugono tsa̱ yi, u ta yuwan yi nu ucira na amayun na̱ a̱ɓula̱ diga a mantsa mo ndolo hali babu ukosu. Ukadu wa̱ A̱sulazuva vo oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a ɗa waa yuwan ne. <verse eid="ISA 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 9:8" />Zagbain lyungu ta̱ na adanshi a aci a Yakubu, reve u riya̱ e ekere a aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="ISA 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 9:9" />Ama'a suru e te reve, Ifiramu na aza a na a̱ ri nden Samariya, aza a na aa dansa nu uvaɗu no okolo o ugbawu, <verse eid="ISA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 9:10" />&lt;&lt;Usaa wo oco ta̱, agba tsu ta suwisa na atali a na e she'ein ulobonu. Ɗanga vu teɗu, o polo le ta̱, agba tsu ta̱ shuwa̱ ɗanga sida o una̱ u le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 9:11" />Agba A̱sulazuva a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n ta̱ a̱za̱ a̱ nla̱ngi a̱ Rezin a aci e le, a̱vu u sato n'yuwatan n le. <verse eid="ISA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 9:12" />Aza a Aram diga asana na aza a Filistiya diga a̱livu o soɗushi ta̱ Isra'ila nu uta̱. Agba ni ili i nda suru, upan wa̱ yi u von shi, ukere wa̱ yi u buwa ta̱ wuba̱ruwu. <verse eid="ISA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 9:13" />Ama'a gba a̱ ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wu za na lapa nle shi, ko a zami A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva. <verse eid="ISA 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 9:14" />Adama o ndolo A̱sulazuva o to koɗo Isra'ila aaci na̱ wizan, na ashuwashuwa na apumpu urana u ta̱. <verse eid="ISA 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 9:15" />Mbara na ama a gbagbain ele ɗa aci, ama̱sula̱ a na o ritosu epen ele ɗa wiza'an. <verse eid="ISA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 9:16" />Aza a na oo ronuso ama a nda aɗanga a̱ ta̱ pususa̱n le, waru aza a na oo ronuso'o a̱ ra̱pula̱ ta̱. <verse eid="ISA 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 9:17" />Adama o ndolo a ɗa Zagbain ri na̱ maluwa mo olobo e le shi, ko we ene iliyali yi mkpa'an na̱ nruna̱ shi. Adama a na koyan ɗa aa uwwusa wovon wa̱ A̱sula̱ shi, a yuwusan iwuya, una̱ suru a yuwusan adanshi a tsulo. Agba ni ili i nda suru, upan wa̱ yi u von shi, ukere wa̱ yi u buwa ta̱ wuba̱ruwu. <verse eid="ISA 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 9:18" />Adama a na iwuya i ta̱ ma̱kula̱ cine vu revei akina. U ta tamasa ma̱lyo na awanda, u ta daɓusa a̱a̱rumbu e iɗanga yi irumbu, reve mikyon m gbodolo a gawan. <verse eid="ISA 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 9:19" />Upan wa̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva u ta̱ kula̱to iɗa'a, reve ama'a tsa mani'in ma madaɓa ma akina, ko za aa lyawa za va̱ yi shi. <verse eid="ISA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 9:20" />O ukere usa'ani a ta tamashi nu uta̱, agba suru na̱ ne a ta buwa na ambulu, o ukere ugula̱ a ta tama agba a̱a̱ cuwa̱n shi. Vuma suru ta tama mawun ma̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 9:21" />Manase ta tama Ifiramu, Ifiramu waru ta tama Manase, suru nle a ta vadala nla̱ngi na̱ Yahuda. Suru na̱ ne, upan wa̱ yi u von shi, ukere wa̱ yi u buwa ta̱ wuba̱ruwu.<verse eid="ISA 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ISA 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 10:1" />A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a ta cina aza a na aa zuwusa wila̱ we epepen, aza a na aa ɗanasa wila̱ wi iɓongi, <verse eid="ISA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 10:2" />adama a putsa alambi uge'etosu wa amayun, reve a putsa alambi a ama a̱ va̱ ni ili i na i ri za le, a̱a̱ purusa̱ nruna̱ waru aa ususa ili yi mkpa'an. <verse eid="ISA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 10:3" />Nye yaa yuwan o urana wu uge'etosu, a mantsa ma na ukototosu woo uta̱ diga alanga? Ya zane yaa suma izami yi ikambi? Te yaa lyawa utsuru u ɗu? <verse eid="ISA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 10:4" />Ko ili yaa buwa shi she uka̱ɗatosu a̱tsuma̱ a aza a na a̱ ri o u'wa wa ali a alanga ko a̱ riyisa̱ a̱tsuma̱ a aza a na a paɗai. Ni ili i nda suru, upan wa̱ yi u von shi, ukere wa̱ yi u buwa ta̱ wuba̱ruwu.<verse eid="ISA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uge'etosu wa̱ A̱sula̱ a aci a Asuriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 10:5" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a damma ta̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a ta cina aza a Asiriya, aaɗanga o upan a̱ va̱, aaɗanga a na a̱ ri e ekere e le upan u va̱ u ɗa! <verse eid="ISA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 10:6" />N lyungu yi ta̱ u yuwan nla̱ngi na ama a na aa uwwusa wovon wa̱ A̱sula̱ shi. N zuwa yi ta̱ u riya̱a̱ ama a na aa zuwusa mu upan, u pura̱ itana waru u usa itana, reve waru wu dasa ama tsa̱ ci'in e re. <verse eid="ISA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 10:7" />Agba a̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa u shi ifoɓi ya̱ yi shi, a̱yi ɗa u shi o okolo a̱ yi shi, ifoɓi ya̱ yi i ɗa u kototo, u tasa nɗa na̱ a̱bunda̱. <verse eid="ISA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 10:8" />Adama a na u ta dansa, &lt;Nan yali o uvon a̱ va̱ suru ngono n ɗa shi?&gt; <verse eid="ISA 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 10:9" />&lt;Kaluno la'a ta̱ ko'o Karkemi ucira? Ko Hamat la'a ta̱ Afa ucira? Ko Samariya la'a ta̱ Dimaska ucira? <verse eid="ISA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 10:10" />Cine ukere u va̱ u cinai nɗa n na maa yuwusaan a̱ma̱li a̱ga̱nda̱, nɗa n na a̱ma̱li e le a la'ai a̱za̱ a̱ Urishelima na̱ Samariya, <verse eid="ISA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 10:11" />maa yuwan na̱ Urishelima na̱ a̱ma̱li a̱ yi cine n yuwain na̱ Samariya na̱ a̱ma̱li a̱ yi shi?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 10:12" />Agba na̱ Zagbain oo koto ulinga wa̱ yi suru a aci a Masasan ma̱ Sihiyona na̱ Urishelima, u ta ca mogono ma Asuriya a̱tsuma̱lima̱ adama o ugbawu wa̱ yi na̱ a̱ka̱nla̱ o uvaɗu a̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 10:13" />Adama a na u damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Nu ucira wu ukere u va̱ u ɗa n yuwain ili i nda, waru nu ugbozu u va̱, adama a na n ta̱ nu urevu n tawa ta̱ a̱tyo a nɗa, m pura̱ izuwa i le, tsu za vu ucira ne ɗa n ka̱ɗa̱toi ngono n le. <verse eid="ISA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 10:14" />Cine vuma tsu zuwa ukere a yikinda, ne ɗa ukere u va̱ u rawai o utsuru wu nɗa suru. Cine vuma tsu ɓoloto okowo a na a lyawai, ne ɗa m ɓolotoi nɗa suru, agba ko evelu a lapa shi, ko a̱ kpa̱tu'wa̱ una̱ adama e geshe shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 10:15" />Aaɓau a̱ tsu 'ya̱sa̱n ta̱ aciya̱yi u la'a za na a̱a̱ vuta̱la̱sa̱ yi, ko zarto yuwan uvaɗu u la'a za na aa yuwusan ulinga na̱ a̱yi? She damma aaɗanga a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n za na 'ya̱sa̱n niyi, ko a̱a̱kpa̱mkpa̱la̱ a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n za na ri aaɗanga shi! <verse eid="ISA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 10:16" />Adama o ndolo Zagbain A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a̱ ta̱ lyunguwa̱ a̱soja a gbagbain a Asuriya na̱ mɓa̱la̱ m maramba, a̱tsuma̱ a tsugbain tsa̱ yi tsa ɗa akina a daɓa a̱ ma̱kula̱ tse elentsu a akina. <verse eid="ISA 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 10:17" />Ekan a Isra'ila o to o'wo akina, Za va Akiza va̱ yi to o'wo elentsu a akina. A̱tsuma̱ o urana u ta̱ u ta dala reve u kula̱to awanda a̱ yi na̱ ma̱lyo ma̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 10:18" />Tsugbain tsa̱ a̱rumbu tsa̱ yi na̱ a̱ɗuma̱ o umili a̱ yi u to kototo le suru suru, cine vuma vu ubanakun tsu koto. <verse eid="ISA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 10:19" />Akapi a ɗanga va̱ a̱rumbu va̱ yi o to o'wo wa'a, hali mawun me ke'en ma ta gura kece le.<verse eid="ISA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akapi a aza a Isra'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 10:20" />O urana u ndolo aza a Isra'ila a na a pasai na̱ a̱za̱ o u'wa wa Yakubu a na a pasai, a buwa a zuwaa yi ucira shi za na a̱a̱ ga̱la̱sa̱ le, amma a ta zuwaa A̱sulazuva Za va Akiza va Isra'ila ucira suru suru. <verse eid="ISA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 10:21" />Akapi a na a pasai a̱ ta̱ ka̱mba̱, akapi a Yakubu a̱ ta̱ ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱ Za vu Ucira. <verse eid="ISA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 10:22" />Ko na̱ shi ama a̱ wu, Isra'ila, a yuwan a̱bunda̱ tsa̱ wuyun wu nge'en m mala, akapi a na a pasai ɗa goon a̱a̱ ka̱mba̱. O foɓoo wu ta̱ ɗe ukototosu, ukototosu u na wu ntsaa nuwu na̱ mejege. <verse eid="ISA 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 10:23" />Adama a na Zagbain, A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a ɗa a tarai u ta̱ ta̱wa̱ nu ukosu wi iɗa'a suru suru, cine u zuwai waa yuwan.<verse eid="ISA 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 10:24" />Adama o ndolo apa nda ili i na Zagbain, A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai, &lt;&lt;A̱ɗu ama a̱ va̱ a na i ri nden a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Sihiyona, she yu uwwa wovon wa aza a Asuriya wan, aza a na a̱a̱ ga̱la̱sa̱ ɗu na aɗanga waru a̱a̱ vuta̱la̱sa̱a̱ ɗu asuɗu e le cine aza a Masar a yuwain. <verse eid="ISA 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 10:25" />Aa jima shi, upan u va̱ e ekere a̱ ɗu u to koto reve upan u va̱ u puna̱ a̱ tyo ya̱'a̱ le u kototo le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 10:26" />A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a ta faba le na asuɗu, she damma mantsa ma na wu ga̱la̱i aza a Midiya a aatali a̱ Oreb. Waru u ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱n aaɗanga a̱ yi zuva mala, cine u yuwain a̱tsuma̱ a Masar. <verse eid="ISA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 10:27" />O urana u ndolo n ta tawaa ɗu itana yu ume i le diga a avangaci a̱ ɗu, a̱gba̱la̱ e le waru diga a̱ yinlu i ɗu. A̱a̱gba̱la̱'a̱ u ta kuɗa adama a na i yuwain mgbain. <verse eid="ISA 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 10:28" />A uwa ta̱ a̱ lyuci va Ayiyat, o utula̱i Migiron, a̱vu a zuwa itana i le a Mikimash. <verse eid="ISA 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 10:29" />Reve a pasalai upasata, a̱vu a damma, &lt;&lt;Tsu ta̱ va̱la̱ a Geba na ayin.&gt;&gt; Aza a Rama e je'en ta̱ lipu, aza a Gibiya va Shawulu a suma ta̱. <verse eid="ISA 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 10:30" />Saalai, ama a Galim! Polo atsuvu Layisha! Anatot iliyali! <verse eid="ISA 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 10:31" />Aza a Madimena a̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ e ilaɗi i na aa la'a, aza a Gebim a suma ta̱ adama a la'a. <verse eid="ISA 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 10:32" />O urana u nda gan a̱ ta̱ ta̱ra̱nu ne'en a Nob, a̱ ta̱ jinga̱ɗa̱ likuku le e ekere a masasan mo Usheli wa̱ Sihiyona, a aagaɗi a̱ Urishelima. <verse eid="ISA 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 10:33" />Uwwai nda, Zagbain A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva u to koɗo eten a gbagbain nu ucira u wovon. Ɗanga vu uga'an o to polo le, aza a na a la'ai uga'an waru o to koɗo le. <verse eid="ISA 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 10:34" />U to koɗo a̱a̱rumbu e iɗanga yi irumbu na aaɓau, waru Lebanon ta̱ riya̱ e ekere a̱ A̱sula̱ o Uvon.<verse eid="ISA 10:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ISA 11" />
  <para style="s">Eten diga e ikyun ya̱ Yese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 11:1" />Ototopi a̱ ta̱ uta̱ diga a̱ a̱a̱gunli a̱ Yese, diga a aralu a̱ yi eten a ta matsan mawun. <verse eid="ISA 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 11:2" />Ruhu va̱ A̱sulazuva ta̱ cipa̱a̱ yi, Ruhu vu ugbozu na̱ Ruhu vu urevu, Ruhu va̱ a̱sa̱la̱ nu ucira, Ruhu vu uguru na̱ za vu urevu wa̱ A̱sulazuva, <verse eid="ISA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 11:3" />waru u ta̱ da̱na̱ na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ o wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva. Wee ge'eto na̱ yindi ye esu shi waru waa paɗa ugana ni ili i na atsuvu a̱ yi a uwwai shi. <verse eid="ISA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 11:4" />Amma na̱ a̱ɓula̱ a ɗa wee ge'eto alambi, na amayun a ɗa waru wee geshe ili ya aza a na a̱ ri nu ucira shi e iɗa'a. Na adanshi o usuɗuwu o una̱ wa̱ yi a ɗa wa̱a̱ ga̱la̱ iɗa, na̱ wivuwun wu una̱ wa̱ yi u ɗa woo una a̱za̱ e iwuya. <verse eid="ISA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 11:5" />A̱ɓula̱ na amayun a̱ yi o o o'wo tsa gbakala uka̱nda̱ruwu e ikyun ya̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 11:6" />Mekerenkesu ma̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ oɓolo na̱ mokyokyon, uta̱su waru u to von oɓolo na̱ megbele, ma̱dindim ma̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ oɓolo na̱ kamu na̱ ma̱dindim ma̱ lipu, reve mawun ma guɓa le. <verse eid="ISA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 11:7" />Nan na̱ biya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Biya nama vu una ro ɗa na ri nu ujaaru</char></note> a ta yuwan alyuna uba̱ta̱ u ta̱, waru muwun n le n to von uba̱ta̱ u ta̱. A̱vu kamu tama anlya tsu nan. <verse eid="ISA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 11:8" />Mereɓu ma ta yuwan uro zuzu na̱ wa̱cin wu ruku, mawun ma ta zuwa ukere wa̱ yi a̱ wa̱cin wa aagbaji. <verse eid="ISA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 11:9" />Babu ili i wuma i na yaa ca nanza a̱tsuma̱lima̱ ko u kototo nanza a masasan ma akiza ma̱ va̱, adama a na uvaɗi u ta̱ da̱na̱ tapu nu urevu wa̱ A̱sulazuva, cine vu revei mini mo tsu shiton mala.<verse eid="ISA 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 11:10" />O urana u ndolo Aaralu e Yese e te isawan tsa atuta zuva iroci yu uɓolotosu wa ama. Nɗa n to ɓoloto a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi, uba̱ta̱ wu nden ma̱ yi waru u ta̱ da̱na̱ ulobonu a̱bunda̱ lon. <verse eid="ISA 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 11:11" />O urana u ndolo Zagbain ta canana ukere wa̱ yi mantsa me ire u zami aza a na a buwai a̱tsuma̱ a ama a̱ yi diga Asiriya, diga Masar, na̱ diga Paturo, na̱ diga Kush, na̱ diga Elam, na̱ diga Shina, na̱ diga Hamat, na̱ diga a nɗa m memere ma̱ mini. <verse eid="ISA 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 11:12" />U ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱n atuta iroci yu uɓolotosu wa ama, u to ɓoloto aza a Isra'ila a na o loyi. A̱vu u ɓoloto ama a Yahuda a na a bete'wei suru diga a pasu na̱shi vu uvaɗi. <verse eid="ISA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 11:13" />Tsushu'un tsa na tsa̱ ri a̱tsuma̱ a aza a Ifiramu oɓolo na aza a Yahuda u to koto. A̱a̱ da̱shi yuwan waru nla̱ngi va̱ni shi. <verse eid="ISA 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 11:14" />O to ɓolo aci a̱ riya̱a̱ aza a Filistiya a̱ tyo a̱ a̱livu, a̱ ta̱ pura̱ ama a asana oɓolo. A ta uwaa aza a Edom na aza a̱ Mowa nu uvon, a̱vu aza a Amon o o'wo za̱la̱ le. <verse eid="ISA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 11:15" />A̱sulazuva o to kototo aɓacina a mala ma Masar, waru u ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱n ukere wa̱ yi zuva vu Uɗolu wa̱ Yufireti, nu upepu wu usuɗuwu wa̱ yi. Waru u ta ɓatsa yi yene cindere adama ama a gura pasa wotowu na atan. <verse eid="ISA 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 11:16" />Tsundolo tsa ɗa aa yuwan ure u gbain u sa'ani diga e iɗa ya Asuriya adama a ama a̱ yi a na a buwai, cine a yuwayin aza a Isra'ila a mantsa ma na a gawain diga e iɗa ya Masar.<verse eid="ISA 11:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ISA 12" />
  <para style="s">Ishipa yi ica</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 12:1" />O urana u ndolo i ta damma, &lt;&lt;N ta̱ godyowo wu, A̱sulazuva. Ko na vu shi vu yuwain upan na̱ a̱mu, vu vadala ta̱ upan wa̱ wu a̱vu vu ca mu mini mo uta̱nu. <verse eid="ISA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 12:2" />Uwwai nda, A̱sula̱ a ɗa iwawi i va̱, n ta suraa yi waru maa uwwa wovon shi. A̱sulazuva A̱sulazuva a̱yi ɗa ucira u va̱ ni ishipa i va̱, wo o'wo ta̱ iwawi i va̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 12:3" />Na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ ma ɗa yoo rono mini diga o oko'o e iwawi.<verse eid="ISA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 12:4" />O urana u ndolo i ta damma: &lt;&lt;I godyowo A̱sulazuva, i ɗe a̱tsuma̱ a ala a̱ yi. I damma a̱tsuma̱ a nɗa ili i na u yuwaan nɗu, i cuɗuwa a na ala a̱ yi a̱ tsura̱ ta̱ tsugbain. <verse eid="ISA 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 12:5" />I canaa A̱sulazuva ica, adama a na u yuwain ili i gbagbain ya asalama a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu. I lyawa ama e reve ili i nda a̱tsuma̱ o uvaɗi suru. <verse eid="ISA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 12:6" />I saala nu uɗyo zuva a̱vu i cana ishipa na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱, ama a Sihiyona, adama a na Za va Akiza va Isra'ila zagbain ta̱ e memere ma̱ ɗu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 12:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ISA 13" />
  <para style="s">Ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ a aci a Babila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 13:1" />Apa ikaka i na Ishaya mawun ma Amoz me enei adama a Babila. <verse eid="ISA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 13:2" />I 'ya̱sa̱n atuta a aagaɗi a na a̱ ri lya̱nga̱, i saala le nu uɗyo zuva, i 'ya̱sa̱a̱n le ekere a uwa a̱ na̱ntsu va azagbain. <verse eid="ISA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 13:3" />A̱mu A̱sulazuva, n zuwa ta̱ aza a akiza a̱ va̱, m ɓoloto ta̱ aza a na a gurai uvon o shiton upan u va̱ aza a na a yuwusan ma̱za̱nga̱ na̱ tsugbain tsa̱ va̱ lon. <verse eid="ISA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 13:4" />Yu uwwa ilama a nsasan, cine vu revei a̱ba̱jini e iɓolo ya ama! I zuwa atsuvu, yisaali a̱tsuma̱ o tsugono tsa̱ a̱bunda̱, tsa̱ nɗa o ɓolotosu uba̱ta̱ u ta̱! A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a ɗa oo ɓolotosu a̱soja adama o uvon. <verse eid="ISA 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 13:5" />O uta̱ ta̱ a nɗa ma alanga, diga o ukosu wa zuva, A̱sulazuva ni itana yu uvon yu upan ya̱ yi, u kototo uvaɗi ma̱ɓula̱. <verse eid="ISA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 13:6" />Yoo oruwo adama a na urana wa̱ A̱sulazuva u yuwan ta̱ zuzu, urana u na Mogono me Ili Suru ma̱a̱ lyungu nu ulungusu! <verse eid="ISA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 13:7" />Adama a nda ekere suru a̱ ta̱ kuwa̱, okolo a vuma suru waru a̱ te jeruwe. <verse eid="ISA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 13:8" />Wovon u te reme le, mɓa̱la̱ na̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ e te reme le. A ta gaga anga cine ka tsu da̱nu teri. A̱ ta̱ ka̱lyuwula̱i na̱ wovon, urewesu u le ta̱ da̱na̱ a madala. <verse eid="ISA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 13:9" />Uwwai nda, urana wa̱ A̱sulazuva u ta̱ lo a̱ ta̱wa̱, urana u babu uyo'o wu upan wa̱ a̱bunda̱ ana wa̱a̱ ka̱mba̱to iɗa babu vuma reve u kototo a̱za̱ o unusu a na a̱ ri pe. <verse eid="ISA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 13:10" />Italyo'o ya zuva no oɓolo e italyo'o a̱a̱ da̱shi ca ekan e le shi. Nu urana u ɓa̱tsa̱ u to o'wo irumbu woto waru waa ca ekan shi. <verse eid="ISA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 13:11" />N ta ca uvaɗi oforo adama e iwuya ya̱ yi, a̱za̱ e iwuya waru adama o unusu u le. N ta tawa ugbawu wa aza aciyogbamu, a̱vu n ka̱ɗa̱to a̱za̱ e iɓongishi. <verse eid="ISA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 13:12" />N ta zuwa ama a la'a o'wo usa̱n u ma̱tsura̱ na̱ zinariya can, vaɗilima̱ waru na̱ zinariya na la'ai ulobonu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa ucuɗuwu u na na̱ Tsuyahuda e ɗeyi &lt;&lt;Zinariya Ofir&gt;&gt;</char></note>. <verse eid="ISA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 13:13" />Adama o ndolo n ta zuwa zuva je'en, a̱vu waru uvaɗi u jinga̱ɗa̱ diga uba̱ta̱ u na u ri adama o upan wa̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva, o urana wu upan wa̱ a̱bunda̱ wa̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 13:14" />Cine vu revei mere'on ma tsu suma no o lo yi a̱tsuma̱ o ugenge, ko ikyon i na i ri na̱ za va aguɓa shi, za suru ta̱ ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa ama a̱ yi, za suru ta suma a̱ tyo iɗa i na a matsan niyi. <verse eid="ISA 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 13:15" />Za na a cinai suru a ta sapa yi u kuwa̱. Za na e remei suru, a̱ ta̱ una yi na̱ matsun me pe'eni. <verse eid="ISA 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 13:16" />A ta jara nreɓu n le a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n me le, a̱ ta̱ pura̱ itana yu 'wa le waru o to von na̱ a̱ma̱ci e le babu ele ucigu. <verse eid="ISA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 13:17" />Uwwai nda, n ta zuwa aza a Midiya a̱ riya̱a̱ le, aza a na a tarai azurufa ili shi waru a̱a̱ luluma̱ le na̱ zinariya shi. <verse eid="ISA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 13:18" />Aya e le a ta sapa olobo, a̱a̱ ka̱lyuwa̱ nreɓu ni isa'ani shi waru ee ene iliyali i muwun shi. <verse eid="ISA 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 13:19" />Babila, za na la'a tsura̱i tsugbain a̱tsuma̱ o tsugono, ili i sa'ani ni ili yu uvaɗu wa aza a Kaldiya, u to o'wo tso Sodom na̱ Gomora a mantsa ma na A̱sula̱ o kototo nle. <verse eid="ISA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 13:20" />Vuma buwa a̱ da̱nu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi shi, ko a̱ da̱nu pe diga mantsa a̱ tyo mantsa shi. Babu za va Arabiya na a̱a̱ shuwa̱ oogodo a̱ yi pe, babu za va aguɓa na aa lyawa ikyon ya̱ yi i von pe. <verse eid="ISA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 13:21" />Amma inama yu una i ɗa yoo von ɗe, waru musa̱n mu una n ɗa maa shiwan o u'wa'a. Muwun ma azamina n ɗa ma̱a̱ da̱nu pe uba̱ta̱'a̱, mgbele mu una n ta yuwan pe tsu'yan. <verse eid="ISA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 13:22" />Nkunzu n ta saala a ɓaɓu vu ucira va̱ yi, musa̱n mu una waru n ta saala o kobu tsugono mawwa mo uyo'o. Ukosu wa Babila u yuwan ta̱ zuzu, a̱a̱ da̱shi yi rana shi.<verse eid="ISA 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ISA 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 14:1" />A̱sulazuva e te ene iliyali ya Yakubu, waru u ta̱ da̱shi ɗangwisa Isra'ila a̱vu u da̱na̱to le e iɗa i le. Omocin o to ɓolo ne ele a̱vu o ɓolo nu u'wa wa Yakubu. <verse eid="ISA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 14:2" />Nɗa n ta tara le a̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱to le e iɗa i le. Reve u'wa wa Isra'ila u zuwa le o o'woo le agbashi ali na̱ a̱ma̱ci e iɗa ya̱ A̱sulazuva. E te reme aza a na a̱ shi e reme nle tsa agbashi o o'wo agbashi e le reve a yuwan tsugbain a aci a aza a na a̱ shi o ɓongi nle.<verse eid="ISA 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 14:3" />A mantsa ma na A̱sulazuva a ca nɗu wivuwun wa̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ na addama nu ulinga wu usa̱n u na a zuwaa nɗu, <verse eid="ISA 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 14:4" />i yuwaan mogono ma Babila udammu u nda, &lt;&lt;Za vi iɓongi koto ta̱! Upan wa̱ yi u koto ta̱! <verse eid="ISA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 14:5" />Adama a na A̱sulazuva a kuɗa ta̱ aaɗanga a za vi iwuya, aaɗanga a za azagbain, <verse eid="ISA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 14:6" />za na fabai ama nu upan oɓolo nu wulapu u babu ukotu, nu upan u ɗa u yuwain tsugbain tsa nɗa ni iɓongi babu lyawa. <verse eid="ISA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 14:7" />Nɗa suru n tsura̱ ta̱ wivuwun oɓolo na̱ nden ma asuvu, a̱vu o ɓoso ni ishipa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 14:8" />Ko ɗanga sapure na̱ ɗanga sida va Lebanon a yuwaan wu ta̱ ma̱za̱nga̱, a dansa, &lt;&lt;Ana a̱ ka̱mba̱to nuwu za̱la̱, babu ozo o mokoɗo ma ɗanga ma na mo koɗo ntsu a̱ tyo e iɗa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 14:9" />Uba̱ta̱ wu nden wa̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱ u ta̱ jinga̱ɗa u da̱na̱ ufoɓu u na waa ga'aton wu. A̱vu u 'ya̱sa̱n nan ruhu va aza a na a̱ kuwa̱i a raba wu, nan ruhu va azagbain o uvaɗi suru. A̱vu waru u 'ya̱sa̱n nan ruhu vu ngono mu uvaɗi ɗe o otogu o tsugono tse le. <verse eid="ISA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 14:10" />Suru nle a̱ ta̱ usu wu a damma, &lt;&lt;A̱vu fo vo o'wo ta̱ babu ucira cine a̱tsu tsu ri, vo o'wo ta̱ tsa̱ tsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 14:11" />Ucira wa̱ wu na̱ tsugbain tsa̱ wu a̱ ciɗo wu ta̱ ne ele, oɓolo na̱ mesun me ikumburu ma̱ wu. Gogo tsunda azun a ɗa a̱ ri za̱la̱ va̱ wu tsa aavalu, azun a ɗa o o'woi ili i wupalu ya̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 14:12" />Cine vu riya̱i diga zuva, a̱vu zangaɗa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zangaɗa a̱yi ɗa talyo'o na tsu uta̱ na̱ wasasa asana e ikanasa</char></note> a̱vu mawun mo usana! A vari wu ta̱ a̱ cipa̱ o uvaɗi, a̱vu na vu variyi nɗa e iɗa. <verse eid="ISA 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 14:13" />A̱vu vu damma ta̱ o okolo a̱ wu, &lt;&lt;N ta kumba a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ zuva, a̱vu n 'ya̱sa̱n ootogu a̱ va̱ zuva vi italyo'o ya̱ A̱sula̱, n ta̱ da̱nu o ootogu o tsugono a masasan mo uga'asusan ma̱ musula̱ alanga ugana. <verse eid="ISA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 14:14" />N ta kumba ɗe zuva ve eleshe, n ka̱mba̱to aciya̱va̱ cine vu revei Mogono ma̱ A̱sula̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 14:15" />Agba a̱vu a̱ ka̱mba̱to wu uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱, za̱la̱ uba̱ta̱ u na u la'ai a̱ru'un. <verse eid="ISA 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 14:16" />Aza a na e ene nuwu o to o'wo a̱ a̱ka̱nla̱ a̱ wu, a̱vu a̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ ma̱la̱la̱ ma̱ wu, &lt;&lt;Vuma na jinga̱ɗa̱i uvaɗi a̱vu waru u jinga̱ɗa̱ tsugono tsa ɗa nda'a shi, <verse eid="ISA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 14:17" />vuma na ka̱mba̱toi uvaɗi a̱tsumona, a̱yi ɗa u rukutsa̱i ilyuci ya̱ yi shi, waru u lyawa aza a na a̱ ri o u'wa wa ali a̱ yi a̱ ka̱mba̱ o u'wa shi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 14:18" />Ngono mu nɗa suru n lantsa ta̱ a tsugbain tse le, za suru a aason a̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 14:19" />Agba a̱vu gba a lyawa ta̱ lipu va̱ wu a alanga a aason, cine vu revei eten a na a variyi a na a̱ ri nu ulinga shi. A̱vu a pala wu na̱ lipu va̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱, a̱soja a na o unai na̱ matsun me pe'eni. Oɓolo ne ele ɗa a vari nuwu a̱ a̱a̱ka̱ri a atali, reve a dasa wu. <verse eid="ISA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 14:20" />A̱a̱ ciɗo wu cine a̱ tsu ciɗo akapi o ngono shi, adama a na vu kototo ta̱ iɗa ya̱ wu, waru vu una ta̱ ama a̱ wu. A̱a̱ da̱shi cuwan na̱ muwun ma̱ wu shi. A̱a̱ da̱shi ɗe ala a̱ muwun mu za vi iwuya nda shi. <verse eid="ISA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 14:21" />I foɓo uba̱ta̱ u na oo una muwun ma̱ yi adama o unusu wu nkaya n le, tsa̱ra̱ a̱ 'yon a̱ ushi agadu e iɗa yi nkaya n le ko o shiton uvaɗi ni ilyuci i le wan. <verse eid="ISA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 14:22" />&lt;&lt;N ta̱ 'yon n yuwan uvon ne ele,&gt;&gt; a̱yi ɗa ili i na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai. &lt;&lt;N ta tawa aala a Babila na aza a na a buwai, umatsun wa̱ yi nu ugundo wa̱ yi,&gt;&gt; a̱yi ɗa ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai. <verse eid="ISA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 14:23" />&lt;&lt;N ta̱ ka̱mba̱to yi a̱a̱rumbu uba̱ta̱ u na mkponguro ma̱a̱ da̱nusu, n ta̱ raɗa yi na̱ wizu wu ukototosu,&gt;&gt; a̱yi ɗa ili i na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva ma dammai.<verse eid="ISA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ a aci a Asuriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 14:24" />A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a kucina ta̱, &lt;&lt;Cine n foɓoi ne ɗaɗa wa̱a̱ da̱na̱, cine n cigai ne ɗaɗa wee isawan. <verse eid="ISA 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 14:25" />N to kototo aza a Asuriya e iɗa i va̱, n ta dasa le a nsasan n va̱. A ta tawa ama a̱ va̱ a̱a̱gba̱la̱ e iɓongi, reve a̱ cipa̱to le itana a̱ nlyungu n le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 14:26" />A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa ifoɓi i na n yuwain adama o uvaɗi ma̱ɓula̱, a̱yi ɗa waru ucira wu ukere u na n cananai a aci a nɗa suru. <verse eid="ISA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 14:27" />Ana wo o'woi A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva o foɓo ta̱, zane ɗa aa gura vadala yi? U canana ta̱ ukere wa̱ yi, zane ɗa aa gura ka̱mba̱to yi a̱ca̱pa?<verse eid="ISA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ a aci a Filistiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 14:28" />A aa'wan a na mogono Ahaz kuwa̱i ikaka i nda i ta̱wa̱ ta̱: <verse eid="ISA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 14:29" />She i yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ wan suru nɗu aza a Filistiya adama a na aaɗanga a na a faɓa nɗu a kuɗai, adama a na diga o ookowo o yo'o a̱ ta̱ uta̱ na̱ ruku, waru umatsun wa̱ yi u ta̱ da̱na̱ tsu yo tsukuno tsa tsu'yan. <verse eid="ISA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 14:30" />Umatsun wu ufaru wa̱ a̱za̱ o ulambu cacau a̱ ta̱ tsura̱ uba̱ta̱ wa alyuna waru a̱za̱ e izami yi ikambi o to von gbaga. Amma n ta lungusa̱ ikyun ya̱ wu na ambulu, reve wu paɗa aza a na a buwai. <verse eid="ISA 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 14:31" />Yoo oruwo a̱ɗu na̱ntsu! I shon a̱ɗu ilyuci i gbagbain! Yi jeruwe a̱tsuma̱ o wovon, a̱ɗu aza a Filistiya suru! Mikyon mu uta̱ ta̱ diga ugana, waru babu za na aa lyawa a̱ca̱pa̱ a̱tsuma̱ e le. <verse eid="ISA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 14:32" />Cine tsa ɗa vuma a̱a̱ usu nlingata ma Filistiya ? &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a̱ shuwa̱ ta̱ Sihiyona, waru a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi ama a̱ yi a na o sowuso a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a̱ ta̱ tsura̱ upa'atan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 14:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ISA 15" />
  <para style="s">Ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ a aci a̱ Mowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 15:1" />Ikaka i nda i ta̱wa̱ mu ta̱ adama a̱ Mowa. A ayin a̱ ta̱ a ɗa a̱ lungusa̱i lyuci va Ar, reve iɗa ya̱ Mowa yo o'wo kpaku. A̱tsuma̱ a ayin a̱ ta̱ a ɗa a̱ lungusa̱i lyuci va̱ Kir, reve iɗa ya Mowa yo o'wo kpaku. <verse eid="ISA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 15:2" />U kumba ta̱ a gawan a̱ a̱a̱'isa̱. Ama a Dibon a kumba ta̱ a̱ a̱a̱'isa̱, reve waru a kumba ɗe a agaɗi adama a̱ shon. Mowa shon ta̱ adama a Nebo na adama a̱ Medeba. Suru nle a puna ta̱ a̱nji<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A agadu a ama o ro a tsu puna ta̱ ogbondo adama u roco a̱ ta̱ a̱ nden ma̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu</char></note> waru suru nle a puna ta̱ ntsa̱ka̱. <verse eid="ISA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 15:3" />O oto ta̱ akashamuna a mmalu o ure, a̱vu za suru oruwo zuva vu kwa̱'a̱<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa̱'a̱ le shi ta̱ uru'u cine vuma aa gura kumba u wala ɗe</char></note> na̱ a̱tsuma̱ e memere me eden, no o voyin na̱ a̱ shoyin. <verse eid="ISA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 15:4" />Heshibon oɓolo na̱ Eliyale a̱ shon ta̱, a uwwa ta̱ ɗyo le hali Jaza. Adama o ndolo a̱vu a̱soja a na a̱ ri ufoɓu a̱ Mowa a saala, a̱vu gba okolo e le e je'ein. <verse eid="ISA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 15:5" />Okolo a̱ va̱ a̱ showen ta̱ Mowa, a̱vu ama a̱ yi a na a̱ ri e ilaɗi a suma a̱ tyo Zowa na̱ ɗe Eglat Shelishiya. Reve a̱ ka̱ra̱ a gawan Luhi e mesun ele a̱tsuma̱ a mmalu, ele o ure wa Horonayim, a̱ shon ta̱ adama o ukototosu u le. <verse eid="ISA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 15:6" />Mini ma Nimrim me 'yewe reve anlya a kpanla, anlya o uta̱nu o koto ta̱ babu waru anlya a na a buwai. <verse eid="ISA 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 15:7" />Adama o ndolo utsuru u na a̱ tsura̱i reve a zuwa a tara le a̱ ka̱ra̱ upasu u Moɗolu mo wolilo. <verse eid="ISA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 15:8" />Adama a na uba̱ta̱ suru e iɗa ya̱ Mowa a ta uwwusa mesun. Mesun mo ndolo ma rawa ta̱ a̱ lyuci va̱ Eglayim, hali u rawa a̱ lyuci va̱ Beye Elim. <verse eid="ISA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 15:9" />Mini ma̱ Dimon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mesun ma Dimon u rotso ta̱ danshi Tsuyahuda mpasa</char></note> ma̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ tapu na̱ mpasa, agba na̱ ne suru n ta̱ da̱shi ta̱wa̱ na̱ kamu a aci a̱ Dimon na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Mowa a na a la'ai a na a buwai e iɗa'a.<verse eid="ISA 15:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ISA 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 16:1" />I lyungu na̱ uneꞌe u mokyokyon a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wu zagbain vi iɗa, diga Sela, o ure wa̱ a̱tsumona, a masasan mo Usheli ma̱ Sihiyona. <verse eid="ISA 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 16:2" />Cine vu revei nnunu n tsu'yan n na o loyi a yikinda i le, ne ɗa a̱ma̱ci a̱ Mowa a̱ ri a mapasa mo Uɗolu wa Anon. <verse eid="ISA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 16:3" />&lt;&lt;Vu ca tsu a̱sa̱la̱, yi isawan mejege. Vu zuwa ululu u geshe tsu nu usuɗuwu wu urana wa̱ a̱bunda̱. I soko aza a na a̱ ri e ilaɗi, she i pa̱lu'wa̱ le wan. <verse eid="ISA 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 16:4" />I lyawa aza a na a̱ ri e ilaɗi a̱za̱ a̱ Mowa a̱ da̱na̱ na̱ a̱ɗu, yoo o'wo uba̱ta̱ o upa'atan u le e ekere a aza a na oo unusa le.&gt;&gt; A mantsa ma na za vi iɓongi rawai ukosu, ukototosu fo wi isawain, a̱yi waru za na aa dasasa u puwa̱in e iɗa'a. <verse eid="ISA 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 16:5" />A mantsa'a a ta zuwa ootogu o tsugono a̱tsuma̱ e icigi. Otogu o tsugono o ugundo wa̱ Da̱wuda. Mogono'o u ta yuwan tsugbain a̱tsuma̱ e mejege waru u ta yuwan ge'etosu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱, waru nu ukadu u ta yuwan ili i na i ri mejege. <verse eid="ISA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 16:6" />Tsu uwwa ta̱ cu'un vu uvaɗu wa̱ Mowa, nu u'ya̱susa̱n wa aci u le, tsu uwwa ta̱ waru cine a tsu tara ama ili shi, nu ulambu wu ugbozu u le, agba malapa ma̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n me le suru pere ɗa. <verse eid="ISA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 16:7" />Adama o ndolo ama e iɗa ya̱ Mowa a ta saala, a ta saala suru adama a̱ Mowa. A̱ ta̱ shon a̱vu a yuwan a̱tsumola̱ngu adama a akala o u'yewu a̱ ina̱bi a Kir Hareset. <verse eid="ISA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 16:8" />A̱ɗuma̱ a Heshibon a kpanla ta̱, a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ ina̱bi va Sibima a̱ 'yewe ta̱. Azagbain a nɗa a kuɗa ta̱ Mowa ataci o ulobonu u ndolo, za na shi valai a̱ tyo ugana a rawa lyuci va Jaza reve u vala a̱ tyo asana a̱tsumona. Ototopi e le a canana ta̱ hali a̱ tyo a̱livu a pasalai a mala. <verse eid="ISA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 16:9" />Reve n shon, cine Jaza a̱a̱ shosun, adama a ataci a Sibima. A̱vu Heshibon, a̱vu Eliyale, n to oco aɓara a̱ va̱ a aci a̱ ɗu! Yisaali i ma̱za̱nga̱ i buwa shi adama a̱ muwun mu ɗanga n na a tsu ta'an a mantsa mo uta'an. <verse eid="ISA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 16:10" />Mere na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ a tawa le a atsusa o umili. Babu waru vuma na a canasa ishipa ko a yuwusan ma̱za̱nga̱ o uɗuma̱ u ina̱bi. Babu waru vuma na tsu kpoko masayan uba̱ta̱ u mokpoko, n zuwa ta̱ utyo u ma̱za̱nga̱. <verse eid="ISA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 16:11" />Adama o ndolo okolo a̱ va̱ a̱ shon ta̱ cine vu revei kumburu adama a̱ Mowa, ne ɗa waru okolo a̱ va̱ a̱ la̱nga̱i adama a̱ Kir Here. <verse eid="ISA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 16:12" />Mantsa ma na Mowa 'ya̱wa̱toyi aciya̱yi a aagaɗi, aciya̱yi a ɗa wa̱a̱ kuna̱tosu goon. Mantsa ma na u ri a yuwusan avasa, ulinga we pere u ɗa waa yuwusan.<verse eid="ISA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 16:13" />A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa adanshi a na A̱sulazuva a yuwain ɗe a aci a̱ Mowa. <verse eid="ISA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 16:14" />Waru gogo A̱sulazuva a damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;A̱tsuma̱ a a'wan a ta'atsu, cine vu revei za zamalinga tsu kece a'wan, tsugbain tsa̱ Mowa tsu to o'wo ili ye pere, ko cine tsa ɗa a̱ ri a̱bunda̱, aza a na a buwai o to o'wo ke'en lon waru babu ucira.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ISA 17" />
  <para style="s">Ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ a aci a Dimaska</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 17:1" />Ikaka adama a Dimaska, &lt;&lt;Uwwai nda, Dimaska buwa o o'wo a̱ba̱jini a̱ lyuci shi amma u to o'wo aganga o ulungusu. <verse eid="ISA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 17:2" />Ilyuci ya Arowa o to o'wo babu vuma a̱vu a lyawaa oɓolo e iliyamunga, wo o'wo le uba̱ta̱ wu nven, babu za na a zuwa le a uwwa wovon. <verse eid="ISA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 17:3" />Ilyuci yi ɓaɓu vu ucira a̱ ta̱ puwa̱n diga Ifiramu, oɓolo na̱ tsugono diga Dimaska. Tsugbain tsa akapi a Aram tsa̱ ta̱ ka̱ra̱ tsa tsugbain tsa aza a Isra'ila,&gt;&gt; ili i na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai ɗa nda. <verse eid="ISA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 17:4" />&lt;&lt;O urana u ndolo tsugbain tsa Yakubu tso to koto, mgbain n lipu va̱ yi n ta ramba. <verse eid="ISA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 17:5" />Isra'ila to o'wo tso uɗuma̱ u na a gasai tso uɗuma̱ u na 'yanlai hali wo o'wo she damma ili yi pe shi. Tso Uka̱ri wa̱ Refaya. <verse eid="ISA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 17:6" />Na̱ ne suru u'yanlu u ta buwa, cine u tso o'wo nu uɗanga u zetun u na a̱ za̱ka̱tsa̱i. A̱vu u buwa ɗe zuva ejere ko aza a ta'atsu e eten o mogogolo, a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi ko ozo o ton eten a na a̱ ri na̱ muwun.&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva, A̱sula̱ a aza a Isra'ila a dammai. <verse eid="ISA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 17:7" />O urana u ndolo ama a ta zuwaa Za na yuwan nle esu, a zuwaa Za va Akiza a Isra'ila esu. <verse eid="ISA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 17:8" />Waa zuwaa masa'a, ulinga we ekere wa̱ yi esu shi, waru waa zuwaa ili i na akatsu a̱ yi a yuwain esu shi, ko a̱shuwutsu a Ashera ko masa'a ma̱ a̱tsuka̱ a̱ ma̱guru.<verse eid="ISA 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 17:9" />O urana u ndolo ilyuci yu ucira i le a na suma a lyawai adama aza a Isra'ila, o to o'wo ofoli cine vu revei ba̱ta̱ na o o'woi okongo cine vu revei a̱rumbu a na a̱ ri ugbagbalu. Suru o to o'wo ofoli. <verse eid="ISA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 17:10" />Adama a na yi icina ta̱ na̱ A̱sula̱ Zamawawa ɗu, i cuwan na Aatali'i upa'atan wu ucira u ɗu shi. Adama o ndolo, ko na i cu'wa̱in icu'un i sa'ani waru i cu'wa̱n mocin va ataci, <verse eid="ISA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 17:11" />ko ni i shi a zuwa le a kungwa o urana u na i cu'wa̱n nle gan, reve i zuwa le a ɓatsa yipa̱lu nu usana u na i cu'wa̱in nle, na̱ ne suru ugasa u ɗu u to o'wo pere o urana u mesun na̱ mɓa̱la̱ n na ma̱a̱ tsura̱ a̱guma̱ shi. <verse eid="ISA 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 17:12" />Uwwai, elemu a nɗa na̱ a̱bunda̱, a̱ ta̱ elemu cine vu revei mala ma̱ ri a̱ ma̱gugwa̱! Uwwai, ma̱gugwa̱ ma ama, a̱ ta̱ a̱ ma̱gugwa̱ cine vu revei a̱ba̱jini a̱ mini a na a̱ ri a̱ ma̱gugwa̱! <verse eid="ISA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 17:13" />Ko na wo o'woi ama a̱ ta̱ a̱ ma̱gugwa̱ cine vu revei a̱ba̱jini a̱ mini, agba A̱sula̱ a ta ɓara le, reve gba a suma alanga. O to lo le cine vu revei owopo a nsasan a̱tsuma̱ o upepu na̱ lipa̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ wunla̱. <verse eid="ISA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 17:14" />Nu ulivu a̱vu ucasu u wovon u ta̱wa̱ babu usa̱n, agba kafu usana, a̱vu u bete'we! A̱yi ɗa akunda a aza a na a usa ntsu ili, akunda a aza a na a pura̱ ntsu ili i na tsu ri na̱ a̱yi.<verse eid="ISA 17:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ISA 18" />
  <para style="s">Ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ a aci a̱ Kush</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 18:1" />A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a ta cina iɗa i na i ri e elemu e evelu, iɗa i na i ri mavada mo ɗolu va̱ Kush, <verse eid="ISA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 18:2" />aza a na a̱a̱ lyungusu a̱za̱ e ikaka o ure u mala a̱tsuma̱ a wantsun wa apumpu zuva mini. 'Ya̱wa̱i a̱ɗu nlingata mi ilaɗi, e iɗa i na i ri na ama o uga'an. Aza a na lipu le ri pete, uba̱ta̱ wa ama a na a uwwusa wovon u le pa zuzu na alanga, iɗa i na i ri nu ucira u na waa lyuwusa aci, iɗa i na waru ɗolu vu kasai. <verse eid="ISA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 18:3" />A̱ɗu ama o uvaɗi suru, aza a na a̱ ri na̱ nden a̱tsuma̱ o uvaɗi, na̱ a̱ 'ya̱sa̱a̱n ɗu atuta ɗe a nsasan, i te ene. Nna̱ e ivula̱ aavana, i ta uwwa yi. <verse eid="ISA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 18:4" />Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva a damma numu: &lt;&lt;Diga ɗe uba̱ta̱ wu nden n va̱ zuva, n ta̱ da̱na̱ ɗe kpaku n ka̱lyuwa̱ uvaɗi, cine vu revei usuɗuwu wu urana nu urana u rawa a aci, ko agba cine vu revei a'iza a mantsa mo usuɗuwu u wandari wu ugasa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 18:5" />Adama a na kafu ugasa u rawa, a mantsa ma na yipa̱lu i tso oco, reve yipa̱lu yo o'wo muwun ma ataci n na mi inai, u to koɗo ototopi na̱ matsun mo wukoɗu. U to polo le e iɗa a̱vu u tara eten a na a̱ ri a mmalu a̱ ka̱ra̱. <verse eid="ISA 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 18:6" />A ta lyawa le suru e ekere a asala a nsasan oɓolo ni inama yu una, asala a̱ ta̱ ka̱ɗa̱ le hali ukosu u lyushi, inama yu una waru a tama le a mantsa mo uta̱nu.<verse eid="ISA 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 18:7" />A mantsa mo ndolo a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva na̱ ne'e diga ama o uga'an aza a na lipu le ri pete, aza a na a uwwusa wovon u le zuzu na alanga, iɗa i na i ri nu ucira i na yaa lyuwusa aci, iɗa i na ɗolu vu kasai. A̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ ne'e a Masasan ma̱ Sihiyona, uba̱ta̱ wa ala a̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva.<verse eid="ISA 18:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ISA 19" />
  <para style="s">Ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ a aci a Masar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 19:1" />Ikaka adama a Masar, uwwai nda, A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱tsuma̱ e eleshe e ilaɗi, u ta̱ lo a̱ ta̱wa̱ e iɗa ya Masar. A̱ma̱li a Masar o o'wo ta̱ wuda'un a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi, okolo a aza a Masar waru a̱ ka̱ra̱ ta̱ e jeruwushe. <verse eid="ISA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 19:2" />&lt;&lt;N ta sato aza a Masar na aza a Masar, mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wun na̱ mawun ma̱ a̱na̱wu, moron ma̱ nden na̱ moron ma̱ nden, lyuci na̱ lyuci, tsugono na̱ tsugono. <verse eid="ISA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 19:3" />Aza a Masar a̱ ta̱ uta̱a̱ okolo, reve n ra̱pula̱ ifoɓi i le. A ta zami ikambi ya̱ a̱ma̱li na̱ ruhu va̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱ no oboci na aza a na a yuwusan ulinga oɓolo na̱ ruhu va̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱. <verse eid="ISA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 19:4" />N ta ca aza a Masar e ekere a zagbain na ri usuɗuwu, na̱ mogono ma na ma̱ ri ujaaru u yuwan tsugono a aci e le,&gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai. <verse eid="ISA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 19:5" />Mini ma mala ma̱ Nilu ma̱ te 'yewe, reve uɗolu'u wu ukwan reve e 'yewe. <verse eid="ISA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 19:6" />Muɗolu n to uta̱ ushamu, ɗolu waru to koto reve waru o ukwan. Anlya na apumpu a ta kpanla, <verse eid="ISA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 19:7" />ma̱vu'un suru ma na ma̱ ri zuzu nu Uɗolu wa̱ Nilu fo, a̱ nge'en mu uɗolu'u. Uɗuma̱ u na a̱ cu'wa̱in suru zuzu nu uɗolu wa̱ Nilu u te 'yewe, a̱ te ivula̱ le reve a̱ puwa̱n. <verse eid="ISA 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 19:8" />A̱za̱ e mereme ma mugula a ta yuwan a̱tsumola̱ngu a̱vu waru a gaga akatsu, oɓolo na aza a na suru aa varishi igon pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Nilu'u, aza a na fo a varishi igolo okolo e le a ta kuɗa. <verse eid="ISA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 19:9" />Aza a na a yuwusan ulinga na̱ a̱nka̱ u ta̱ ɓa̱li le, aza a na fo a ɗavusa itana i uri a̱ to uta̱a̱ okolo e le. <verse eid="ISA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 19:10" />Aza a na aa ɗavusa amuna e iɗa'a a ta lamba ili i na aa yuwan, aza a zamalinga suru waru a ta yuwan a̱tsumola̱ngu. <verse eid="ISA 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 19:11" />Azagbain a̱ Zowan olo a ɗa ili i ro i ɗa shi, a̱za̱ a̱ a̱sa̱la̱ a Firi'awuna a tsu ca a̱sa̱la̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱ shi. Cine tsa ɗa vaa damma Firi'awuna, &lt;&lt;A̱mu mawun ma̱ a̱za̱ o urevu ma ɗa, mawun mo ngono mu ufaru&gt;&gt;? <verse eid="ISA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 19:12" />To, Firi'awuna te ɗa a̱za̱ o urevu a̱ wu? Lyawa o roco wu a̱vu a damma wu ili i na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva o foɓoi a̱ tyo a aci a aza a Masar. <verse eid="ISA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 19:13" />Azagbain a̱ Zowan o o'wo ta̱ olo, a̱ luluma̱ ta̱ azagbain a̱ Memfis. Atali a̱ nkyun mu usaa vu gundo va Masar o rono ta̱ Masar o ure u vama. <verse eid="ISA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 19:14" />A̱sulazuva a̱ tsuwa̱n le ta̱ na̱ ruhu tsulo, adama o ndolo a̱sa̱la̱ e le suru wo o'wo ta̱ tsulo. A zuwa ta̱ Masar o o'wo o utakalyuwusa cine ososowi a tsu takalyuwusa a̱tsuma̱ a tsushaamu tsa̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 19:15" />Babu ili i na Masar aa gura yuwan, aaci ko wizan, ashuwashuwa ko apumpu.<verse eid="ISA 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 19:16" />O urana u ndolo aza a Masar o to o'wo cine vu revei a̱ma̱ci. A̱ ta̱ je'en lipu na̱ wovon za̱la̱ vu ukere u na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a cananai nla̱ngi ne ele. <verse eid="ISA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 19:17" />Iɗa ya Yahuda i to o'wo ili i wovon e ekere a Masar. Za na e ɗeweyi Yahuda suru ta uwwa wovon, adama e ili i na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva o foɓoi a aci e le.<verse eid="ISA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 19:18" />O urana u ndolo ilyuci i ton ya Masar i ta yuwan elentsu a aza a Ka'ana reve a yuwan akucunu a nzuwulai na ala a̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva. A̱tsuma̱ e le a̱ ta̱ ɗe za ta̱ Lyuci vu Ukototosu.<verse eid="ISA 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 19:19" />O urana u ndolo a ta yuwaan A̱sulazuva masa'a e memere me iɗa ma Masar, oɓolo na atsura a̱ tyo a̱ A̱sulazuva o utyo wi iɗa'a. <verse eid="ISA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 19:20" />U to o'wo iroci oɓolo macuwayin uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva e iɗa ya Masar. Na̱ a̱ showen A̱sulazuva adama a aza a na o ɓongishi le, u ta̱ lyunguwa̱ le na̱ za vi iwawi za na ee geshe le, reve u papa le. <verse eid="ISA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 19:21" />A̱sulazuva a ta zuwa aza a Masar e reve na̱ a̱yi, a̱vu a̱tsuma̱ o urana u ndolo a̱ ta̱ reve A̱sulazuva. A ta yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ oɓolo na̱ kucci nu ucasu, a̱vu a taraa A̱sulazuva akucunu a̱vu o shiton le. <verse eid="ISA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 19:22" />A̱sulazuva a ta faba Masar, u ta faba le a̱vu u ka̱mba̱to le gbaga. A̱ ta̱ ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu u zuwaa le atsuvu e ili i na a patishi a̱vu u ka̱mba̱to le gbaga.<verse eid="ISA 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 19:23" />O urana u ndolo a̱ ta̱ tsura̱ a̱ba̱jini o ure diga Masar a̱ tyo Asiriya. Aza a Asuriya a̱ ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa a za a Masar, a̱vu waru aza a Masar a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa aza a Asiriya. Aza a Masar na aza a Asuriya a ta yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ uba̱ta̱ u ta̱. <verse eid="ISA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 19:24" />O urana u ndolo Isra'ila to o'wo za va ta'atsu, oɓolo na̱ Masar na̱ Asiriya, o to o'wo aba'un e memere mo uvaɗi. <verse eid="ISA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 19:25" />A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a ta zuwaa le aba'un, a dansa, &lt;&lt;Aba'un za va Masar ɗa ama a̱ va̱, Asuriya waru ulinga wu ukere u va̱, Isra'ila gba ili ya agadu i va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ISA 20" />
  <para style="s">Ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ a aci a Masar na̱ Kush</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 20:1" />A̱tsuma̱ a aa'wan a nan yali ya̱ a̱soja za na Sagon mogono ma Asuriya ma̱ lyunguyi ta̱wa̱i Ashido, a̱vu u riya̱a̱ yi nu uvon, a̱vu u reme yi. <verse eid="ISA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 20:2" />A mantsa mo ndolo ma ɗa A̱sulazuva a yuwain adanshi na̱ Ishaya mawun ma Amoz. U damma yi ta̱, &lt;&lt;Vu foɗo akashamuna a̱ lipu va̱ wu oɓolo na atan a ana a̱ wu.&gt;&gt; Reve u yuwan ne, reve u walasa ataɓu waru babu atan a ana.<verse eid="ISA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 20:3" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma, &lt;&lt;Cine Ishaya aagbashi a̱ va̱ a walai ataɓu waru babu atan a ana a̱ yi hali a'wan a ta'atsu, iroci i ɗa no oroci o morono ma atsuvu a na ma̱a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ a aci a Masar oɓolo na̱ Kush. <verse eid="ISA 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 20:4" />Mogono ma Asuriya ma̱ ta̱ pura̱ aza a Masar na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Kush, suru nle muwun na̱ mbara. Ne ɗa aa yuwan mmalu ataɓu waru babu atan na̱ gundo le a alanga, ili i wono e iɗa ya Masar. <verse eid="ISA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 20:5" />Aza a na a zuwayi Kush ucira a̱vu waru a yuwan uvaɗu na aza a Masar a ta uwwa wovon reve waru a uwwa wono. <verse eid="ISA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 20:6" />A̱tsuma̱ o urana u ndolo aza a na a̱ ri na̱ nden e iɗa i memere ma̱ mini a ta damma, &lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱i ili i na i cinai aza a na tsu zuwayi ucira, aza a na tsu sumai a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ ye'e le adama a kamba tsu reve waru a wawa tsu e ekere o mogono ma Asiriya! Cine tsa ɗa tsaa la'ai?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 20:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ISA 21" />
  <para style="s">Ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ a aci a Babila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 21:1" />Ikaka adama a̱ a̱tsumona a na a̱ ri e ikyun i mala, cine lipa̱ na tsu lapa diga upasu wu uyagi wi iɗa'a, u tsu uta̱ ta̱ diga a̱tsumona e iɗa i wovon. <verse eid="ISA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 21:2" />Me ene ta̱ alavu alavu e ili i wovon, me ene ta̱ za vi ikpa'a a yuwusan ikpa'a za mona waru a̱ mona. A̱vu Elam 'ya̱wa̱a̱ nu uvon, a̱vu Midiya vu ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ lyuci gbain. Suru a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a na u ta̱wa̱yi n ta tawa yi. <verse eid="ISA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 21:3" />Adama e ili i ndolo u zuwa mu ta̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a̱ mɓa̱la̱ cine a̱a̱tsuma̱ a̱ tsu ɓa̱li ka mantsa ma̱ teri. N ta̱ka̱lyuwa̱ ta̱ adama e ili i na mu uwwai, mu uwwa ta̱ wovon adama e ili i na me enei. <verse eid="ISA 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 21:4" />Ookolo a̱ va̱ a kuɗa ta̱, mu da'wan ta̱ adama o wovon, ayin a na n da̱na̱i a pura, u ta̱wa̱ ta̱ wo o'wo mu ili i wovon. <verse eid="ISA 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 21:5" />O foɓo ta̱ apada no o polusoi avalu reve a̱ da̱na̱ a lyusa no o sowi! 'Yoyin a̱ɗu azagbain, i sukuma a̱ra̱ga̱ a̱ ɗu mani'in!<verse eid="ISA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 21:6" />Mpa nda ili i na Zagbain damma numu, &lt;&lt;'Ya̱wa̱ vu zuwa za vi ipiri, u damma ili i na we enei. <verse eid="ISA 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 21:7" />Na̱ we ene ikeke yi ido ni ido ejere re, akumbi o nloli na̱ akumbi a arakumi, reve u polo atsuvu, wu uwwa ulobonu lon.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 21:8" />Reve za vi ipiri'i wo oruwo u damma, &lt;&lt;Zagbain va̱, urana suru n tsi isawan ta̱ zuva va aburu, waru ayin suru n tsi isawan ta̱ uba̱ta̱ u na a zuwa numu. <verse eid="ISA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 21:9" />Ka̱lyuwa̱, nda kumbi keke vi ido a̱ ta̱wa̱ ni ido ejere re.&gt;&gt; A̱vu u usu, &lt;&lt;Babila riya̱ ta̱, u riya̱! Suru a̱ma̱li a na a yuwusaan a̱ga̱nda̱ o ɓoso le ta̱ hali a̱ tyo e iɗa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 21:10" />A̱ɗu ama a̱ va̱, aza a na o soroi o osoroto, n damma ɗu ta̱ ili i na mu uwwai diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva, A̱sula̱ a aza a Isra'ila.<verse eid="ISA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ a aci a Edom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 21:11" />Ikaka adama a Duma, za ro ɗe mu ta̱ diga Seyi, &lt;&lt;Za vi ipiri, mantsa ma̱ ne ma ɗa ayin oo koto? Mantsa ma̱ ne ma ɗa ayin oo koto?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 21:12" />Reve za vi ipiri usu u damma, &lt;&lt;Usana u ta̱ lo a̱ ta̱wa̱, waru ne ɗa ayin. Na̱ vu ciga vu yuwan yeci gogo she vu yuwan yeci, reve vu da̱shi ka̱mbisa̱ vu yuwan yeci.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ a aci a Araba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 21:13" />Nda ikaka adama a Araba. A̱ɗu oɓolo a aza a mmalu a Dedan, aza a na a̱ va̱la̱i a̱ a̱pa̱mu a̱ a̱tsumona a Araba, <verse eid="ISA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 21:14" />i ta̱wa̱a̱ aza a na aa uwwusa akuli mini, a̱ɗu aza a na a̱ ri na̱ nden a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci va Tema, i ta̱wa̱a̱ aza a na a pa'ain ilyalya. <verse eid="ISA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 21:15" />Adama a na a sumaa ta̱ matsun me pe'eni, matsun me pe'eni ma na a talai e ibici, diga uba̱ta̱ o utan u na a̱ nyu'wa̱in, na̱ diga uba̱ta̱ o uvon wu usuɗuwu.<verse eid="ISA 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 21:16" />Nda ili i na Zagbain damma numu, &lt;&lt;A̱tsuma̱ a aa'wan a̱ ta̱, e mekece ma a'wan vu za zamalinga, tsugbain tsa̱ Keda tsu to koto. <verse eid="ISA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 21:17" />Aza a na aa la'a aza a na a gurai aya, aza a Keda, ke'en ɗa aa buwa.&gt;&gt; Adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a aza Isra'ila a ɗa dammai ne.<verse eid="ISA 21:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ISA 22" />
  <para style="s">Ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ adama a̱ Urishelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 22:1" />Ikaka adama o uka̱ri wa alavu alavu, Nye i ɗa ya̱a̱ ɓa̱la̱ ɗu, hali a na suru nɗu i kumbai zuva vu kwa̱'a̱, <verse eid="ISA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 22:2" />lyuci na shiwain na̱ yorori, za na shiwain ne elemu na̱ a̱gidi'ya̱ ne elemu o uvaɗu? Ama a̱ ɗu a̱ kuwa̱ na̱ matsun me pe'eni ko uba̱ta̱ o uvon shi. <verse eid="ISA 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 22:3" />Suru azagbain a̱ ɗu a suma ta̱ oɓolo, e reme le ta̱ agba o rono utan shi. Aza a na i cinai suru e reme le ta̱, ko na a̱ shi a sumai alanga. <verse eid="ISA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 22:4" />Adama o ndolo reve n damma, &lt;&lt;Tawai esu a̱ ɗu ya̱'a̱ va̱, lyawa numu n shon na aɓara a̱ a̱bunda̱. She za ca mu adanshi adama a ama a̱ va̱ a na o unai wan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 22:5" />Adama a na urana u ɗa a na Zagbain A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a ta̱wa̱yi, urana wu u'ya̱susa̱n wu ugbozu na̱ wudasu na̱ tsuda'wun a̱tsuma̱ o uka̱ri wa alavu alavu, urana u wuɓosu wu uɓaɓu ne e showesheyin nsasan. <verse eid="ISA 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 22:6" />Waru Elam tara ta̱ ujiyin ni ikeke yi ido na akumbi e ido, Kir gba shi u guza̱ ta̱ a̱a̱ra̱ga̱. <verse eid="ISA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 22:7" />Ka̱ri va̱ wu na la'ai ulobonu ta̱ tapu ni ikeke yi ido, waru a zuwa ta̱ akumbi e ido a̱ na̱ntsu lyuci'i. <verse eid="ISA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 22:8" />A tawa ta̱ ili i na i palai Yahuda. O urana u ndolo i bunga̱ ta̱ itana yu uvon i na a zuwai o U'wa wa̱ A̱a̱rumbu, <verse eid="ISA 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 22:9" />waru ye ene ta̱ lyuci gbain va̱ Da̱wuda wu ɓatsa ta̱ lon, reve i ɓoloto mini ma Mabata ma̱ Za̱la̱. <verse eid="ISA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 22:10" />Reve i kece 'wa na ri Urishelima, a̱vu yi ɓoso 'wa adama i lapula uɓaɓu'u. <verse eid="ISA 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 22:11" />A̱vu i yuwan aabata e memere ma ɓaɓu re adama o ɓoloto mini ma Akuci a Mabata, amma i pati Za na yuwan niyi shi, ko ye ene Za na yuwan niyi ɗe nu ujumu tsugbain shi. <verse eid="ISA 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 22:12" />A̱tsuma̱ o urana u ndolo A̱sulazuva Zagbain vo oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva, e ɗe ɗu ta̱ i yuwan mesun na̱ nden ma̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu, i yuwan ogbondo, reve yoo oto akashamuna. <verse eid="ISA 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 22:13" />Agba a̱yi ɗa nda, she ma̱za̱nga̱ na̱ mere na̱ mapaɗa me inan ni ikyon nu utamu wi inama no oso a masayan. I ta dansa, &lt;&lt;Lyawa tsu lyuwai tsu sowoi, adama a na nfa'an tsu ta gura kuwa̱i!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 22:14" />A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva o roco ta̱ ili i nda a atsuvu a̱ va̱, &lt;&lt;Amayun aa tawa ɗu ume wu unusu u nda shi hali urana u na ya̱a̱ kuwa̱,&gt;&gt; ne ɗa Zagbain, A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai.<verse eid="ISA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 22:15" />Mpa nda ili i na Zagbain A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai, ta̱wa̱ vu 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Shebena zagbain vu u'wa u mogono, vu damma yi, <verse eid="ISA 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 22:16" />&lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa vaa yuwusan pa waru zane ɗa ca nuwu ucira u na vee she'een aciya̱wu aason zuva va aatali, a na vo foɓusoo aciya̱wu uba̱ta̱ u wivuwun wu ukosu a aatali? <verse eid="ISA 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 22:17" />Uwwai nda, A̱sulazuva e te reme wu a̱vu u vari wu nu ucira, a̱vu vuma vu ucira. <verse eid="ISA 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 22:18" />U ta̱ kutsulu wu reve u vuvu wu tsa̱ kolo e iɗa i na i ri washin. Ɗe ɗa va̱a̱ kuwa̱ waru ɗe ɗa ikeke yi ido yu ucira ya̱ wu ya̱a̱ da̱na̱. A̱vu ili i wono i ɗa o u'wa wu zagbain va̱ wu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 22:19" />Waru n to loso wu diga a tsugbain tsa̱ wu, waru n ta tawa wu o ootogu a tsugbain tsa̱ wu.<verse eid="ISA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 22:20" />&lt;&lt;A̱tsuma̱ o urana u ndolo n te ɗe aagbashi a̱ va̱ Eliyakim ulobo wa Hilikiya. <verse eid="ISA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 22:21" />N to oto yi a̱tugu a gbagbain a̱ wu waru mu nla̱ yi gbakala va̱ wu, waru n ta̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ ucira u tsugbain tsa̱ wu e ekere a̱ yi. U to o'wo dada va aza a na a̱ ri na̱ nden Urishelima nu u'wa wa Yahuda. <verse eid="ISA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 22:22" />N ta sa̱ga̱dowa̱ yi kpa̱tu'utsu vu u'wa wa̱ Da̱wuda o uvangaci wa̱ yi. Ili i na u kpa̱tu'wa̱i babu za na a̱a̱ ɓa̱ru yi, waru ili i na u ɓa̱ruyi babu za na a̱ kpa̱tu'wa̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 22:23" />N ta vara yi tsa̱ rumu ma̱shuwa̱ uba̱ta̱ o ugbamu, waru u ta̱ ta̱wa̱ no ootogu a tsugbain o u'wa wa dada va̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 22:24" />Waru a̱ ta̱ sa̱ga̱dowa̱ yi tsugbain tsu u'wa wa dada va̱ yi suru nu ugundo wa̱ yi na̱ muwun n tsukaya tsa̱ yi, ntaɗa n kekeꞌen suru, na̱ munda na̱ nden suru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 22:25" />&lt;&lt;O urana u ndolo,&gt;&gt; A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;rumu na a varai uba̱ta̱ o ugbamu, u ta̱ mula̱ u ta kuɗa reve u riya̱. Waru itana i na suru a̱ sa̱ga̱doi ɗe o to kototo le,&gt;&gt; adama a na A̱sulazuva a ɗa a dammai.<verse eid="ISA 22:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ISA 23" />
  <para style="s">Ikaka ya̱ A̱sula̱ a aci a Taya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 23:1" />A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa adanshi adama a Taya, yuwain yorori ya̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu, a̱ɗu a̱za̱ o uluwu wa antsun a Tarshishi, adama a na o kototo ta̱ Taya waru a lyawa le ta̱ babu 'wa ko uzuwata wa wantsun. Udammu u ta̱wa̱ le ta̱ diga e iɗa ya Sipurus. <verse eid="ISA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 23:2" />Rungwa̱i, a̱ɗu aza atsulu na awina a Sidon, a̱ɗu aza a na a̱ ri na̱ nden e memere ma mala, aza a awina na aatsulu a̱ɗu a pasa ta̱ mavada ma mala a̱ ka̱mba̱tosu lyuci ɗu nu utsuru. <verse eid="ISA 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 23:3" />Waru diga a mala ma ɗa a̱ ta̱wa̱yi ni ishina diga Shiho nu ugasa wi ili i na i kungwai zuzu na̱ Nilu. Waru vo o'wo ta̱ uba̱ta̱ wa awina na atsulu a nɗa. <verse eid="ISA 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 23:4" />Wono a aci a Sidon, adama a na mala ma yuwan ta̱ adanshi, uba̱ta̱ o ucira u mala'a adansa, &lt;&lt;Koto n reve mɓa̱la̱ n limatan ko gba m matsan shi, waru koto n kungwato olobo ko esheli shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 23:5" />Mantsa ma na udammu u rawai Masar, a ta yuwan a̱tsumola̱ngu adama a alabari a Taya. <verse eid="ISA 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 23:6" />Pasai mavada a̱ tyo Tarshishi na̱ yorori, a̱ɗu a̱za̱ a̱ nden m memere ma̱ mini. <verse eid="ISA 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 23:7" />Lyuci gbain ma̱za̱nga̱ ma̱ ɗu ɗaɗa nda'a za na ri lo diga mantsa mo ufaru ɗe nu ujumu, za na ana a̱ yi a tara niyi a̱ tyo ɗe alanga adama a yuwan ɗe tsugbain? <verse eid="ISA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 23:8" />Zane ɗa foɓoi ili i nda a aci a Taya, za na tsu ca tsugono, za na aza a awina na atsulu a̱ yi muwun mu ngono n ɗa, waru azagbain o uvaɗi a ɗa? <verse eid="ISA 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 23:9" />A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a ɗa o foɓo niyi, adama u ca suru a̱za̱ o uvaɗu u tsugbain wono, adama u ka̱ɗa̱to aza a na suru a cayi tsugbain o uvaɗi. <verse eid="ISA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 23:10" />Pasai mavada me iɗa ma̱ ɗu tsu uɗolu wa̱ Nilu, a̱vu lyuci va Tarshishi, adama a na vu buwa nu ugeshete shi. <verse eid="ISA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 23:11" />A̱sulazuva a canana ta̱ ukere wa̱ yi zuva mala, reve u zuwa tsugono tsa̱ jinga̱ɗa̱. U yuwan ta̱ adanshi a aci a Ka'ana a na o kototo ba̱ta̱ a cira le. <verse eid="ISA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 23:12" />Reve u damma, &lt;&lt;Va̱a̱ da̱shi yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ shi, Usheli wa̱ Sidon u na koto u revei vali shi a̱vu gba ɓongiyi! 'Yon vu pasa mavada ma Sipurus, ko ɗe fo va̱a̱ tsura̱ wivuwun shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 23:13" />Uwwai nda, iɗa ya Babila, ama a ɗa a na a̱ shi e revei ne ele amma o lo shi. Aza a Asuriya a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ yi ta̱ wo o'wo uba̱ta̱ wu nden wi inama yu una. A yuwan abura a makumba adama o uvon u le, reve o ɓuɓoso kobu va̱ yi, reve a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ yi okongo. <verse eid="ISA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 23:14" />Oruwoi, a̱ɗu antsun a Tarshishi, adama a na o kototo ba̱ta̱ a cira ɗu.<verse eid="ISA 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 23:15" />A mantsa mo ndolo e te icina na̱ Taya hali a'wan kupocindere, a̱bunda̱ a a'wan a na mogono ma tsu yuwan. Amma o ukosu wa a'wan kupocindere'e, u ta fara na̱ Taya cine u ri e ishipa ya aashakala'a.<verse eid="ISA 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 23:16" />&lt;&lt;Tara kumburu, vu utula̱i na̱ lyuci gbain, aashakala a na e icinai. Vu wa'a kumburu'u ulobonu, vu cana ishipa a̱bunda̱, adama a cuwisan na̱ a̱vu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 23:17" />O ukosu wa a'wan kupocindere'e, A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ bura Taya. Waru u ta ka̱mba̱ a tsushakala tsa̱ yi tso u'ushishi wi ikebe na̱ nɗa mu uvaɗi suru. <verse eid="ISA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 23:18" />Waru ili i na yaa uwusa ni ikebe i na u tsura̱i a ta tawaa A̱sulazuva, waru aa zuwa le shi. Ili i na yaa uwusa yi u ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa aza a na a̱ ri nden a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva adama a̱ tsura̱ ilyalya pere na̱ a̱tugu a sa'ani lon.<verse eid="ISA 23:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ISA 24" />
  <para style="s">Ukototosu wu uvaɗi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 24:1" />Uwwai nda, gba, A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ lungusa̱ uvaɗi, u ta ka̱mbuwa̱ yi okongo, waru u ta̱ punda̱ra̱ iɗa yu uvaɗi reve u baza aza a na a̱ ri na̱ nden pe. <verse eid="ISA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 24:2" />Waru ili i ta̱ i ɗa yaa cina ganu na ama, za vu u'wa na aagbashi, mma va aasula nu usheli wa aasula, za va awina na̱ za va atsulu, za vo okopu na̱ za vu ucasu wo okopu, za vu utan na̱ za na cayi utan. <verse eid="ISA 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 24:3" />Uvaɗi u to o'wo ofoli waru a̱ ta̱ pura̱ ili suru suru. A̱sulazuva a ɗa a yuwain adanshi a nda. <verse eid="ISA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 24:4" />Uvaɗi u te 'yewe nu u kpanli. Waru uvaɗi u ta la̱nga̱ nu u kpanli, ama a gbagbain o uvaɗi a ta maramba. <verse eid="ISA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 24:5" />Uvaɗi wo o'wo ta̱ idaba adama a aza a na a̱ ri nden pe, adama a na a̱ kuɗa̱ ta̱ a yuwan tsutoni na̱ wila̱. Reve waru a̱ kuɗa̱ a̱ kuru ili i na n zuwai, a̱vu a kuɗa akucunu a babu ukotu. <verse eid="ISA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 24:6" />Adama o ndolo ɗa una̱ waa lyuwusa uvaɗi, waru ama a ta tara ume wu unusu u le. Waru adama o ndolo a ɗa a̱ kula̱toi ama o uvaɗi, waru ama wa'a ɗa a buwai. <verse eid="ISA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 24:7" />Masayan ma sa'avu mo ukwan ta̱, waru aataci a ina̱bi kpanla ta̱. Aza a na suru a̱ da̱na̱i a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ a̱ ka̱mba̱ ta̱ a̱za̱ a̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu a̱ ma̱nga̱. <verse eid="ISA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 24:8" />Uyo'o wa aganga u koto ta̱, elemu e mere ma̱ a̱ a̱za̱ a̱ a̱buki mo koto ta̱, ma̱za̱nga̱ ma̱ kumburu ma̱ rungwa̱ ta̱. <verse eid="ISA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 24:9" />A̱a̱ da̱shi sowo masayan na a cani ishipa shi. Ma̱ra̱ mo wo'o ta̱ okono e ekere a aza a na oo sowuso yi. <verse eid="ISA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 24:10" />Ilyuci i gbagbain yo wo'o ta̱ ofoli no okongo, waru a katsu ta̱ na̱ntsu vu u'wa suru. <verse eid="ISA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 24:11" />A̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ o yorori e re adama o ulambu u masayan. Ma̱za̱nga̱ me le suru ma̱ ka̱mba̱ ta̱ irumbu, mere mo koto ta̱ o uvaɗi. <verse eid="ISA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 24:12" />A lyawa ta̱ lyuci gbain okongo, waru a ɓuɓatsa na̱ntsu va̱ yi muɓaci muɓaci. <verse eid="ISA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 24:13" />A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa ili i na ya̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ e memere mo uvaɗi na ama, tsa mantsa ma na a tsu za̱ka̱tsa̱ uɗanga u zetun, tso u'yanlu a mantsa ma na o kotoi uta'an u ina̱bi. <verse eid="ISA 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 24:14" />A̱ 'ya̱sa̱n ta̱ ɗyo le, a yuwan ta̱ yorori i ma̱za̱nga̱, aza a na a̱ ri a̱livu waru o to orowo adama a tsugbain tsa̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="ISA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 24:15" />Adama o ndolo aza a na a̱ ri upasu wa asana a ta ca A̱sulazuva tsugbain. Aza a na waru a̱ ri a̱ nge'en m mala, a ta ca ala a̱ A̱sulazuva tsugbain, A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila. <verse eid="ISA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 24:16" />Diga o ukosu wu uvaɗi tsu ta uwwusa uɗyo wi ishipa yi ica, ishipa i tsugbain a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wu Za va̱ A̱ɓula̱. Amma n damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;N la̱nga̱ ta̱, n la̱nga̱ ta̱! A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a cina mu ta̱! A̱za̱ e ikpa'a e reme ta̱ ulinga wi kpa'a, a̱za̱ e ipkpa'a a lyuwa ta̱ elime na̱ mayan me ikpa'a!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 24:17" />Ili i wovon na̱ a̱ka̱ri na̱ maza a ta pura ɗu, a̱ɗu ama o uvaɗi. <verse eid="ISA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 24:18" />Za na suru sumai adama o uɗyo wi ili i wovon u ta̱ riya̱ a̱ a̱ka̱ri, za na waru uta̱i a̱ka̱ri u ta riya̱ a maza. Adama a na na̱ntsu va zuva ta̱ kpa̱tu'wa̱, waru ikyun yu uvaɗi i ta̱ jinga̱ɗa̱. <verse eid="ISA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 24:19" />Uvaɗi u to ɓoso ma̱ɓula̱, u te ne'eshenlei, waru u ta̱ jinga̱ɗa̱ lon. <verse eid="ISA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 24:20" />Uvaɗi u ta̱ da̱na̱ o utakalyuwusa tso ososowi, u da̱na̱ a̱ jinga̱ɗa̱sa̱ tso oogodo, ume wu unusu wa̱ yi u ta a aci a̱ yi. U ta riya̱ agba waa gura da̱shi 'yon shi. <verse eid="ISA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 24:21" />O urana u ndolo A̱sulazuva a ta ca cira va zuva a̱tsuma̱lima̱ zuva, na̱ ngono mu uvaɗi e iɗa. <verse eid="ISA 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 24:22" />O to ɓoloto le uba̱ta̱ u ta̱ tsa aza a na a̱ ri o u'wa wa ali a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ka̱ri. A̱ ta̱ ɓa̱ru le o u'wa wa ali, waru na a yuwan rana va̱ a̱bunda̱ a ta ca le a̱tsuma̱lima̱. <verse eid="ISA 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 24:23" />Woto u ta yuwan irumbu, urana waru u ta uwwa wono, adama a na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a ɗa a yuwusan tsugono tsa masasan ma̱ Sihiyona na̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima. Tsugbain tsa̱ yi waru tsa̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma azagbain a̱ yi.<verse eid="ISA 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ISA 25" />
  <para style="s">Ica a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 25:1" />A̱sulazuva a̱vu ɗa A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱, n ta ca wu tsugbain, n ta cuwa ala a̱ wu, adama a na vu yuwan ta̱ ili ya asalama, ili i na vu foɓoi ɗe nu ujumu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ na amayun. <verse eid="ISA 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 25:2" />Vu ka̱mbuwa̱ ta̱ lyuci gbain edemu, lyuci vu ucira'a wo o'wo ta̱ okongo, a̱a̱ da̱shi ene ukobu u tsugono wo omocin shi, a̱a̱ da̱shi suwisa yi shi. <verse eid="ISA 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 25:3" />Adama o ndolo ama o ucira a ta ca wu tsugbain, ilyuci yi nɗa ya aza a wuya a ta uwwa wovon wa̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 25:4" />Adama a na a̱vu ukafata wa̱ a̱za̱ o ulambu u ɗa, ukafata wa aza a na a̱ ri e izami yi ikambishi pe a̱tsuma̱lima̱ e le. Vo o'wo le ta̱ upa'atan e ekere a̱ wunla̱, waru vo o'wo le ta̱ ululu diga o usuɗuwu wu urana. Adama a na wivuwun wa aza a wuya u ta̱ tsu upepu u wunla̱ u na u tsu fabasa uɓaɓu, <verse eid="ISA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 25:5" />waru tsu usuɗuwu wa̱ a̱tsumona. Ne ɗa vi isawatoin elemu o omocin cine ululu we eleshe u tsu jiba usuɗuwu wu urana, ne ɗa vi isawatoin ishipa ya aza a wuya. <verse eid="ISA 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 25:6" />A masasan ma nda A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva o to foɓoo ama suru a̱buki e ilyalya i na i la'ai ulobonu, a̱buki a masayan mo ufaru, e inama i na i la'ai ulobonu na̱ masayan ma na ma la'ai uyo'o. <verse eid="ISA 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 25:7" />A masasan ma nda ma ɗa woo kototo aapalutsu a na a palai ama suru, nu umuna u na wu palai nɗa suru. <verse eid="ISA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 25:8" />A̱sulazuva Zagbain to kototo ukwa̱ suru suru, waru u ta tasa aɓara o urewesu suru, u ta tawa wono wa ama a̱ yi o uvaɗi suru. A̱sulazuva ɗa a dammai. <verse eid="ISA 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 25:9" />O urana u ndolo a ta damma, &lt;&lt;Amayun a̱yi nda ɗa A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu, tsu ca ta̱ amayun ya̱'a̱ yi, waru u wawa tsu ta̱. A̱yi nda ɗa A̱sulazuva, tsu zuwaa yi ta̱ ucira, lyawa tsu yuwain ma̱za̱nga̱ na̱ mere a̱tsuma̱ e iwawi ya̱ yi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 25:10" />Adama a na ukere wa̱ A̱sulazuva u ta̱ cipa̱ zuva masasan ma nda, amma a ta dadasa a̱za̱ a̱ Mowa e iɗa cine a tsu dadasa tsu'iwa̱ a̱tsuma̱ e edemu. <verse eid="ISA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 25:11" />A ta canana ekere e le a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi, cine za vu uda̱su tsu fabi ekere adama o uda̱su. A̱sula̱ a̱ ta̱ ka̱ɗa̱to uvaɗu u le, suru nu ugbozu we ekere e le. <verse eid="ISA 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 25:12" />U to ɓuɓoso ɓaɓu vu ucira ɗu, u ka̱mba̱to le e iɗa suru suru a̱ tyo a̱ ma̱buta̱.<verse eid="ISA 25:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ISA 26" />
  <para style="s">Ishipa yi ica</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 26:1" />O urana u ndolo a ta cana ishipa i nda a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya Yahuda, &lt;&lt;Tsu ta̱ na̱ lyuci vu ucira, A̱sula̱ a yuwan ta̱ iwawi wo o'wo isula nu uɓaɓu wa̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 26:2" />Kpa̱tu'wa̱i na̱ntsu na iɗa ya̱ a̱ɓula̱ yaa uwa, iɗa i na i ri na̱ a̱ɓula̱. <verse eid="ISA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 26:3" />Vu tsu ca ta̱ nden ma asuvu ma amayun suru suru, aza a na okolo e le a̱ ri mishin ugbamu, adama a na a zuwai ucira u le ya̱'a̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 26:4" />Zuwai ucira uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva hali hali, adama a na A̱sulazuva, A̱sulazuva a ɗa upa'atan u babu ukotu. <verse eid="ISA 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 26:5" />U ka̱ɗa̱to ta̱ aza a na a̱ ri a̱ nden uba̱ta̱ wa zuva, u cipa̱to ta̱ lyuci na ri zuva e iɗa. Wo oco yi ta̱ hali a̱ tyo e iɗa a̱vu wo oco yi a̱ ma̱buta̱. <verse eid="ISA 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 26:6" />A ta dasa yi na ana a aza a na o ɓongiyi, ana a̱ a̱za̱ o ulambu. <verse eid="ISA 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 26:7" />Ure va̱ a̱za̱ a̱ɓula̱ u ka̱ra̱ ta̱ mejege, a̱vu Za va̱ A̱ɓula̱. Vu yuwan ta̱ ure wa̱ a̱za̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱ pete. <verse eid="ISA 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 26:8" />A̱tsu a̱tsuma̱ o ure wu uge'etosu wa̱ wu, A̱sulazuva tsu puro wu ta̱. Ala a̱ wu nu ucuwusan wa̱ wu a̱yi ɗa majiyan mo okolo a̱ tsu. <verse eid="ISA 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 26:9" />Okolo a̱ va̱ a ta majiyan ma̱ wu na ayin, nu usana ruhu va̱ te e ibingi ya̱ wu na amayun. Adama a na na̱ vu ge'eto uvaɗi ama o uvaɗi o to rito mayan ma̱ a̱ɓula̱. <verse eid="ISA 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 26:10" />Ko no o roco ta̱ za vi iwuya isa'ani, woo rito mayan ma̱ a̱ɓula̱ shi, ko pa nda e iɗa ya̱ a̱za̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱ a lyuwa ta̱ elime na̱ mayan me iwuya, waru e ene tsugbain tsa̱ A̱sulazuva shi. <verse eid="ISA 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 26:11" />A̱sulazuva, vu 'ya̱sa̱n ta̱ ukere wa̱ wu zuva, agba e ene yi shi. Lyawa le e ene ukadu wa̱ wu uba̱ta̱ wa ama a̱ wu, waru a uwwa wono. Lyawa akina a na o foɓoyi n'yuwatan ma̱ wu a lyuwa le. <verse eid="ISA 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 26:12" />A̱sulazuva, vu ta zuwaa tsu nden ma asuvu, ili i na tsu yuwain suru a̱vu ɗa vu kamba ntsu. <verse eid="ISA 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 26:13" />A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu, babu na̱ a̱vu ozo o ro a yuwan ta̱ tsugono tsa̱ tsu, amma ala a̱ wu ɗa goon tsaa cuwusan. <verse eid="ISA 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 26:14" />Gogo a̱ kuwa̱ ta̱, waru a̱a̱ da̱shi yuwan wuma shi, lulu le va̱a̱ 'yon shi. Vu ca le ta̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a̱vu vu kototo le, babu za na a̱a̱ da̱shi cuwan ne ele. <verse eid="ISA 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 26:15" />Amma vu da̱shi ta̱ a̱bunda̱ a ama'a, A̱sulazuva, vu da̱shi ta̱ a̱bunda̱ a ama'a. Vu tsura̱a̱ ta̱ aciya̱wu tsugbain, vu da̱shi ta̱ kpa̱tu'wa̱ suru kosu vi iɗa. <verse eid="ISA 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 26:16" />A̱sulazuva a̱tsuma̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a zami wu ta̱. Ana vu ca nle a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a gura uta̱a̱ uɗyo a yuwan avasa shi. <verse eid="ISA 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 26:17" />Cine ka va̱ a̱tsuma̱ tsu da̱nu teri e imingiru e mesun adama a̱ mɓa̱la̱, ne ɗa tso o'woi a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ wu A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="ISA 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 26:18" />Tsu yuwan ta̱ a̱tsuma̱, reve tsu reme imingiru, agba babu ili i na tsu matsain she upepu. Tsu ta̱wa̱ ni iwawi o uvaɗi shi, waru tsu matsan ama o uvaɗi shi. <verse eid="ISA 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 26:19" />Ama a̱ ɗu a na a̱ kuwa̱i a̱ ta̱ tsura̱ wuma, lipu le ta̱ 'yon. A̱ɗu aza a na a̱ ri nden a̱ ma̱bula̱, 'yoyin i cana ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱. Adama a na a'iza a̱ wu a'iza e ekan a ɗa, waru iɗa i to uta̱a̱ aza a na a̱ kuwa̱i. <verse eid="ISA 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 26:20" />Ka̱ra̱i a̱ɗu ama a̱ va̱, i uwa a asula a̱ ɗu, a̱vu i ɓa̱ru na̱ntsu ɗu. I pa'aton aciya̱ɗu hali ma mantsa wa'a hali she nu upa'an u ka̱ra̱. <verse eid="ISA 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 26:21" />Uwwai nda, A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ diga uba̱ta̱ u na u ri nden u ca ama o uvaɗi a̱tsuma̱lima̱ adama o unusu u le. Iɗa i ta̱ kpa̱tu'wa̱ mpasa n na o ocoi zuva va̱ yi, waru wa̱a̱ da̱shi soko aza a na o unai shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 26:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ISA 27" />
  <para style="s">Iwawi ya Isra'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 27:1" />O urana u ndolo, A̱sulazuva a ta tara matsun me pe'eni ma̱ yi za vu ucira, za vu ugbamu u ca Leviyatan yo vi ilaɗi ndolo oforo, Leviyatan<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 41:1">Ayb 41:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 74:14">Ica 74:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:26">Ica 104:26</ref>.</char></note> yo ndolo za na tsu walasa ugondoru. Waru u to una ididi i na i ri pe a mala. <verse eid="ISA 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 27:2" />O urana u ndolo, &lt;&lt;Canai ishipa adama o uɗuma̱ u sa'ani u ina̱bi i damma, <verse eid="ISA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 27:3" />A̱mu, A̱sulazuva, a̱mu ɗa za na a̱ pirishi yi, mantsa suru n tsu tsun yi ta̱ mini. N tsu piri yi ta̱ urana na ayin, adama ta̱wa̱ za ro lungusa̱ yi wan. <verse eid="ISA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 27:4" />N yuwan upan shi. A̱ shi a damma awanda na̱ ma̱lyo ma ɗa mo uta̱i a yuwan nla̱ngi na̱ a̱mu, n shi ta̱ a̱ riya̱a̱ le uvon, n kula̱to le na akina. <verse eid="ISA 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 27:5" />Ko gba na̱ ne ɗa shi lyawa le a̱ ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ u va̱ adama n pa'aton le, lyawa le a zami nden ma asuvu na̱ a̱mu, lyawa le a zami nden ma asuvu na̱ a̱mu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 27:6" />A rana na va̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ Yakubu ta̱ tsura̱ ikyun, aza a Isra'ila o to topo a yuwan yipa̱lu, waru muwun n na a matsain o to shiton uvaɗi. <verse eid="ISA 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 27:7" />A̱sulazuva a faba yi ta̱ cine u fabai aza a na a faba niyi? Ko o una yi ta̱ cine o unai aza a na o una niyi? <verse eid="ISA 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 27:8" />A̱sulazuva a ca ta̱ ama a̱ yi a̱tsuma̱lima̱ ana u tyowetyo nle e iɗa i tsugbashi, nu upepu wa asana wu ucira u ɗa waru wu uta̱a̱ nle. <verse eid="ISA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 27:9" />Ne tsunda tsa ɗa aa tara ume wu unusu wa Yakubu, a̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa ili i na matawa mo unusu wa̱ yi ma̱ ta̱wa̱yi. A mantsa ma na u minjirai atali a musa'a suru a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ nle uruku wa atali o uminjuru muɓaci muɓaci, babu a̱shuwutsu a Ashera ko musa'a ma̱ a̱tsuka̱ a̱ ma̱guru a na aa lyawa mishin. <verse eid="ISA 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 27:10" />Adama a na lyuci gbain na ri nu ukari wo o'wo ta̱ okongo, a lyawa yi ta̱ tsa̱ a̱tsumona a na a̱ ri na̱ za shi. Wo o'wo ta̱ uba̱ta̱ wa alyuna a̱ mudindim, pe ɗa o von a tama eten a̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 27:11" />Ana eten a̱ yi e 'yewei reve a kuɗa, a̱vu a̱ma̱ci a̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱ pura̱ adama a zuwaa akina ne ele. Adama a na ele ama a ɗa a na a̱ ri nu urevu shi, a̱yi za na yuwan le wee ene iliyali i le shi, a̱yi za na yuwan le woo roco le isa'ani shi.<verse eid="ISA 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 27:12" />O urana u ndolo diga o uɗolu wa̱ Yufireti a̱ tyo o Uɗolu wa Masar, A̱sulazuva o to ɓoloto ɗu tsi ishina. U to ɓoloto ɗu a̱za̱ a̱ ta̱ ta̱, a̱ɗu ama a Isra'ila. <verse eid="ISA 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 27:13" />Waru o urana u ndolo a̱ te ivula̱ a̱ba̱jini a aabulu, waru aza a na a̱ puwa̱in a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya Asuriya na aza a na a̱ gba̱ra̱i a̱ tyo e iɗa ya Masar a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ a yuwaan A̱sulazuva a̱ga̱nda̱ a masasan ma akiza ma̱ Urishelima.<verse eid="ISA 27:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ISA 28" />
  <para style="s">A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a aci a Ifiramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 28:1" />Woo yo'ono wu shi, a̱vu okokolo o ososowi a aciyogbamu a Ifiramu, na̱ yipa̱lu i na i tsu kpanla tsugbain tso ulobonu tsa̱ yi, za na ri zuva vu uka̱ri wu umuli wa aza a na ma̱ra̱ ma lyuwai aci e le. <verse eid="ISA 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 28:2" />Uwwai nda, Zagbain ta̱ na̱ vuma gbain vu ucira, cine vu revei wunla̱ wa atayan, nu upepu wu ulungusu u tsu ta̱wa̱ na̱ mini ma zuva, u tsu ro'o yi ta̱ nu ucira e iɗa. <verse eid="ISA 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 28:3" />Ookokolo a aciyogbamu o ososowi a Ifiramu a ta dadasa le za̱la̱ va ana. <verse eid="ISA 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 28:4" />Waru yipa̱lu i na yoo oco yu ulobonu lon ya̱ yi za na ri a zuva vu uka̱ri vu umuli u to o'wo tsu umatsun wu ufaru wu ubiri a mantsa mo ulili, za na diga na̱ za ro e ene yi u to lyuwushi niyi a̱yi a uwa o ukere wa̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 28:5" />O urana u ndolo A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva o to o'wo ookokolo a tsugbain, ookokolo a sa'ani adama a akapi a ama a̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 28:6" />U to ca ruhu va amayun uba̱ta̱ wu za vu uge'etosu, nu ucira uba̱ta̱ wa aza a na a vadalai uvon a̱ ka̱mba̱ o una̱ntsu. <verse eid="ISA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 28:7" />Ama̱sula̱ na̱ nan ganu fo a takalyusa ta̱ adama o usowu wu ucira. A̱ da̱na̱ ta̱ o uta̱ɗa̱tsa̱sa̱ adama a masayan, a̱ da̱na̱ o togɓolyuso adama a̱ a̱bunda̱ a masayan. Waru e te inda irumbu irumbu a̱tsuma̱ alavu alavu e le. Reve o o'wo a yuwusan unusu uba̱ta̱ o uge'etosu. <verse eid="ISA 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 28:8" />A̱ shiton ta̱ apada suru na̱ tsushaamu, babu uba̱ta̱ u na u ri cece. <verse eid="ISA 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 28:9" />&lt;&lt;Zane ɗa u cigai u rito urevu? Waru nan zane ɗa waa cuɗuwa ikaka ya̱ yi? Uba̱ta̱ u muwun n na a kasai maani, ko uba̱ta̱ wa aza a na a kasai maani gogo? <verse eid="ISA 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 28:10" />Ili i na tsaa uwwusa a̱yi ɗa, yuwain yuwain, yuwain yuwain, wila̱ a aci a̱ wila̱, wila̱ a aci a̱ wila̱, nda wa'a ndeɗe wa'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 28:11" />Amayun nu una̱ u na i revei shi ne elentsu a na a̱ ri ko'o A̱sulazuva a ta yuwan adanshi na ama a nda, <verse eid="ISA 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 28:12" />e ekere a za na u dammai, &lt;&lt;Nda uba̱ta̱ u wivuwun kpaku, lyawa aza a na a̱ ri ukunu e ivuwan,&gt;&gt; waru, &lt;&lt;Nda ɗa uba̱ta̱ a̱ nden ma asuvu&gt;&gt; agba i 'yuwan ta̱ a uwwa. <verse eid="ISA 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 28:13" />Waru ne ɗa adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva oo o'wo uba̱ta̱ u le, yuwain yuwain, yuwain yuwain, wila̱ a aci a̱ wila̱, wila̱ a aci a̱ wila̱, nda wa'a ndeɗe wa'a. Ele a̱ ka̱ra̱, a̱vu a̱ riya̱ melene, a̱vu a kuɗa, a̱vu a azu le a̱vu e reme le. <verse eid="ISA 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 28:14" />Adama o ndolo, yu uwwa adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱ɗu a̱za̱ o ulamu a na aa yuwusan tsugono tsa a ama nda a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima. <verse eid="ISA 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 28:15" />Adama a na i ta dansa, &lt;&lt;Tsu yuwan ta̱ akucunu nu ukwa̱, waru na aason tsu yuwan ta̱ nzuwulai. Mantsa ma na a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a̱ a̱bunda̱ o ndolo o utula̱i, wa̱a̱ ju'wa̱n tsu shi, adama a na tsu ka̱mbuwa̱ ta̱ epen ukafata u tsu, na̱ wulumu uba̱ta̱ o upa'atan u tsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 28:16" />Adama o ndolo nda ili i na Zagbain A̱sulazuva a dammai, &lt;&lt;Uwwai nda, n ta̱ shuwa̱ aatali a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Sihiyona, aatali a na a̱ lyungwa̱i, aatali a sa'ani e ikyun yu usaa adama a mavara mo usaa wa amayun: Suru za na cayi amayun uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi, waa uwwa wovon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Uvadalu wa̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Heleni u damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;wa uwwa wono shi.&gt;&gt;</char></note> shi. <verse eid="ISA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 28:17" />N ta̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ amayun wo o'wo amunga o uritosu wu usaa, a̱ɓula̱ waru u to o'wo ili yu uritosu wu usaa. Atayan waru e te iza̱ upa'atan u ɗu we epen, mini ma̱ a̱bunda̱ waru ma̱ te iza̱ uba̱ta̱ o upa'atan u ɗu. <verse eid="ISA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 28:18" />Akucunu a̱ ɗu nu ukwa̱ a̱ to una le, waru nzuwulai n ɗu na aason ee isawan shi. Mantsa ma na a̱tsuma̱lima̱'a̱ o utula̱i, o to polo ɗu na̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="ISA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 28:19" />Suru mantsa ma na woo utula̱i, u ta̱ pura̱ ɗu, usana suru, nu urana ko na ayin u te iza̱ o utula̱i.&gt;&gt; Urevu wi ikaka i nda u ta̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ tsuda'un. <verse eid="ISA 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 28:20" />A̱ga̱da̱'a̱ o to o'wo mokoɗi ma na za aa gura buba̱ruwa̱ ɗe shi, a̱a̱ba̱ra̱gu waru wa̱a̱ da̱na̱ washin u na za aa gura pupala na̱ a̱yi shi. <verse eid="ISA 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 28:21" />Adama a na A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ 'yon nu usuɗuwu cine u yuwain a Masasan ma Perazim, u ta̱ 'yon e meje'en u yuwan ulinga wa̱ yi, cine u yuwain o Uka̱ri wa Gibiyon, ulinga wa asalama u yuwan ulinga wa̱ yi, ulinga u sa'avu. <verse eid="ISA 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 28:22" />Adama o ndolo i lyawa a yuwusan ulamu, na̱ ne ɗa shi, akani a̱ ɗu a̱ ta̱ da̱shi ugbamu. Adama a na mu uwwa ta̱ diga uba̱ta̱ u Zagbain A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva, adama o ukototosu wi iɗa'a ma̱ɓula̱. <verse eid="ISA 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 28:23" />Poloi atsuvu, a̱vu yu uwwa adanshi a̱ va̱, i ka̱mbuwa̱ ugbozu yu uwwa ili i na maa dansa. <verse eid="ISA 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 28:24" />Na̱ cimbi yuwan iluma adama a̱ ca̱'a̱n u tsu lyuwa ta̱ elime ni iluma kuci? Ko u tsu ɓatsasa ta̱ iɗa kuci? <verse eid="ISA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 28:25" />Nu u lapula uɗuma̱ u koto, u tsu yuwan ca̱'a̱n shi? N damma u tsu zazanu ta̱ icu'un i na a̱ tsu ɗe ɗaɗoya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɗaɗoya icu'un i ro i ɗa i na a̱ tsu cu'wa̱n e iɗa ya aza a Yahuda.</char></note> na̱ kumin? U tsu cu'wa̱n yitabo a̱ guzu le shi oroci a yitabo waru na̱ guzu le shi? A̱ nge'en ma̱ a̱ɗuma̱ waru u tsu cu'wa̱n ishina shi? <verse eid="ISA 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 28:26" />Adama a na A̱sula̱ a̱ yi o to rocosu yi, waru u to rocosu yi ili i mejege. <verse eid="ISA 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 28:27" />U tsu faba isu'wan i uri na aaɗanga a faba vi ishina, ko o rono keke vi inan e isu'wan i uri shi, amma na̱ maɗanga ma ɗa u tsu fabusa le ben. <verse eid="ISA 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 28:28" />A tsu ira ta̱ ishina adama a yuwan opopofu, a tsu faba a fabisa le shi. Agba ko ana a tsu dadasa le ni ikeke yi ina i na ido yoo ronuso, a tsu ɓatsa le shi. <verse eid="ISA 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 28:29" />Suru ili i nda diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva suru ɗa, za va̱ a̱sa̱la̱ a sa'ani waru na̱ tapu nu ugbozu.<verse eid="ISA 28:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="ISA 29" />
  <para style="s">A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a̱ tyo a̱ lyuci gbain va̱ Da̱wuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 29:1" />A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a ta cina wu, Ariye, Ariye, lyuci gbain va̱ Da̱wuda na u da̱nuyi. A'wan a'wan waru lyawa a lyuwa elime na̱ a̱buki a'wan a'wan cine a tsu yuwusan. <verse eid="ISA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 29:2" />Suru na̱ ne n ta ca Ariye a̱tsuma̱lima̱, waru ɗe ɗa waa yuwan mesun na̱ magaga ma anga ma̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu, waru u to o'wo ya̱'a̱ va̱ tsa Ariye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na̱ Tsuyahuda Ariye ta gura o'wo masa'a</char></note>. <verse eid="ISA 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 29:3" />N ta̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ wu Ariye nu uvon, waru n ta̱ riya̱a̱ wu nu uvon, reve n 'ya̱sa̱n itana yu uvon a aaci a̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 29:4" />Waru a̱ ta̱ ka̱ɗa̱to wu hali she e iɗa, diga e iɗa vaa yuwan adanshi, waru diga a̱ ma̱buta̱ vaa yuwan adanshi babu ucira. Uɗyo wa̱ wu u to uta̱ diga e iɗa tsu uɗyo wa̱ a̱kwisa̱kwisa̱, waru diga a̱ ma̱buta̱ ma ɗa uɗyo wa̱ wu waa yuwan yemenu. <verse eid="ISA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 29:5" />Amma n'yuwatan ma̱ wu na̱ a̱bunda̱ o to o'wo tsa̱ ma̱buta̱. Oɓolo a̱ a̱soja e le aza a na e tse ene iliyali yi za shi, a ta tawa le tso owopo. Babu urevu, <verse eid="ISA 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 29:6" />A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ adama a̱ ɗu na̱ tsata nu ura̱ma̱su wi iɗa ne elemu a̱ a̱bunda̱, na̱ wunla̱ wu upepu na̱ lipa̱ ne elentsu a akina za vu ukula̱tosu. <verse eid="ISA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 29:7" />Reve suru oɓolo a nɗa a na a yuwain uvon na̱ Ariye, suru aza a na a yuwain uvon na̱ a̱yi nu uba̱ta̱ wu ucira wa̱ yi, na aza a na a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ niyi nu uvon o o'wo tsa alavu, na alavu alavu a ayin. <verse eid="ISA 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 29:8" />Cine vuma na a uwwusa ambulu tsu yuwan alavu a na waa lyuwusa ilyalya, a̱vu gba nu u jiwan a̱vu u da̱na̱ na ambulu a̱ yi babu cuwa̱n, ko cine za va akuli tsu yuwan alavu o sowuso mini, a̱vu gba nu u jiwan a̱vu u da̱na̱ na akuli, akuli a̱ yi o koto shi. Ne ɗa oɓolo a nɗa n na n yuwusain uvon na̱ masasan ma̱ Sihiyona suru oo o'wo. <verse eid="ISA 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 29:9" />Da̱da'watoyin aciya̱ɗu yo o'wo wuda'un to, yo o'wo nrumba̱. I da̱na̱ usowu, agba na̱ masayan ma ɗa shi, a takalyusa agba usowu wa̱ a̱bunda̱ u ɗa shi. <verse eid="ISA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 29:10" />Adama a na A̱sulazuva a̱ tsuwa̱n ɗu ta̱ ruhu vu nlavu va̱ a̱ru'un. Waru u ɓa̱ru ta̱ esu a̱ ɗu (ama̱sula̱), waru A̱sulazuva a̱ ɓa̱ru ta̱ urevu u ɗu (a̱za̱ a̱ yeni).<verse eid="ISA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 29:11" />Waru suru alavu alavu a nda a̱ ta̱wa̱ ɗu ta̱ tsa adanshi a aatagada o usuru. Na a ca vuma na gurai ɗesununa̱ a̱vu a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Ɗe nda'a nu una̱,&gt;&gt; u ta damma, &lt;&lt;Maa gura shi adama a na u tu usuru.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 29:12" />Waru na a ca za na tsu gura ɗenuna̱ shi aatagada, a̱vu a damma yi, &lt;&lt;Ɗe nda'a nu una̱,&gt;&gt; u ta̱ usu, &lt;&lt;Maa gura shi adama a na n reve cine a̱ tsu ɗenuna̱ shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 29:13" />Reve Zagbain damma, &lt;&lt;Ama a nda a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ zuzu na̱ a̱mu waru nu una̱ goon ɗa aa casu mu tsugbain, amma okolo e le a yuwan ta̱ alanga na̱ a̱mu. A̱ga̱nda̱ a na aa yuwusaan mu wila̱ wu vaɗilima̱ u ɗa u na ama o ritoi. <verse eid="ISA 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 29:14" />Adama o ndolo, n ta da̱shi yuwisan ili ya asalama a aci e ili ya asalama na ama a nda. Urevu wa̱ a̱za̱ o urevu u ta̱ puwa̱n, ugbozu wa̱ a̱za̱ o ugbozu u to koto.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 29:15" />A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a ta cina ɗu a̱ɗu aza a na i tsu soko A̱sulazuva majiyan ma̱ ɗu a̱ru'un, aza a na aa yuwusan ulinga u le a̱tsuma̱ e irumbu, aza a na a dansaa, &lt;&lt;Zane ɗa e inda tsu? Zane ɗa reve ntsu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 29:16" />I vadaluwa ta̱ ili suru. A ta tara za vu uma'an a̱ ka̱mba̱to yi olo'o, a na ili i na a yuwain waa damma za na yuwan niyi, &lt;&lt;U yuwan mu shi&gt;&gt;? Upondo u ta damma za na yuwan niyi, &lt;&lt;U reve ili shi&gt;&gt;? <verse eid="ISA 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 29:17" />A̱tsuma̱ a mantsa wa'a, a̱a̱rumbu a Lebanon aa vadaluwa wo o'wo iɗa yu umili shi, iɗa yu umili waru wo o'wo a̱a̱rumbu shi? <verse eid="ISA 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 29:18" />O urana u ndolo agulani a ta uwwa adanshi a aatagada, nrumba̱ waru aza a na a̱ ri nden e irumbu e te ene. <verse eid="ISA 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 29:19" />Waru aza a na a̱ ka̱ɗa̱toi aciyele a ta yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva, waru a̱za̱ o ulambu a ta yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Za va Akiza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="ISA 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 29:20" />Adama a na aza a na e tse ne iliyali shi o to koto waru a ta tawa a̱za̱ o ulamu, waru a̱za̱ e izami yi iwuya suru o to kototo le. <verse eid="ISA 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 29:21" />Aza a na na adanshi e ili i na e revei shi a tsu zuwa za na ri nu unusu shi wo o'wo nu unusu, aza a na a tsa azu aza a na a̱ ri na amayun uba̱ta̱ o uge'etosu. Waru na adanshi e epen a tsu putsa za na ri nu unusu shi amayun.<verse eid="ISA 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 29:22" />Adama o ndolo nda ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, za na tsupayi Ibrahim, adama o u'wa wa Yakubu, &lt;&lt;Yakubu a̱a̱ da̱shi uwwa wono shi, urewesu wa̱ yi wa̱a̱ da̱shi ɗa̱mba̱ shi. <verse eid="ISA 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 29:23" />Adama a na na̱ we ene muwun ma̱ yi, ulinga wu ukere u va̱ e memere ma̱ yi, a̱ ta̱ guza̱ ala a̱ va̱ cece. A̱ ta̱ ka̱mba̱to Za va Akiza a Yakubu cece waru a ta ca A̱sula̱ a aza a Isra'ila tsugbain. <verse eid="ISA 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 29:24" />Aza a na ruhu le puwa̱in ure a̱ ta̱ tsura̱ urevu, aza a na waru a tsu yuwusan adanshawuya a̱ ta̱ usu uritosu.<verse eid="ISA 29:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="ISA 30" />
  <para style="s">A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a ta cina iɗa ya aciyogbamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 30:1" />&lt;&lt;Reve A̱sulazuva a damma, a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a ta cina ɗu muwun ma aciyogbamu aza a na a tsu yuwan ifoɓi i na i ri za va̱ shi, aza a na aa yuwusan ifoɓi i na i ri za va̱, amma na̱ ruhu va̱ shi, aa yuwusan unusu a aci o unusu. <verse eid="ISA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 30:2" />Aza a na a lapai a̱ tyo Masar agba a zami a̱sa̱la̱ a̱ va̱ shi, aza a na aa zamishi ikambishi uba̱ta̱ wa Firi'awuna waru aa zamishi upa'atan o ululu wa Masar. <verse eid="ISA 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 30:3" />Amma ugeshu u na Firi'awuna ee geshe ɗu u to zuwa ɗu yo o'wo ɗu ili i wono, waru upa'atan wa Masar u ta zuwa ɗu yo o'wo ili yi izo'oshi. <verse eid="ISA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 30:4" />Ko na wo o'woi azagbain a̱ yi a rawa ta̱ ɗe Zowan waru nlingata ma̱ yi n rawa ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a Hanes, <verse eid="ISA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 30:5" />za suru u ta uwwa wono diga uba̱ta̱ wa ama a na a̱a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ le ni ikambishi shi, aza a na a̱ tsu ta̱wa̱ ni ikambishi ko ulyuwu we elime shi, amma she ili i wono ni izo'oshi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 30:6" />Ikaka adama e inama ya Nege. O uta̱la̱i e iɗa ya addama na̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱, iɗa yi ikamu na̱ a̱ma̱ci e ikamu na agbaji ni iruku, utanuwu nu utsuru u le o nloli. Waru itana yi izuwa i le utanuwu o oboto a arakumi a̱ tyo e iɗa i na i ri nu ikambishi shi. <verse eid="ISA 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 30:7" />Ikambi i na Masar aa yuwan pere ɗa. Adama o ndolo a ɗa n ɗe niyi Rahab na tsu da̱nu babu yuwan ili. <verse eid="ISA 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 30:8" />Waru gogo she vu 'ya̱wa̱ vu ɗana idanshi i nda a aɓaci a atali waru vu ɗana le a̱tsuma̱ a atagada o ukutsuluwu, adama wo o'wo le urotsu hali hali a mantsa ma na ma̱a̱ ta̱wa̱. <verse eid="ISA 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 30:9" />Ele nda ele ɗa ama a aciyogbamu, muwun me epen, muwun n na n tsu ciga mu uwwa adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva shi. <verse eid="ISA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 30:10" />A damma ta̱ a̱za̱ a̱ yindi, &lt;&lt;She i da̱shi ene alavu alavu!&gt;&gt; Adansa ama̱sula̱, &lt;&lt;She i da̱shi damma tsu alavu alavu e ili ya amayun wan! I damma tsu ili yu uyo'o, damma ntsu epen. <verse eid="ISA 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 30:11" />Buwaa ntsu ure, i takatsuwa tsu lo ure na adanshi a Za va Akiza va Isra'ila o ndolo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 30:12" />Adama o ndolo mpa ili i na Za va Akiza a Isra'ila a dammai, &lt;&lt;Adama a na i 'yuwan ta̱ ikaka i nda, reve i zuwa ucira uba̱ta̱ e iɓongi na̱ a̱lumu, <verse eid="ISA 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 30:13" />adama o ndolo unusu u nda u to o'wo ɗu tsu uɓatsu wu uɓaɓu wu uga'an, uɓaɓu u na u ri mishin babu ucira. A̱risa̱ a̱ yi o to o'wo babu urevu. <verse eid="ISA 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 30:14" />U to ɓuɓoso miri miri tsu upondo u ci'in, za na mumurai suru suru hali a na a̱a̱ tsura̱ ayimba a na aa gura kene akinkina e elele shi ko o ko'o mini na̱ a̱yi diga o ura'atsu shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 30:15" />Mpa nda ili i na A̱sulazuva Zagbain Za va Akiza a Isra'ila a dammai, &lt;&lt;Ni i ka̱mba̱ a̱vu i vadala i ta̱ tsura̱ iwawi, a̱tsuma̱ o uvotowun wu ugbozu nu ucawu wo okolo ya̱'a̱ va̱ i ta̱ tsura̱ ucira. Agba reve i 'yuwan. <verse eid="ISA 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 30:16" />Reve i damma, &lt;O'o, tsu ta suma zuva vi ido.&gt; Adama o ndolo i ta suma! Reve i damma waru, &lt;Tsu ta kumba ido i na i ri ni ilaɗi lon.&gt; Adama o ndolo aza a na aa saɓa ɗu a ta la'a ɗu ilaɗi. <verse eid="ISA 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 30:17" />A̱soja a̱ ɗu ukpakukupa kupa a ta suma ne e ene vuma ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a aza a na aa yuwusan nla̱ngi na̱ a̱ɗu. Na̱ ye yene ama o ton a̱tsuma̱ a aza a na aa yuwusan nla̱ngi na̱ a̱ɗu suru nɗu i ta suma. Babu ili i na yaa buwa a̱tsuma̱ o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a̱ ɗu she aaɗanga a atuta a̱ ɗu goon zuva masasan, tsa atuta a aagaɗi. <verse eid="ISA 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 30:18" />Suru na̱ ne A̱sulazuva a ta pura u yuwaan ɗu isa'ani, u tu ufoɓu na woo roco ɗu isa'ani. Adama a na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱ a ɗa, za va aba'un a ɗa suru za na puro niyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 30:19" />Amayun ama a̱ Sihiyona, aza a na ri a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima, ya̱a̱ da̱shi shon shi. Na amayun u ta yuwaan ɗu isa'ani a mantsa ma na i 'ya̱wa̱i na̱ mesun ma̱ ɗu uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi. A̱yi a uwwa ɗu u ta̱ usushi nɗu. <verse eid="ISA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 30:20" />Ko na wo o'woi Zagbain ca ɗu ta̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ tsa tsuwa na̱ mɓa̱la̱ tsa̱ mini mo oso, suru na̱ ne manlu ma̱ ɗu ma̱a̱ da̱shi da̱nu upa'awun shi, ne esu a̱ ɗu a ɗa yee ene yi. <verse eid="ISA 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 30:21" />Waru atsuvu a̱ ɗu a ta uwwa adanshi a̱ca̱pa̱ a̱ɗu, adansa, &lt;&lt;Nda ɗa ure'e, kuru niyi,&gt;&gt; mantsa ma na i vadaluwai usa'ani ko ugula̱. <verse eid="ISA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 30:22" />I ta̱ lungusa̱ a̱ma̱li a̱ ɗu aza a na a surai na̱ azurufa, na̱ ma'an ɗu na a palai na̱ zinariya. I ta vari le tsa akashi a̱ a̱shinda̱ a ka. Reve i damma le, &lt;&lt;Walai!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 30:23" />Waru u ta̱ lyunguwa̱ ɗu ni iro'i adama e icu'un i na i cu'wa̱in e iɗa, waru ilyalya i na ya̱a̱ tsura̱ e iɗa'a u ta̱ da̱na̱ ulobonu na̱ a̱bunda̱. O urana u ndolo iliyamunga i ɗu waru a̱ ta̱ tsura̱ uba̱ta̱ wa alyuna pere. <verse eid="ISA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 30:24" />Inan na̱ nloli n na maa yuwusan ulinga o uɗuma̱ a ta lyuwa ilyalya i na i la'ai ulobonu i na a lapulaa nle na̱ sheburu na̱ sheburu va akatsu. <verse eid="ISA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 30:25" />Waru a masasan mo uga'an suru na aagaɗi o uga'an suru muɗolu n te yene na̱ mini, o urana u na aa yuwan mona a̱bunda̱ a mantsa ma na atsura a̱a̱ riya̱. <verse eid="ISA 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 30:26" />Waru, ekan o woto e te ikana tse ekan o urana. Ekan o urana waru u ta̱ da̱shi toto ucindere tse ekan tsa̱ rana cindere, a mantsa ma na A̱sulazuva a̱ nla̱sa̱ ama a̱ yi a na a kukuɗai reve waru u ka̱mba̱to le gbaga a antsu a na u ta̱wa̱a̱ nle.<verse eid="ISA 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 30:27" />Uwwai nda, alanga a ɗa ala a̱ A̱sulazuva oo utusa̱, a̱ ma̱kula̱ nu upan, na̱ mikyon n na ma̱a̱ 'yosun da̱n. Adanshi o una̱ wa̱ yi a̱ ta̱ tapu nu upan, elentsu a̱ yi waru tsa akina o ukula̱tosu a ɗa. <verse eid="ISA 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 30:28" />Wivuwun wa̱ yi waru tsa̱ mini ma̱ a̱bunda̱ mo uɗolu ma ɗa za na shiwain hali a rawa a̱ yinlu. U ta̱ sa̱ka̱ɗa̱ nɗa na̱ a̱a̱susu o ukototsu. U ta zuwa alinzamu a̱ na̱ le adama u zuwa le a ɓatsa ure. <verse eid="ISA 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 30:29" />Waru i ta yuwan ishipa tsa ayin a̱ a̱buki a akiza a na a zuwai. Waru okolo a̱ ɗu a ta yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ cine ama a tsu lapa a gawan ni igbala a̱ wivulu a̱ tyo a masasan ma̱ A̱sulazuva, aatali a Isra'ila. <verse eid="ISA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 30:30" />A̱sulazuva a ta zuwa a uwwa uɗyo wa̱ yi u tsugbain. Waru u ta zuwa e ene ucipu wu ukere wa̱ yi za vu upan ne elentsu a akina za vu ukula̱tosu na̱ mini me eleshe, nu wunla̱ na atayan. <verse eid="ISA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 30:31" />Uɗyo wa̱ A̱sulazuva a ta da'waton aza a Asiriya. Na aaɗanga a tsugbain tsa̱ yi tsa ɗa waa faba le hali she e iɗa. <verse eid="ISA 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 30:32" />A mantsa ma na suru A̱sulazuva aa fabusa le na aaɗanga o ucasu wa̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a̱ yi a̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ a tsuwe'e tsa aganga ni igaraya, a̱yi a̱ 'ya̱susa̱n ukere wa̱ yi a yuwusan nla̱ngi ne ele a̱tsuma̱ o uvon. <verse eid="ISA 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 30:33" />Adama a na o foɓo ta̱ uba̱ta̱ o ukula̱tosu nu ujumu, amayun o foɓo yi ta̱ adama o mogono'o. A yuwan ta̱ a̱ka̱ri a washin na̱ a̱ru'un, o shiton yi ta̱ na akina na̱ ɗanga va̱ a̱bunda̱. Wivuwun wa̱ A̱sulazuva a ɗa waa kaɓato akina'a, tsu uɗolu u farinwuta.<verse eid="ISA 30:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="ISA 31" />
  <para style="s">A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a aci a aza a na aa zuwusaa Masar ucira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 31:1" />A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a ta cina aza a na a̱ cipa̱sa̱ a̱ tyo Masar izami yi ikambi, aza a na aa zuwusaa ido ucira, aza a na a zuwayi oɓolo e ikeke yi do i le ucira adama a na a̱ ri a̱bunda̱ na̱ wa akumbi e ido adama a na a̱ ri nu ucira lon. Agba a̱ bunga̱ Za va Akiza a Isra'ila shi, ko a zami ikambi uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva shi. <verse eid="ISA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 31:2" />Agba suru na̱ ne, A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ nu ugbozu, waru u tsu ta̱wa̱a̱ ta̱ na̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱, u tsu vadala adanshi a̱ yi shi. U ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱n nla̱ngi nu u'wa wu za vi iwuya, na aza a na aa kambusa le. <verse eid="ISA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 31:3" />Adama a na aza a Masar ama a ɗa, A̱sula̱ a ɗa shi, ido i le lipu ɗa ruhu ɗa shi. A mantsa ma na A̱sulazuva a̱ ba̱ruwa̱i ukere wa̱ yi, za vi ikambi ta̱ ta̱ɗa̱tsa̱, za na a kambai waru u ta̱ riya̱, suru nle a̱ ta̱ kuwa̱ oɓolo. <verse eid="ISA 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 31:4" />Apa nda ili i na A̱sulazuva a damma numu, &lt;&lt;Cine kamu ko mawun ma kamu ma̱ tsu gugwa̱ e ekere e ili i na u tsu reme, agba ko na̱ a̱ shi e ɗe oɓolo a aza a aguɓa adama a̱ yi, yorori i le i tsu ca yi wovon shi, ko u dama ne elemu e le shi. Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a̱a̱ cipa̱ u yuwan uvon a Masasan ma̱ Sihiyona a aagaɗi a̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 31:5" />Cine nnunu n tsu piri a tsu'yan, ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva ee geshe Urishelima. U te geshe yi a̱vu u wawa yi, u ta pasa yi a̱vu u papa yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 31:6" />Ka̱mba̱i uba̱ta̱ wu za na i 'yasa̱yin aci, a̱ɗu aza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="ISA 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 31:7" />Adama a na o urana u ndolo koyan a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu u ta 'yuwan a̱ma̱li a azurufa na̱ zinariya na ekere o unusu a̱ ɗu a yuwaan nɗu.<verse eid="ISA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 31:8" />&lt;&lt;Aza a Asuriya a̱ ta̱ riya̱ na̱ matsun me pe'eni ma na za vuma ɗa shi, matsun me pe'eni ma vuma shi, u ta lyuwa le. A ta suma matsun me pe'eni'i, a̱vu gba a zuwa olobo e le ulinga nu ucira. <verse eid="ISA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 31:9" />Za vu ucira va̱ yi ta̱ puwa̱n a̱tsuma̱ o wovon, reve nan yali a̱ yi a vari tsugbain a̱tsuma̱ o wovon,&gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai, za na akina a̱ yi a̱ ri a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Sihiyona, za na akina a̱ ma̱kula̱ a̱ yi a̱ ri a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima.<verse eid="ISA 31:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="ISA 32" />
  <para style="s">Tsugono tsa̱ a̱ɓula̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 32:1" />Uwwai nda, mogono ma ta yuwan tsugono na̱ a̱ɓula̱, aza a tsugbain waru a ta yuwan tsugbain mejege. <verse eid="ISA 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 32:2" />Koyan a̱tsuma̱ e le u to o'wo tsu upa'atan wu upepu no oogodo adama a̱ wunla̱, tsu ɗolu mini a̱ a̱tsumona tsu ululu wa aatali a gbain e iɗa yu u'yewu. <verse eid="ISA 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 32:3" />Reve esu a aza a na ee inda, a̱a̱ ɓa̱ru shi, waru atsuvu a aza a na aa uwwusa o to polo atsuvu. <verse eid="ISA 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 32:4" />Okolo a za na tsu yuwusan ili iwau u ta̱ da̱na̱ nu urevu, waru eelentsu a za na tsu gura yuwan adanshi mejege shi u ta yuwan adanshi mejege. <verse eid="ISA 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 32:5" />A̱a̱ da̱shi ɗe ulo vuma va̱ a̱ɓula̱ shi, ko e ɗe za vu ule'e vuma gbain shi. <verse eid="ISA 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 32:6" />Adama a na ulo u ta yuwan adanshi o tsulo, okolo a̱ yi tapu ni ifoɓi i iwuya. U ta̱ da̱na̱ a yuwusan ili nu ulambu u wovon wa̱ A̱sula̱. A̱vu u baza epen a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva, u lyawa aza a ambulu a̱tsuma̱ a ambulu, reve waru u putsa za va akuli ni ili yo oso. <verse eid="ISA 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 32:7" />Za vu ule'e re va̱ yi iwuya i ɗa. U tsu foɓo ta̱ ifoɓi i wuya adama u kototo za vu ulambu ne epen, ko na̱ shi mesun ma za vu ulambu amayun a ɗa. <verse eid="ISA 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 32:8" />Amma vuma va̱ a̱ɓula̱ u tsu yuwan ta̱ ifoɓi ya̱ a̱ɓula̱, waru e ifoɓi ya̱ a̱ɓula̱ i ɗa wee isawan.<verse eid="ISA 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱ma̱ci a̱ Urishelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 32:9" />A̱ɗu a̱ma̱ci a na a̱ ri a̱ nden m mawwa mo uyo'o, 'yoyin yu uwwa mu, a̱ɗu esheli a na i ri nden fa̱a̱n poloi atsuvu e ili i na maa damma! <verse eid="ISA 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 32:10" />Upasu na aa'wan a̱ ta̱ wa'a a̱ɗu na i ri fa̱a̱n i te je'en lipu, adama a na a̱a̱ tsura̱ a ta'an muwun n ina̱bi shi, waru a ta'an muwun mu ɗanga shi. <verse eid="ISA 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 32:11" />Je'ein lipu a̱ɗu a̱ma̱ci a na i ri a̱ nden m mawwa mo uyo'o, je'ein lipu a̱ɗu esheli a na i ri a̱ nden n fa̱a̱n! Foɗoi itana i ɗu reve yi nla̱ akashamuna a̱ nkyun n ɗu. <verse eid="ISA 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 32:12" />I lapa nka̱ka̱n n ɗu adama a̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a sa'ani a̱ ɗu na adama a ataci a̱ ina̱bi a̱ ɗu, <verse eid="ISA 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 32:13" />na adama e iɗa ya ama a̱ va̱, iɗa i na i shiwain na awanda na̱ ma̱lyo, amayun i yuwan a̱tsumola̱ngu adama a 'wa mawwa mo uyo'o na ri a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci na ri tapu na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱. <verse eid="ISA 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 32:14" />A ta lyawa u'wa u mogono, a ta vari lyuci gbain na ri na̱ a̱bunda̱ a ama babu za, aagaɗi na aburu o to o'wo ofoli suru suru, uba̱ta̱ wu uro u mololi mo una nu uba̱ta̱ wa alyuna e oɓolo e ikyon, <verse eid="ISA 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 32:15" />hali she na̱ a̱ tsuwa̱a̱n tsu Ruhu diga zuva, a̱vu iɗa yu u'yewu yo o'wo iɗa yu umili, a̱vu iɗa yu umili wo o'wo tsa̱ a̱rumbu. <verse eid="ISA 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 32:16" />Reve a̱ da̱na̱ a yuwusan mejege a̱tsumona, a̱ɓula̱ waru a̱ da̱na̱ a̱bunda̱ e iɗa yu umili. <verse eid="ISA 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 32:17" />Ili i na mayan ma̱ a̱ɓula̱ ma̱a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ a̱yi ɗa nden ma asuvu, ili i na mayan ma̱ a̱ɓula̱ ma̱a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ a̱yi ɗa nden kuci nu ulambu u makuɗa mo okolo babu utyo. <verse eid="ISA 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 32:18" />Ama a̱ va̱ a̱ ta̱ da̱nu uba̱ta̱ wu nden ma asuvu nden, uba̱ta̱ wu nden u na u ri na addama shi uba̱ta̱ u mawwa mo uyo'o. <verse eid="ISA 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 32:19" />Ko na wo o'woi atayan o polo ta̱ ɗanga va̱ a̱a̱rumbu waru lyuci'i u ta̱ rukutsa̱ suru suru, <verse eid="ISA 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 32:20" />aza a aba'un a ɗa yoo o'wo. I ta̱ cu'wa̱n a̱ nge'en mu ɗolu suru, a̱vu waru i lyawa inan na̱ nloli n ɗu a alyuna fa̱a̱n.<verse eid="ISA 32:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="ISA 33" />
  <para style="s">A̱tsuma̱lima̱ ni ikambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 33:1" />A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a ta cina wu, a̱vu za vu ukototosu, agba o kototo wu shi! A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a ta cina wu a̱vu za yipalishi a̱vu gba koto a pala wu shi! A mantsa ma na vu lyawai ukototosu, o to kototo wu, na̱ vu lyawa yipalishi, a ta pala wu. <verse eid="ISA 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 33:2" />A̱sulazuva, roco tsu isa'ani, tsu ta zuwusa okolo ya̱'a̱ wu. Vo o'wo ucira u tsu usana suru, iwawi i tsu a mantsa ma addama. <verse eid="ISA 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 33:3" />Na̱ mawwa mo uɗyo u gbain wa̱ wu, ama a suma ta̱, ana vu rocoi tsugbain tsa̱ wu nɗa m bete'we ta̱. <verse eid="ISA 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 33:4" />Reve o ɓoloto ili i na vu lungusa̱i cine muwun ma apapari n tsu ɓoloto. Cine apapari a̱ tsu riya̱a̱ ili, ne ɗa ama a̱ riya̱a̱ niyi. <verse eid="ISA 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 33:5" />A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ na̱ tsugbain, adama a na u ta̱ nden zuva, u to shiton Sihiyona na amayun na̱ a̱ɓula̱. <verse eid="ISA 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 33:6" />A̱yi ɗa ikyun i mantsa ma̱ ɗu, iwawi ya amayun nu ugbozu nu urevu, wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva a̱yi ɗa utsuru wa̱ Sihiyona. <verse eid="ISA 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 33:7" />Uwwai nda, a̱soja o okolo ugbamu e le e mesun e re, nlingata ma̱ nden ma asuvu a sali lon. <verse eid="ISA 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 33:8" />Re gbain suru ko za lo shi, babu aza a mmalu e re. A kuɗa ta̱ nzuwulai a tara adanshi a aza a na aa yuwusan adanshi o una̱ wa̱ yi ili i ro shi. Ko za a ca tsugbain shi. <verse eid="ISA 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 33:9" />Iɗa'a i yuwan ta̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu a̱vu u 'yewe, Lebanon uwwa ta̱ wono a̱vu u kpanla, Sharon o'wo ta̱ a̱tsumona, reve Bashan na̱ Kame o oco a̱vu'un e le. <verse eid="ISA 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 33:10" />&lt;&lt;Gogo n ta̱ 'yon,&gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai. &lt;&lt;Gogo a ta ca mu tsugbain, gogo a̱ ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱n mu zuva. <verse eid="ISA 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 33:11" />I yuwan ta̱ a̱a̱tsuma̱ o owopo, a̱vu i matsan tsu'yuwa̱, wivuwun u ɗu akina a ɗa a na oo soɗu ɗu. <verse eid="ISA 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 33:12" />A̱ ta̱ zun ama a̱ ɗu suru suru, tsa awanda a na o koɗoi ne ɗa a̱a̱ kula̱to le na akina.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 33:13" />A̱ɗu aza a na i ri alanga uwwai ili i na n yuwain, a̱ɗu aza a na i ri zuzu, i reve nu ucira u va̱! <verse eid="ISA 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 33:14" />A̱za̱ o unusu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Sihiyona a uwwa ta̱ wovon, meje'en ma̱ lipu me reme ta̱ aza a na e revei A̱sula̱ shi: &lt;&lt;Zane a̱tsuma̱ a̱ tsu aa gura da̱nu na akina o ukototosu? Zane a̱tsuma̱ a̱ tsu aa gura da̱nu na̱ ma̱kula̱ ma na moo koto shi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 33:15" />She za na ri a mmalu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱ waru waa dansa ili i na i ri mejege. Za na aa 'yuwusan ili i na yaa uwa yi i na i ka̱ra̱la̱i, za na tsu 'yasan ekere a̱ yi nu ushishi wu utowusu wu una̱, za na tsu putsa atsuvu a̱ yi na̱ mawwa ma adanshi ma na oo una vuma, waru u tsu ɓa̱ru ese a̱ yi adama ee ene ili i wuya wan. <verse eid="ISA 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 33:16" />A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa cu'un vuma na a̱a̱ da̱nu gbaga, za na upa'atan wa̱ yi atali o ucira a ɗa. A̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ a casu yi ilyalya ya̱ yi, mini ma̱ yi waru ma̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ lo kuci. <verse eid="ISA 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 33:17" />Esu a̱ wu e te ene mogono a̱tsuma̱ a tsugbain tsa̱ yi, e te ene iɗa i washin alanga. <verse eid="ISA 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 33:18" />Okolo a̱ wu a̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ a cuwusan ni ili i wovon ya̱ a̱ca̱pa̱: &lt;&lt;Te ɗa za mekece? Te ɗa za na tsu ushishi utafa? Te ɗa za na tsu keceshe atsura?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 33:19" />Vu buwa ee ene ama a aciyogbamu o ndolo shi, aza a na a tsu yuwan adanshi ne elentsu a na vee reve shi, aza a na tsu yuwan adanshi tsi iberenu a na vaa gura reve shi. <verse eid="ISA 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 33:20" />Uwwai nda, Sihiyona, lyuci gbain tsu na tsaa yuwusan a̱buki a na a zuwai. Esu a̱ wu e te ene Urishelima, uba̱ta̱ a̱ nden gbaga, oogodo a na a̱a̱ mula̱ shi, za na a̱a̱ mula̱ irumu i na a̱ shuwa̱a̱ niyi shi, waru aa taɓa ko amunga a̱ ta̱ a̱ yi shi. <verse eid="ISA 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 33:21" />Ɗe ɗa A̱sulazuva oo o'wo Za vu Ucira u tsu. U to o'wo tsa mala na̱ ɗolu washin, uba̱ta̱ u na n'yuwatan maa gura kuru shi, uba̱ta̱ u na ko wantsun wu n'yuwatan maa gura wala shi. <verse eid="ISA 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 33:22" />Adama a na A̱sulazuva a ɗa za vu uge'etosu u tsu, A̱sulazuva a ɗa za na aa casu tsu wila̱, A̱sulazuva a̱yi ɗa mogono ma̱ tsu, a̱yi ɗa waa wawa tsu. <verse eid="ISA 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 33:23" />Amunga a̱ wu a̱ ba̱ɗa̱ ta̱, aa gura guza̱ aɗanga a̱ wu shi, aa gura buba̱ruwa̱ umuna'a shi, wantsun waa gura wala shi. E te ne'eshen itana i na a̱ pura̱i uba̱ta̱ wu uvon, hali na̱ a̱kutsuma̱ fo a̱ ta̱ pura̱ itana. <verse eid="ISA 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 33:24" />Babu ko vuma na ri nden Sihiyona na waa damma, &lt;&lt;N tu ubanakun&gt;&gt;, a ta yuwaan aza a na a̱ ri nden ɗe gafura vu unusu u le.<verse eid="ISA 33:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="ISA 34" />
  <para style="s">Uge'etosu wu nɗa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 34:1" />Ta̱wa̱i zuzu a̱ɗu nɗa, yu uwwa, i polo atsuvu, a̱ɗu ama! Lyawa iɗa yu uwwa, ni ili i na i ri pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi biti, uvaɗi ni ili i na yoo utusa̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi biti! <verse eid="ISA 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 34:2" />Adama a na A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ o upan na̱ nɗa suru, u ta yuwusan upan lon na̱ a̱soja e le suru. U to kototo le suru suru, u ca le ta̱ adama a mapaɗa. <verse eid="ISA 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 34:3" />A ta vari aza a na a paɗai, ushamu wa̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱ e le u ta̱ 'yon. Nsasan n te yene na̱ mpasa n le. <verse eid="ISA 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 34:4" />Oɓolo e italyo'o ya zuva suru e te jeruwe, a̱vu eleshe suru a̱ kutsulu tsa aatagada. Italyo'o suru i ta̱ riya̱ tsa akpanli a̱ a̱vu'un a ataci, tsa̱ muwun mu ubiri n na n 'yewei o uɗanga wu ubiri. <verse eid="ISA 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 34:5" />Matsun me pe'eni ma̱ va̱ mo sowo ta̱ u cuwa̱n diga zuva, a̱yi ɗa nda a̱ cipa̱ adama o uge'etosu a aci a Edom, ama a na n tawai adama o ukototosu. <verse eid="ISA 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 34:6" />Matsun me pe'eni ma̱ A̱sulazuva ma̱ cuwa̱n ta̱ na̱ mpasa, u shiwan ta̱ na̱ mani'in, mpasa mi ikyon na̱ za vu mgbele, mani'in ma a'ilu ma̱ a̱giri'i. Adama a na A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ na̱ kucci na waa yuwan a Bozura, na mona ma gbain e iɗa ya Edom. <verse eid="ISA 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 34:7" />Ogono e inan yu una a̱ ta̱ riya̱ oɓolo ne ele, muba̱jini na̱ a̱ba̱jini a gbagbain. Iɗa i le i ta̱ re'we na̱ mpasa, a̱vu ma̱bula̱ me le mo o'wo ure'u na̱ mani'in. <verse eid="ISA 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 34:8" />Adama a na A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ nu urana u na waa tsupa, aa'wan a na waa lapula ili adama a̱ Sihiyona. <verse eid="ISA 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 34:9" />Ɗolu va Edom to o'wo erepu a kwalta, ma̱bula̱ ma̱ yi waru mo o'wo akina a̱ fa̱rin wuta. Iɗa ya̱ yi i to o'wo erepu a kwalta a madala! <verse eid="ISA 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 34:10" />Ayin nu urana wa̱a̱ kima̱ shi. Mikyon ma̱ yi n ta̱ da̱na̱ a gawusan babu ukotu. Diga mantsa a̱ tyo mantsa u to o'wo okongo, ko vuma buwa a̱ da̱shi utula̱i na̱ pe shi ko ke'en. <verse eid="ISA 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 34:11" />A̱pa̱mo ni ivori i ɗa yoo o'wo ni iɗa'a, a̱pa̱mo na akakan a ta yuwan ɗe nkinda. A̱sulazuva o to rito iɗa i ndolo ulobonu. U to rito yi adama u ka̱mba̱ iwa̱u nu ukotosu. <verse eid="ISA 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 34:12" />Azagbain a̱ yi, a buwa ni ili i na ee ɗe tsugono ɗe shi. Azagbain a̱ yi suru o to koto. <verse eid="ISA 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 34:13" />Awanda a ta kungwa a saa vu ucira va̱ yi, ma̱lyo ma ta shiwan e ilyuci i na i ri na̱ ɓaɓu. U to o'wo uba̱ta̱ wu nden m musa̱n mu una na azamina. <verse eid="ISA 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 34:14" />Inama yu una i ta ga'an na̱ nkunzu, mgbele mu una n saala a̱za̱ e le, waru ili i wuma ya ayin i ta̱ da̱nu pe, a̱vu a̱ tsura̱a̱ aciyele wivuwatan. <verse eid="ISA 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 34:15" />A̱a̱pa̱mo a ta yuwan ɗe nkinda a̱vu u zuwa okowo, u ta gyu'wan le a̱vu u va̱pa̱ muwun ma̱ yi e evelu a̱ yi, ɗe ɗa waru ajimba oo ɓoloto, koyan na̱ vali va̱ yi.<verse eid="ISA 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 34:16" />Ka̱lyuwa̱ a̱tsuma̱ a aatagada a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱vu vu ɗenuna̱. Ko za ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ e le a̱a̱ puwa̱n shi, ko za ta̱ aa lamba za va̱ yi shi. Adama a na una̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva a ɗa a zuwai ne, waru Ruhu va̱ yi ɗa ɓoloto nle. <verse eid="ISA 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 34:17" />A̱sulazuva a ɗa e ne'eshen nle a̱yi, ukere wa̱ yi u ɗa u ca nle akunda ukunzuwu. O to o'woto yi za le hali hali hali. A̱ ta̱ da̱nu pe diga mantsa a̱ tyo mantsa.<verse eid="ISA 34:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="ISA 35" />
  <para style="s">Ma̱za̱nga̱ ma aza a na a tsupayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 35:1" />A̱tsumona ni iɗa yu u'yewu a ta yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱, a̱tsumona a ta yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ a̱vu u ɓoso tsa̱ yipa̱lu. <verse eid="ISA 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 35:2" />U to ɓoso uba̱ta̱ suru, u ta yuwan mere na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ lon a̱vu u yuwan yisali adama a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱. A ta ca yi tsugbain tsa Lebanon, tsu ulobonu wa Kame na̱ Sharon. E te ene tsugbain tsa̱ A̱sulazuva, ulobonu wa̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu. <verse eid="ISA 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 35:3" />I gbamato ekere a na a̱ ɗa̱mba̱i, i gbamato a̱lu a na a̱ kuna̱i. <verse eid="ISA 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 35:4" />I damma aza a na a̱ ri no okolo o wovon, &lt;&lt;Kaɓai asuvu, she yu uwwa wovon wan, a̱yi ɗa nda, A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱. U ta̱ ta̱wa̱ u yuwan atsupu, atsupu a̱ A̱sula̱, u ta̱ ta̱wa̱ u wawa ɗu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 35:5" />Ɗaɗa esu a̱ nrumba̱ a̱a̱ kpa̱tu'wa̱, atsuvu a agulani waru a̱ ta̱ kpa̱tu'wa̱. <verse eid="ISA 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 35:6" />Reve akutsuma̱ e reme tsu'yan tsu la'a, a̱vu elentsu a za vu iberenu u yuwan ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱. Mini mo to ɓoso o uta̱ a̱tsumona, ɗolu o ogozo. <verse eid="ISA 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 35:7" />Wuyun u na u ri a̱ ma̱kula̱ u to o'wo mala, iɗa yu u'yewu yo o'wo lyusu mini. Uba̱ta̱ u na musa̱n mu una n shi na̱ nden anlya na apumpu a̱ to uta̱. <verse eid="ISA 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 35:8" />Waru ure u gbain u ta̱ da̱na̱ lo, za na ee ɗe Ure wa Akiza. Babu za vi idaba na aa wala o ure u ndolo, agba u to o'wo za va aza a na a wala o Ure'e, hali no olo fo aa wala o ure'e shi. <verse eid="ISA 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 35:9" />Ko kamu a̱a̱ da̱na̱ pe shi, ko inama yu una ivama vaa wala pe shi, a̱a̱ tsura̱ le pe shi. Agba she aza a na a tsupayi goon ɗa aa wala pe. <verse eid="ISA 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 35:10" />Waru aza a na A̱sulazuva a tsulai a̱ ta̱ ka̱mba̱. A ta uwa Sihiyona ni ishipa, ma̱za̱nga̱ ma babu ukotu mo to o'wo okokolo a aci e le. O to o'wo na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ nu uyo'o wa asuvu, a̱vu a̱tsuma̱lima̱ na̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu a̱ puwa̱n.<verse eid="ISA 35:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="ISA 36" />
  <para style="s">Senakerib da'waton ta̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Urishelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 36:1" />A̱tsuma̱ a aa'wan a kupa na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi o tsugono tso mogono Hezekiya, Senakerib mogono ma Asuriya ma̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ adama u yuwan uvon ni ilyuci i gbagbain ya Yahuda reve u reme le. <verse eid="ISA 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 36:2" />A̱vu mogono ma Asuriya ma̱ lyungu yali ya̱ a̱soja a̱ yi no oɓolo a̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱ a̱soja diga Lakish a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u mogono Hezekiya ɗe Urishelima. Reve yali'i wi isawan o uka̱ri u Mala mo Gon, o ure a̱ tyo Uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱za̱ a̱ Wuza̱'u. <verse eid="ISA 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 36:3" />Reve Eliyakim ulobo wa Hilikiya, za na da̱na̱i zagbain vu ukobu u mogono, na̱ Shebena za vi iɗana, oɓolo na̱ Jowa ulobo wa Asa za na tsu ɗanasa ili i na i farai o uta̱ a cina yi.<verse eid="ISA 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 36:4" />Reve yali ya̱ a̱soja'a u damma le, Damma Hezekiya, &lt;&lt; &lt;Apa ili i na mogono ma gbain, mogono ma Asiriya, ma dammai: E ili i ne i ɗa vaa zuwusa ucira wa̱ wu u nda'a? <verse eid="ISA 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 36:5" />A̱vu vu ta yuwusan majiyan adanshi o una̱ a ɗa ifoɓi nu ucira wu uvon? Zane ɗa vaa zuwusaa ucira gogo a na va̱a̱ 'ya̱susa̱a̱n mu aci? <verse eid="ISA 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 36:6" />Uwwai nda, vu ta zuwusa ucira wa̱ wu e ekere a Masar, za na ri tsa aaɗanga a na a̱ ri ukuɗu, za na tsu paɗa ukere u vuma reve wu uwwato yi usa̱n nu ugbasato ya̱'a̱ yi! Ne ɗa Firi'awuna mogono ma Masar ma̱ ri e ekere a aza a na a zuwaa niyi ucira. <verse eid="ISA 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 36:7" />Agba na̱ vu damma mu, &lt;&lt;Tsu zuwa ta̱ ucira u tsu e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu,&gt;&gt; a̱yi ɗaɗa za na agaɗi a̱ yi na̱ musa'a Hezekiya mumurai shi, a dansaa Yahuda na̱ Urishelima, &lt;&lt;I ta yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma masa'a ma nda?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 36:8" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Ta̱wa̱ gogo, vu yuwan uciniki na̱ zagbain a̱ va̱, mogono ma Asiriya. N ta ca wu ido ukpakukupa ure (2,000), na̱ vaa gura zuwa akumbi zuva le! <verse eid="ISA 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 36:9" />Cine vaa gura lyuwa aci a yali a̱tsuma̱ a aza a na a la'ai uka̱la̱mu a̱tsuma̱ a agbashi a zagbain va̱, ko na vaa zuwusaa Masar ucira adama e ido ya̱ yi oɓolo na akumbi e le? <verse eid="ISA 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 36:10" />Babu na̱ a̱yi, n ta̱wa̱ ta̱ n riya̱a̱ iɗa i nda a̱vu n kototo yi agba A̱sulazuva a damma shi? A̱sulazuva na aciya̱yi a ɗa u damma numu n wala a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ n riya̱a̱ iɗa'a nu uvon reve n kototo yi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 36:11" />A̱vu Eliyakim na̱ Shebena oɓolo na̱ Jowa a damma yali yu uvo'on, &lt;&lt;Yuwan ankuri vu yuwaan aagbashi a̱ wu adanshi ne elentsu a Tsu'arama, adama a na tsu uwwa yi ta̱. She vu yuwaan tsu elentsu a aza a Yahuda a atsuvu a ama a na a̱ ri lo o uɓaɓu wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 36:12" />Amma zagbai'in u usu ta̱, &lt;&lt;Zagbain va̱ lyungu mu ta̱ n yuwan adanshi e idanshi i nda uba̱ta̱ wu zagbain ɗu oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu goon, agba na ama a na a̱ ri nden o uɓaɓu'u, aza a na a̱ ri tsa̱ a̱ɗu aza a na aa lyuwa a̱ya̱n e le a̱vu o sowo mazara me le shi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 36:13" />A̱vu zagbai'in u 'yon mishin a̱vu u yuwan adanshi ne elentsu a aza a Yahuda: &lt;&lt;Uwwai adanshi o mogono ma gbain, mogono ma Asiriya! <verse eid="ISA 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 36:14" />Apa ili i na mogono'o ma dammai, &lt;She i lyawa Hezekiya luluma̱ ɗu wan, adama a na a̱yi waa gura wawa ɗu shi! <verse eid="ISA 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 36:15" />She i lyawa Hezekiya zuwa ɗu i zuwa okolo e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva a na, A̱sulazuva a ta wawa tsu na amayun, lyuci gbain nda aa ca yi e ekere o mogono ma Asuriya shi.&gt;<verse eid="ISA 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 36:16" />&lt;&lt;She i zuwaa Hezekiya atsuvu wan. Apa ili i na mogono ma Asuriya ma dammai, &lt;I yuwan nden n lafiya na̱ a̱mu a̱vu i ta̱wa̱ ya̱'a̱ va̱. A̱vu vuma suru a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu u lyuwa umatsun wa ataci a̱ yi nu uɗanga wu ubiri a̱vu u sowo mini mo ooko'o a̱ yi, <verse eid="ISA 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 36:17" />she na̱ n ta̱wa̱ n tara ɗu a̱ tyo e iɗa tsu za ɗu, iɗa yi ishina oɓolo na̱ masayan ma sa'avu, iɗa i na i ri no opopofu na̱ a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ ina̱bi.&gt;<verse eid="ISA 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 36:18" />&lt;&lt;She i lyawa Hezekiya luluma̱ ɗu wan nu u damma, &lt;A̱sulazuva a ta wawa tsu.&gt; Ma̱sula̱ me iɗa mo ro ma wawa ta̱ ɗe iɗa ya̱ yi e ekere o mogono ma Asiriya? <verse eid="ISA 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 36:19" />Te ɗa musula̱ ma Haman na̱ Afa? Te ɗa musula̱ ma Sefarwayim? Musula̱ ma Samariya a gura ta̱ wawa le e ekere a̱ va̱? <verse eid="ISA 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 36:20" />A̱tsuma̱ a̱ musula̱ mi nɗa nda suru zane ɗa gura wawa nle e ekere a̱ va̱, to cine tsa ɗa A̱sulazuva aa wawa Urishelima o ukere u va̱?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 36:21" />Agba ele a̱ rungwa̱ ta̱ waru a̱ usu yi ili shi, adama a na mogono ma̱ shi ta̱ ma zuwa, &lt;&lt;She i usu yi wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 36:22" />A̱vu Eliyakim ulobo wa Hilikiya zagbain vu ukobu u mogono, Shebena za vi iɗana, na̱ Jowa ulobo wa Asa, za na tsu ɗanasa ili i na i farai, a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa Hezekiya, ni itana i le wukaru. Reve a damma yi ili i na yali'i u dammai.<verse eid="ISA 36:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="ISA 37" />
  <para style="s">A yuwan ta̱ adanshi a mawawa ma̱ Urishelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 37:1" />Ana Mogono Hezekiya uwwai, wu kara ta̱ itana ya̱ yi reve wo oto aakashi a̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu reve u ka̱ra̱ a̱ tyo o u'wa wa̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="ISA 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 37:2" />A̱vu u lyungu Eliyakim, za na da̱na̱i zagbain vu ukobu u mogono, na̱ Shebena za vi iɗana, na̱ ganu gbain, a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u vumava̱sula̱ Ishaya ulobo wa Amoz. Suru nle wotowu na aakashi a̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu. <verse eid="ISA 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 37:3" />A damma yi ta̱, &lt;&lt;Apa ili i na Hezekiya dammai, &lt;Urana u nda urana wa̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu a ɗa, nu urana u maɓara oɓolo nu urana wi ili i wono. Cine muwun n tsu rawa limatan, agba babu ucira u na aa gura matsan le. <verse eid="ISA 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 37:4" />U ta yuwan A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ wu a ta uwwa idanshi ya yali, za na zagbain va̱ yi, mogono ma Asiriya, u lyunguyi wi isula A̱sula̱ a wuma. A̱vu waru A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ wu a̱ ɓara yi adama e idanshi i na wu uwwai. Adama o ndolo vu yuwan avasa adama a aza a na a buwai wuma.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 37:5" />Ana azagbain o Mogono Hezekiya a̱ ta̱wa̱i ya Ishaya, <verse eid="ISA 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 37:6" />Ishaya damma le ta̱, &lt;&lt;I damma zagbain ɗu, &lt;Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, She yu uwwa wovon wi ili i na yu uwwai, ili i na olobo o mogono ma Asuriya a yuwaan numu ulamu wan. <verse eid="ISA 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 37:7" />Zuwai atsuvu! N ta zuwa ruhu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi adama na̱ wu uwwa adanshi o ro, u ta̱ ka̱mba̱ e iɗa ya̱ yi. Ɗe ɗa maa zuwa o una yi na̱ matsun me pe'eni.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 37:8" />Ana yali'i wu uwwai a na mogono ma Asuriya ma lyawa ta̱ Lakish, wu uta̱ ta̱ a̱vu u cina mogono a̱ nla̱ngi na̱ Libina.<verse eid="ISA 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 37:9" />Gogo mogono'o ma uwwa ta̱ adama a Tirhaka mogono ma̱ Kush, wu uta̱ ta̱ adama u yuwan uvon na̱ a̱yi. Ana wu uwwai ne, a̱vu u lyungu nlingata a̱ tyo ya Hezekiya, ni idanshi i nda, <verse eid="ISA 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 37:10" />&lt;&lt;Vu damma Hezekiya mogono ma Yahuda: She vu lyawa ma̱sula̱ ma na vaa zuwusaa ucira wu luma̱ wu wan ana u dammai, &lt;Aa ca Urishelima e ekere o mogono ma Asuriya shi.&gt; <verse eid="ISA 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 37:11" />Amayun wu uwwa ta̱ ili i na ngono ma Asuriya n yuwain na̱ nɗa'a suru, u kototo le ta̱ suru suru. A̱vu gba a ta wawa wu? <verse eid="ISA 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 37:12" />Musula̱ mu nɗa n na nkaya n va̱ n kototoi, a wawa le ta̱, musula̱ ma̱ Goza na̱ Haran oɓolo na̱ Reze na ama a Adini aza a na a̱ da̱na̱i a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Telasa? <verse eid="ISA 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 37:13" />Te ɗa ngono ma Haman na̱ mogono ma Afa, mogono ma̱ lyuci va Sefarwayim, ko mogono ma̱ Hena ko Iva?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Avasa a Hezekiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 37:14" />Hezekiya ushi ta̱ mepepelime e ekere a nlingata'a, reve u ɗe yi nu una̱. Ɗaɗa u ka̱ra̱i a̱ tyo o u'wa wa̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu wu ba̱ruwa̱ yi a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="ISA 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 37:15" />A̱vu Hezekiya yuwan avasa a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva: <verse eid="ISA 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 37:16" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva, A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila, za na ri nden zuva kerobobi, a̱vu a̱ nde'en a̱vu ɗa A̱sula̱ a aci o tsugono tsu uvaɗi. A̱vu ɗa vu yuwain zuva ni iɗa. <verse eid="ISA 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 37:17" />Vu zuwaa mu atsuvu, A̱sulazuva, a̱vu vu uwwa mu. Kpa̱tu'wa̱ esu a̱ wu, A̱sulazuva, reve ve ene. A̱vu vu uwwa idanshi ya Senakerib suru, i na u lyunguyi adama u lamaa A̱sula̱ a wuma.<verse eid="ISA 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 37:18" />&lt;&lt;Amayun a ɗa, A̱sulazuva, ngono ma Asuriya o kototo ta̱ ama na̱ nɗa n le, <verse eid="ISA 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 37:19" />a̱vu a vari musula̱ n le a̱tsuma̱ a akina. Adama a na a̱ da̱na̱ musula̱ shi, amma ulinga wu ukere u vuma, ɗanga na atali. Adama o ndolo a̱vu o kototo le. <verse eid="ISA 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 37:20" />Gogo, A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu, wawa tsu e ekere a̱ yi, tsa̱ra̱ tsugono tsu uvaɗi suru ee reve a na a̱vu a̱ nde'en ɗa A̱sulazuva.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uriyu wa Senekerib</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 37:21" />Reve Ishaya mawun ma Amoz ma̱ lyunguwa̱ Hezekiya, a dansa, &lt;&lt;Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila, adama a na vu yuwain avasa a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ va̱ adama a Senakerib mogono ma Asiriya,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 37:22" />apa adanshi a na A̱sulazuva a dammai adama a̱ yi, &lt;&lt;A̱yi Usheli Sihiyona u tara wu ili shi u ta yuwusaan wu ulamu. Usheli Urishelima u ta̱ ga̱ɗishi aaci a̱ yi nu ulamu a̱vu e ilaɗi. <verse eid="ISA 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 37:23" />Zane ɗa vaa yuwusaan ulamu nu ugbawu? Zane ɗa va̱a̱ kpa̱tu'usa̱a̱ una̱ waru zane ɗa waru va̱a̱ 'ya̱susa̱a̱n esu o ugbaruwu? A aci a Za va Akiza a Isra'ila! <verse eid="ISA 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 37:24" />Na agbashi a̱ wu a ɗa vu yuwayin A̱sulazuva ulamu, reve vu damma, &lt;Ni ikeke yi ido ya̱ a̱bunda̱ i va̱ ɗa n kumbai zuva masasan, a̱ tyo a̱ ncilecile ma̱ Lebanon, n koɗo ɗanga na la'ai uga'an va sida, na̱ ɗanga na la'ai ulobonu u sapure. N rawa ta̱ ncilecile mu nsasan ma̱ yi, n uwa ta̱ pe pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱rumbu a na a la'ai umili. <verse eid="ISA 37:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 37:25" />N ka̱pa̱ ta̱ oko'o reve n sowo mini, tsa̱ra̱ n 'yeweto ɗolu va Masar na ana a̱ va̱.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 37:26" />&lt;&lt;Koto vu uwwa shi? Nu ujimu u ɗa n foɓo niyi. Ɗe nu ujumu ɗa n foɓo niyi, gogo n zuwa yi ta̱ u fara, a na vu ka̱mba̱toi iɗa yu ɓaɓu vu ucira oɓolo a atali. <verse eid="ISA 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 37:27" />Ama e le, a lamba ta̱ ucira, e te je'en lipu a̱vu a uwwa wono. Reve o o'wo tsu muvu'un ma aatsusa no ototopi, tsa anlya a na a̱ tsu da̱na̱ zuva vu ukwa̱'a̱<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">37:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">E elentsu aza a Yahuda urana u tsu una ta̱ anlya a na u uta̱i zuva vu ukwa̱'a̱</char></note>, u tsu 'yewe ta̱ kafu u kungwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 37:28" />&lt;&lt;N reve ta̱ nden ma̱ wu na̱ mota̱a̱ ma̱ wu na̱ ma'uwaa ma̱ wu, nu usuɗuwu wa̱ wu a aci a̱ va̱. <verse eid="ISA 37:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 37:29" />Adama a na vu yuwain upan wu usuɗuwu a aci a̱ va̱, waru aciyogbamu a̱ wu a rawa ta̱ a atsuvu a̱ va̱. N ta zuwa gon va̱ a̱ vunu va̱ wu, aamunga o una̱ wa̱ wu, reve n vadala wu a̱ ka̱mba̱ o ure u na vu uta̱i.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 37:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 37:30" />A̱yi nda u to o'wo wu iroci e ekere a̱ wu, &lt;&lt;Lala vu ta lyuwa ili i na yu uta̱i na aciya̱yi, aa'wan e ire ili i na yu uta̱i a aciya̱yi. Amma a aa'wan a ta'atsu vu cu'wa̱n a̱vu vu gasa, vu cu'wa̱n uɗuma̱ u ina̱bi a̱vu vu lyuwa umatsun u le. <verse eid="ISA 37:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 37:31" />A̱vu aza a na a buwai wuma o ugundo wa Yahuda a̱ da̱shi yuwusan aralu e iɗa a matsan muwun zuva. <verse eid="ISA 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 37:32" />Adama a na a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima a̱ ta̱ tsura̱ aza a na a buwai, waru a̱tsuma̱ a Masasan ma̱ Sihiyona oɓolo a aza a na a buwai wuma. Uzuwu wo okolo a̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a ɗa aa yuwan ili i nda.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 37:33" />&lt;&lt;Adama o ndolo apa ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai adama o mogono ma Asiriya, &lt;Waa uwa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci nda shi ko u tewin aya pa shi. Waa rawa uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi na̱ a̱a̱ra̱ga̱ shi ko u suwaa yi uɓaɓu shi. <verse eid="ISA 37:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 37:34" />Nu ure u na u ta̱wa̱yi u ɗa wa̱a̱ ka̱mba̱, waa uwa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci nda shi,&gt; &gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai. <verse eid="ISA 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ISA 37:35" />&lt;&lt;N ta̱ piri lyuci nda a̱vu n wawa yi, adama a aciya̱va̱ na adama a aagbashi a̱ va̱ Da̱wuda!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ISA 37:36" />Reve malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva mo uta̱ a̱vu wu ga̱la̱ a̱soja a Asuriya ukpakukupa nu ukpakukunla̱ nu ukpakuton (185,000) o uva̱la̱ta̱ wa aza a Asiriya. Reve ana ama a̱ 'yoyin na̱ wasasa a̱yi ɗa gba a̱kwa̱kwa̱ a ɗa uba̱ta̱ suru! <verse eid="ISA 37:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ISA 37:37" />A̱vu Senakerib mogono ma Asuriya ma̱ 'yon u ka̱mba̱ o u'wa reve u da̱nu Niniva.<verse eid="ISA 37:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ISA 37:38" />A̱yi a yuwusan a̱ga̱nda̱ o u'wa wa̱ Nisiro ma̱sula̱ ma̱ yi, reve Adaramalek oɓolo na̱ Shareza, olobo a̱ yi o una yi na̱ matsun me pe'eni. Reve a suma a̱ tyo e iɗa ya Arara, ɗaɗa Esahadon ulobo wa̱ yi u yuwain tsugono o una̱ wa̱ yi.<verse eid="ISA 37:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="ISA 38" />
  <para style="s">Ubanakun wa̱ Hezekiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 38:1" />A rana ndolo Hezekiya banakan ta̱ hali u shi u ciga ma̱kuwa̱. A̱vu Ishaya vumava̱sula̱ ulobo wa Amoz u ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi, reve u damma yi, &lt;&lt;Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai: Vu foɓo u'wa wa̱ wu, adama a na vu ta̱ kuwa̱, va̱a̱ ka̱mba̱ gbaga shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 38:2" />Ɗaɗa Hezekiya vadalai urewesu wa̱ yi a̱ tyo o uɓaɓu a̱vu u yuwan avasa a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva, <verse eid="ISA 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 38:3" />a̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;Yuwan ankuri, A̱sulazuva, cuwan cine n yuwain wuma a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ wu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱ no okolo a̱ ta̱, waru n yuwan ta̱ ili i na i ri ulobonu e esu a̱ wu.&gt;&gt; A̱vu Hezekiya shon lon.<verse eid="ISA 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 38:4" />Reve adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱wa̱ ya Ishaya: <verse eid="ISA 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 38:5" />&lt;&lt;Ka̱mba̱ vu damma Hezekiya, &lt;Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva, A̱sula̱ a̱ Da̱wuda dada va̱ wu a dammai: Mu uwwa ta̱ avasa a̱ wu waru me ene ta̱ aɓara a̱ wu. Uwwai nda, n ta̱ da̱shi wu a'wan gendu a wuma wa̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 38:6" />N ta wawa wu oɓolo na̱ lyuci nda e ekere o mogono ma Asiriya. N te geshe lyuci nda.<verse eid="ISA 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 38:7" />&lt;&lt; &lt;A̱yi nda u to o'wo iroci ya̱'a̱ wu diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva, a na u ta yuwan ili i nda i na u yuwain nzuwulai: <verse eid="ISA 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 38:8" />Uwwai nda, n ta zuwa ululu wu urana u ka̱mba̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ ana kupa, e ili i na o tsu rito mmalu mu urana za va Ahaz.&gt; &gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa urana u ka̱mba̱i a̱ca̱pa̱ e ili i na o tsu rito mmalu mu urana ana kupa.<verse eid="ISA 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 38:9" />Iɗana i na Hezekiya mogono ma Yahuda ma yuwain, a na u ka̱mba̱i gbaga diga o ubanakun u na u shi. <verse eid="ISA 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 38:10" />N damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;A̱tsuma̱ a rana vu ucira va̱ n ciga n 'yuwan n kuwa̱, a tara mu ta̱ a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ o una̱ntsu wu ukwa̱ wa akapi wa a'wan a̱ va̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 38:11" />N damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Ma̱a̱ da̱shi ene A̱sulazuva shi, A̱sulazuva e iɗa ya aza a wuma. Ma̱a̱ da̱shi ka̱lyuwa̱ vuma waru a̱tsuma̱ a aza a na a̱ ri o uvaɗi shi. <verse eid="ISA 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 38:12" />Uva̱la̱ta̱ u va̱ u mula̱ ta̱ reve a tawa yi e ekere a̱ va̱ cine oogodo a za va aguɓa ri. Tsu za maɗava n kutsulu ta̱ wuma u va̱, u koɗo mu ta̱ diga a magita mo uɗava. Diga usana a̱ tyo a ayin vu ta̱wa̱to numu o ukosu. <verse eid="ISA 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 38:13" />N da̱nu ta̱ na ankuri hali usana u tawa, agba cine vu revei kamu wu kuɗa ta̱ etele a̱ va̱ suru. Diga usana a̱ tyo ayin vu ta̱wa̱to numu o ukosu. <verse eid="ISA 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 38:14" />Uɗyo u va̱ u ka̱mba̱ ta̱ ke'en tsa manunu, reve n shon tsa̱ mesun ma muɗa ma̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu. Esu a̱ va̱ a̱ kuna̱ ta̱ adama a̱ a̱ka̱nla̱ zuva. N ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a addama, Zagbain. Kamba mu! <verse eid="ISA 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 38:15" />Ili i ne i ɗa maa damma? Adama a na u yuwan ta̱ adanshi na̱ a̱mu, a̱yi na aciya̱yi a ɗa u yuwan niyi. N ta wala ben suru a'wan a̱ va̱ adama a̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu a̱ va̱. <verse eid="ISA 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 38:16" />Zagbain, ni ili i nda i ɗa ama a̱ ri wuma, waru e ili i nda i ɗa wuma u va̱ u ri. Ka̱mbuwa̱ mu gbaga a̱vu vu zuwa n yuwan wuma. <verse eid="ISA 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 38:17" />Uwwai nda, adama a wuma u va̱ u ɗa n da̱na̱i a̱tsuma̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu, agba a̱tsuma̱ e icigi vu wawa ta̱ wuma u va̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ka̱ri o ukototosu, adama a na vu lyawa ta̱ unusu u va̱ o ucina̱ wa̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 38:18" />Adama a na ama a na a̱ ri a aason oo godyowo wu shi, a̱kwa̱kwa̱ aa cuwa wu shi. Aza a na a̱ ri za̱la̱ va̱ a̱a̱ka̱ri a̱ ri nu uzuwu wo okolo wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ a̱ wu shi. <verse eid="ISA 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 38:19" />Aza a wuma, aza a wuma, o tsu godyowo wu ta̱, cine maa yuwusan ana'an. Dada tsu lyawa ta̱ muwun n reve a̱ɓula̱ a̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 38:20" />A̱sulazuva a ta wawa mu, reve tsu cana ishipa oɓolo na̱ kumburu rana wuma tsu suru, ɗe o u'wa wa̱ A̱sulazuva.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 38:21" />Ishaya damma ta̱ ɗe, &lt;&lt;Lyawa le a tara a̱a̱kutsu o ubiri reve a sukuma yi a aamici'in, tsa̱ra̱ u ka̱mba̱ gbaga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 38:22" />Hezekiya damma ta̱ ɗe fo, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa iroci i na ma̱a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ zuva o u'wa wa̱ A̱sulazuva?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 38:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="ISA 39" />
  <para style="s">Ajiya diga Babila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 39:1" />A mantsa mo ndolo Merodaka baldan ulobo wa Baladan, mogono ma Babila, ma̱ lyungu ta̱ ajiya na̱ mpepelime nu une'e reve a ca Hezekiya, adama a na wu uwwa ta̱ ɗe a na u da̱na̱i ubanakun reve u ka̱mba̱ gbaga. <verse eid="ISA 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 39:2" />A̱vu Hezekiya raba le na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱. A̱vu u roco le ili i sa'ani i na i ri pe a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wu uzuwa wa azurufa na̱ zinariya, ni itana i ma̱guru, oɓolo na̱ mani'in ma sa'ani oɓolo ni itana yu uvon ya̱ yi suru, ni ili i na a̱ tsura̱i pe a̱tsuma̱ a 'wa vu uzuwa va̱ yi suru. Babu ili i na i ri pe a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wa̱ yi ko uba̱ta̱ u tsugono tsa̱ yi suru a na Hezekiya roco nle shi.<verse eid="ISA 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 39:3" />Reve Ishaya vumava̱sula̱ ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ u mogono Hezekiya, a̱vu we ece yi, &lt;&lt;Ili i ne i ɗa ama a nda a dammai? Waru te ɗe o uta̱i a̱ ta̱wa̱i uba̱ta̱ wa̱ wu?&gt;&gt; A̱vu Hezekiya usu, &lt;&lt;A̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ ya̱'a̱ va̱ diga e iɗa ya alanga, diga Babila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 39:4" />Reve Ishaya damma, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa e enei o u'wa wa̱ wu?&gt;&gt; A̱vu Hezekiya usu, &lt;&lt;E ene ta̱ ili i na i ri pe a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa u va̱ suru. Babu ili i na i ri a 'wa vu uzuwa va̱ i na n roco nle shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 39:5" />A̱vu Ishaya damma Hezekiya, &lt;&lt;Uwwa adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva: <verse eid="ISA 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 39:6" />Uwwai nda, rana ta̱ lo a̱ ta̱wa̱, ana ili i na i ri pe o u'wa wa̱ wu suru, ni ili i na nkaya ma̱ wu n zuwai hali ana'an, a ta tara le a̱ tyo Babila. Ko ili i ta̱ aa lyawa shi, ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai. <verse eid="ISA 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 39:7" />Waru a̱tsuma̱ o ugundo wa̱ wu, aza a na oo uta̱ ya̱'a̱ wu, aza a na vu matsain, a ta tara le a̱ ka̱ra̱, o to o'wo oɓosoto<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">39:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A mantsa'a o tsu ɓoso ta̱ ali arawa adama o ulinga o ukobu u mogono adama o von na̱ a̱ma̱ci o mogono wan</char></note> o ukobu u mogono ma Babila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 39:8" />Ɗaɗa Hezekiya dammai Ishaya, &lt;&lt;Adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva a na vu dammai u lobono ta̱.&gt;&gt; Adama a na u jiyan ta̱, &lt;&lt;A̱ ta̱ tsura̱ nden ma asuvu na̱ nden n lafiya a rana va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 39:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="ISA 40" />
  <para style="s">Nden ma asuvu adama a ama a̱ A̱sula̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 40:1" />Nden ma asuvu, i ca ama a̱ va̱ nden ma asuvu, ne ɗa A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a dammai. <verse eid="ISA 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 40:2" />I yuwaan Urishelima adanshi ben, reve i saala yi a na a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a̱ yi o koto ta̱, a na a yuwaan yi ta̱ gafura vu nusu va̱ yi, waru a na u ushi ta̱ oforo e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva udoɓonuwu adama o unusu wa̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 40:3" />Uɗyo wu nanza e ɗewu, &lt;&lt;O ogozo i foɓoo A̱sulazuva ure, i yuwan ure u gbain mejege a̱ a̱tsumona adama a̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu. <verse eid="ISA 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 40:4" />O to shiton uka̱ri suru, waru masasan suru na aagaɗi a ta vala le, a ta lapula a̱ka̱ci e re. O to shiton muka̱ri mu re. <verse eid="ISA 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 40:5" />Reve o roco tsugbain tsa̱ A̱sulazuva, reve vaɗilima̱ suru ene yi, adama a na una̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva a ɗa a dammai.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 40:6" />Uɗyo u damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Saala!&gt;&gt; Reve n damma, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa maa saala? Vuma suru tsa anlya tsa ɗa, waru ulobonu wa̱ yi suru tsa̱ yipa̱lu ya aatsusa i ɗa. <verse eid="ISA 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 40:7" />Anlya a tsu 'yewe ta̱, reve yipa̱lu i kpanla ana wivuwun wa̱ A̱sulazuva wi ivula̱ niyi. Amayun, ama anlya a ɗa. <verse eid="ISA 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 40:8" />Anlya a tsu 'yewe ta̱, yipa̱lu i kpanla, amma adanshi a̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu, e te isawan babu ukotu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 40:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 40:9" />A̱vu na va̱a̱ ta̱wusa̱a̱ na alabari a sa'ani a̱ tyo Sihiyona, gawan zuva masasan. A̱vu Urishelima na va̱a̱ ta̱wusa̱ na alabari a sa'ani, 'ya̱sa̱n uɗyo wa̱ wu na̱ yisaali. 'Ya̱sa̱n yi, she vu uwwa wovon wan, damma ilyuci ya Yahuda, &lt;&lt;Apa A̱sula̱ a̱ wu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 40:10" />Uwwai nda, A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ u ta̱wa̱ ta̱ nu ucira, a̱vu ekere a̱ yi a yuwan tsugbain o una̱ wa̱ yi. Uwwai nda, iliyinkapa ya̱ yi i ta̱ e ekere a̱ yi, atsupa a̱ yi waru a̱ ta̱ e ekere a̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 40:11" />U to goloɓo oɓolo e ikyon ya̱ yi tsu za va aguɓa. U to ɓoloto mukyokyon ma̱ yi e ekere a̱ yi. U te sheɗe le a̱ mɓa̱nga̱ ma̱ yi. Reve u rono aza a na a̱ ri na̱ muwun ben. <verse eid="ISA 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 40:12" />Zane ɗa ritoi mini suru a apata e ekere a̱ yi ko u rito washin wa zuva nu ukere wa̱ yi? Zane ɗa guza̱i ma̱buta̱ a aasaka, ko u rito ume wu nsasan wa agaɗi ni ili yu uritosu wu ume? <verse eid="ISA 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 40:13" />Zane ɗa revei majiyan ma̱ A̱sulazuva, ko zane aa gura ca yi a̱sa̱la̱? <verse eid="ISA 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 40:14" />Zane ɗa u tsu zami u ca yi a̱sa̱la̱? Waru zane ɗa tsu kamba yi u da̱na̱ nu urevu? Zane ɗa tsu roco yi ure wa amayun, a̱vu u roco yi urevu, nu ure u mereve? <verse eid="ISA 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 40:15" />Uwwai nda, nɗa'a a̱ ta̱ tsa madaɓi diga a aasa'atsu, waru e te keceshe le tsa̱ a̱buta̱ e ili yu uritosu wu ume. A̱yi ɗa nda, A̱sulazuva a tsu rito ta̱ memere ma̱ mini tsa̱ ma̱buta̱ ma̱ va̱ga̱lya̱. <verse eid="ISA 40:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 40:16" />Ɗanga Lebanon suru a rawa na aa zuwa akina adama a masa'a shi, waru inama ya̱ yi i rawa na aa ca kucci vu ukula̱tosu shi. <verse eid="ISA 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 40:17" />Nɗa suru a̱ ri ili e ekere a̱ yi shi. U tara ili e ekere a̱ yi shi ngashi ili i ɗa shi waru lya̱nga̱. <verse eid="ISA 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 40:18" />Na̱ zane ɗa yaa kurato A̱sula̱? No oroci e ili i ne i ɗa yaa kurato yi? <verse eid="ISA 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 40:19" />Ma̱sula̱! Ili i na maruma ma̱ zuɗa̱i, za vu ulinga u zinariya na pupala niyi na̱ zinariya a̱vu u zuɗa̱a̱ yi akani a azurufa. <verse eid="ISA 40:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 40:20" />Vuma na ri nu ulambu a̱bunda̱ na waa gura ca kucci ne tsunda shi, u tsu ɗangwa ta̱ ɗanga na vaa shama shi. U tsu zami ta̱ vuma na gurai uruma u shuwa̱a̱ yi ma̱sula̱ ma na ma̱ tsu jinga̱ɗa̱ shi. <verse eid="ISA 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 40:21" />Koto i reve shi? Koto yu uwwa shi? Koto a damma ɗu diga o ufaru shi? Koto i reve ikyun i na a yuwain uvaɗi shi? <verse eid="ISA 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 40:22" />A̱yi ɗa za na ri nden zuva ma̱ka̱nda̱ri mo uvaɗi. Ama a̱ yi waru cine vu revei akyun, za na buba̱ruwa̱i zuva cine vu revei umuna. Reve u buba̱ruwa̱ le cine vu revei oogodo a na a̱a̱ da̱nu pe. <verse eid="ISA 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 40:23" />Za na ka̱mba̱toi ngono ili shi, reve waru u ka̱mba̱to azagbain o uvaɗi ili shi. <verse eid="ISA 40:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 40:24" />Ele a̱a̱ cuwa̱n le, ele oo toposhi, kafu a yuwan aralu ugbamu e iɗa, na̱ wi ivula̱ le, a̱vu a kpanla, a̱vu lipa̱ pura̱ le cine vu revei owopo. <verse eid="ISA 40:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 40:25" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ zane ɗa yaa kurato mu? Zane ɗa ri una̱ta̱ na̱ a̱mu?&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa Za va Akiza dammai. <verse eid="ISA 40:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 40:26" />I 'ya̱sa̱n esu a̱ ɗu zuva a̱vu i ka̱lyuwa̱, Zane ɗa yuwain ili i nda suru? Za na uta̱yi oɓolo e le a̱za̱ a̱ ta̱ ta̱ e ɗesu le na ala e le suru, nu ucira wa̱ yi, adama a na u ta̱ nu ukadu o ucira babu za ta̱ na puwa̱in. <verse eid="ISA 40:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 40:27" />Nye i zuwai vu dammai, a̱vu Yakubu, a̱vu vu damma, a̱vu Isra'ila, &lt;&lt;Ure u va̱ u tu usokowu diga a̱ A̱sulazuva'a, waru ili i na i ri za va̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱ a tara yi ili shi&gt;&gt;? <verse eid="ISA 40:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 40:28" />Koto vu reve shi? Koto vu uwwa shi? A̱sulazuva a̱yi ɗa A̱sula̱ a babu ukotu, za na yuwain kosu vu uvaɗi. U tsu kuna̱ shi waru u tsu lamba ucira shi, babu waru za na ee reve a̱ru'un o urevu wa̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 40:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 40:29" />U tsu ca ta̱ za na kuna̱i ucira, za na waru ri ucira uka̱la̱mu a̱vu u da̱shi yi ucira. <verse eid="ISA 40:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 40:30" />Ko olobo a̱ ta̱ kuna̱ a̱vu waru a lamba ucira, reve a̱ ta̱ɗa̱tsa̱ a̱ riya̱, <verse eid="ISA 40:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 40:31" />agba ele aza a na a zuwayi A̱sulazuva ucira u ta ca le ucira u sa'avu, a ta 'yawan tsa̱ a̱kuru. A ta suma agba a̱a̱ kuna̱ shi, a ta wala agba a̱a̱ ta̱ka̱lyuwa̱ shi.<verse eid="ISA 40:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="ISA 41" />
  <para style="s">Za vi ikambi va Isra'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 41:1" />Rungwa̱i i poloo mu atsuvu, a̱ɗu nɗa m memere ma̱ mini! Lyawa i ka̱mbuwisa̱ ucira u ɗu, lyawa i rawa zuzu i yuwan adanshi, lyawa suru ntsu tsu ga'asain uba̱ta̱ wu uge'etosu. <verse eid="ISA 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 41:2" />&lt;&lt;Zane ɗa za na 'ya̱sa̱in za diga asana, e ɗesu yi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱ o ulinga wa̱ yi? U ca yi ta̱ ulyuwu wa aci wu nɗa suru, reve wu dasa ngono za̱la̱ va ana va̱ yi. Reve o o'wo tsa̱ ma̱buta̱ na̱ matsun me pe'eni ma̱ yi, utan wa̱ yi u bete'we le ta̱ tso owopo o upepu. <verse eid="ISA 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 41:3" />U saɓa le ta̱ nu u ka̱ra̱sa̱i gbaga, nu usa̱n a̱civa̱ a̱ yi a̱ ju'wa̱in iɗa. <verse eid="ISA 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 41:4" />Zane ɗa zuwai ili ya nda yo o'wo ne? Za na yuwain mantsa diga ɗe o ufaru? A̱mu A̱sulazuva ɗa n yuwain. A̱mu ɗa za vu ufaru a̱mu ɗa ukosu, a̱mu ɗaɗa a̱yi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 41:5" />Nɗa m memere ma̱ mini me ene ta̱ ili i na n yuwain, reve a uwwa wovon, nɗa mu ukosu wu uvaɗi n je'en ta̱ lipu. Reve a rawa zuzu, a̱ ta̱wa̱ elime. <verse eid="ISA 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 41:6" />Za suru kamba ta̱ za va̱ yi reve u damma za va̱ yi, &lt;&lt;Vi isawan ugbamu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 41:7" />Za vu ushe'en tsu ca ta̱ maruma ma zinariya adanshi. Waru za na tsu gboro na̱ ma̱ka̱ta̱ u tsu ca ta̱ za na tsu ga̱la̱ aci o uruma, a dansa adama o mosono me irumu, &lt;&lt;U lobono ta̱.&gt;&gt; Reve a vara yi ni ikusa adama u jinga̱ɗa wan. <verse eid="ISA 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 41:8" />&lt;&lt;Amma a̱vu, Isra'ila, aagbashi a̱ va̱, Yakubu, za na n ɗangulai, ugundo wa Ibrahim a̱sha̱wa̱yi a̱ va̱, <verse eid="ISA 41:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 41:9" />a̱vu za na n ta̱wa̱i na̱ a̱vu diga o ukosu wu uvaɗi, n ɗe wu ta̱ diga pasu va alanga. Reve n damma, &lt;A̱vu ɗa aagbashi a̱ va̱&gt;, n ɗangula wu ta̱ waru n 'yuwan wu shi. <verse eid="ISA 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 41:10" />She vu uwwa wovon wan, adama a na n to oɓolo na̱ a̱vu. She vu dama wan, adama a na a̱mu ɗa A̱sula̱ a̱ wu. N ta ca wu ucira waru n kamba wu. N ta ɓana wu nu ukere usa'ani u va̱ za va̱ a̱ɓula̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 41:11" />&lt;&lt;Suru aza a na a yuwusan upan na̱ a̱vu a ta uwwa wono reve o zo'oso le. Aza a na waru aa yuwusan mawasan na̱ a̱vu o to o'wo ili ye pere reve a̱ kuwa̱. <verse eid="ISA 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 41:12" />Vu ta zami n'yuwatan ma̱ wu, agba va̱a̱ tsura̱ le shi. Aza a na waru aa yuwusan uvon na̱ a̱vu o to o'wo tsi ili ye pere suru suru. <verse eid="ISA 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 41:13" />Adama a na a̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva, A̱sula̱ a̱ wu. N tu uɓanu nu ukere usa'ani wa̱ wu, a̱mu ɗa za na damma nuwu, &lt;She vu uwwa wovon wan, n ta kamba wu. <verse eid="ISA 41:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 41:14" />She vu uwwa wovon wan, a̱vu Yakubu acilya a babu ucira, a̱ɗu ama a Isra'ila, adama a na a̱mu na aciya̱va̱ n ta kamba ɗu,&gt; &gt;&gt; A̱sulazuva a ɗa a dammai, za na Tsupaa nɗu, Za va Akiza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="ISA 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 41:15" />Uwwai nda, n ta zuwa ɗu yo o'wo tsa aaɗanga a faba, za sa'avu, za wali, za na ri na anga. I ta faba nsasan i rukutsa̱ le, waru i ta̱ ka̱mba̱to agaɗi o o'wo tso owopo. <verse eid="ISA 41:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 41:16" />I ta̱ yeluwe le, reve upepu u pura̱ le a̱ ka̱ra̱, lipa̱ baza le. Amma i ta yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva, reve i yuwan uvaɗu e ekere a Za va Akiza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="ISA 41:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 41:17" />Mantsa ma na a̱za̱ o ulambu na aza a na a cigai ikambishi a̱ bunga̱i mini reve a lamba, a̱la̱kutsu e le e ɗewe ta̱ adama a akuli a̱ mini. Reve a̱mu A̱sulazuva n usu le, a̱mu A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila maa vari le shi. <verse eid="ISA 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 41:18" />N ta̱ kpa̱tu'wa̱ ɗolu zuva va agaɗi, waru iɓula i mini i yene e memere mo uka̱ri. N ta̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ a̱tsumona mala ma̱ mini, iɗa yu u'yewu waru yo o'wo iɓula i mini. <verse eid="ISA 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 41:19" />N ta zuwa ɗanga sida na aza a akashiya na aza a murtil na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ zetun a kungwa a̱ a̱tsumona. Waru n ta zuwa ɗanga sapure na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ fir, nu uɗanga u fini o o'wo a̱a̱rumbu a̱ a̱tsumona. <verse eid="ISA 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 41:20" />Adama ama ee ene reve waru e reve, adama a yuwan majiyan e reve a na ukere wa̱ A̱sulazuva a ɗa a yuwan ili i nda, Za va Akiza a Isra'ila a ɗa a yuwan niyi. <verse eid="ISA 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 41:21" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma, &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱yi na adanshi a̱ a̱ma̱li a̱ ɗu.&gt;&gt; Reve mogono ma Yakubu ma damma, &lt;&lt;Lyawa o roco ili i na aa gura yuwan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 41:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 41:22" />&lt;&lt;Lyawa le a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ a̱ma̱li e le, a damma tsu ili i na yaa fara. A damma tsu nye i ɗa ili yu ufaru, nye i ɗa ele, adama tsu petelyuwe le. Ko gba a damma ili i na i ri elime adama tsu reve ili i na yaa fara. <verse eid="ISA 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 41:23" />Damma ntsu ili i na ya̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ nda elime, tsa̱ra̱ tsu reve a na a̱ɗu ɗa musula̱. I yuwan ili i sa'ani ko yu uwuyanu, tsa̱ra̱ tsu yuwan asalama ko tsu uwwa wovon. <verse eid="ISA 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 41:24" />Uwwai nda, a̱ɗu waru ili i ro i ɗa shi waru a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱ ɗu ili ye pere i ɗa, waru ili yi idaba i ɗa za na ɗangula ɗu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 41:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 41:25" />&lt;&lt;N 'ya̱sa̱n ta̱ za ro diga ugana, waru u ta̱ lo a̱ ta̱wa̱ diga asana, waru u ta̱ ɗe ala a̱ va̱. Waru u ta dadasa azagbain tsa̱ ci'in, cine za vu uma'an tsu kukutsa olo'o. <verse eid="ISA 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 41:26" />Zane ɗa dammai ili i nda i ta fara ɗe nu ufaru, tsa̱ra̱ tsu reve. Diga gogo tsa̱ra̱ tsu damma, &lt;U ta yuwan mejege&gt;? Babu za na dammai ne, babu waru za na cuɗuwai ne, babu waru vuma ro na uwwai adanshi diga uba̱ta̱ u ɗu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 41:27" />A̱mu ɗa n fara dammai Sihiyona, &lt;&lt;Uwwai ele ɗa nda!&gt;&gt; N lyunguwa̱ ta̱ Urishelima na̱ malingata ma alabari a sa'ani. <verse eid="ISA 41:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 41:28" />Mantsa ma na n ka̱lyuwa̱i a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ma̱li babu za. Me ene waru za a̱tsuma̱ e le na aa ca a̱sa̱la̱ shi, za na na̱ me ece wa̱a̱ usu shi. <verse eid="ISA 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 41:29" />Uwwai nda, suru nle ili i ɗa shi. Waru ulinga u le pere ɗa, waru she'en le upepu u ɗa goon.<verse eid="ISA 41:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="ISA 42" />
  <para style="s">Aagbashi a̱ A̱sulazuva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 42:1" />&lt;&lt;Mpa nda aagbashi a̱ va̱, za na n guza̱i, za na n ɗangulai, za na okolo a̱ va̱ a uwwusa uyo'o wa̱ yi. N zuwaa yi ta̱ Ruhu va̱, a̱yi ɗa wa̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ nu uge'etosu u mejege uba̱ta̱ a nɗa. <verse eid="ISA 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 42:2" />Woo oruwo ko u 'ya̱sa̱n uɗyo shi, ko u yuwan adanshi nu ucira e re shi. <verse eid="ISA 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 42:3" />Aapumpu a na a̱ ri yi ugbamu shi woo koso kuɗa yi shi, waru woo koso kimusa̱ fitila na cigai ma̱kima̱a̱ shi. A̱tsuma̱ e mejege a ɗa wa̱a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na amayun. <verse eid="ISA 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 42:4" />Woo uta̱a̱ asuvu shi ko u kuɗa okolo shi hali she nu u ta̱wa̱ na amayun o uvaɗi. A̱tsuma̱ a̱ wila̱ wa̱ yi a ɗa nɗa m memere ma̱ mini maa zuwa okolo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 42:5" />Nda ili i na A̱sula̱, A̱sulazuva a dammai, za na yuwain zuva, reve wu ba̱ruwa̱ le, za na valai uvaɗi ni ili i na yoo utusa̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi suru. A̱yi ɗa za na aa casu ama o uvaɗi wivuwun na̱ wuma uba̱ta̱ wa aza a na a̱ ri a mmalu zuva va̱ yi, <verse eid="ISA 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 42:6" />&lt;&lt;A̱mu A̱sulazuva, n ɗe wu ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱, n ta̱ guza̱ wu nu ukere reve n soko wu. Waru n ta zuwa wu vo o'wo tsa akucunu uba̱ta̱ wa ama, waru vo o'wo ekan uba̱ta̱ wu nɗa, <verse eid="ISA 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 42:7" />adama vu kpa̱tu'wa̱ esu a̱ nrumba̱, adama o uta̱a̱ aza a na a̱ ri o u'wa wa ali diga a̱ a̱ka̱ri o uta̱a̱ aza a na a̱ ri nden e irumbu a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wa ali.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 42:8" />&lt;&lt;A̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva, a̱yi ɗa ala a̱ va̱! Maa ca za ro tsugbain tsa̱ va̱ shi, ko n lyawa a̱ma̱li a̱ tsura̱ ica i va̱ shi. <verse eid="ISA 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 42:9" />Uwwai nda, ili i na n damma nɗu nu ufaru i shiwan ta̱, gogo n ta dansa ɗu ili i sa'avu kafu a fara, kafu a fara n damma ɗu ta̱ ele.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 42:10" />Canayi A̱sulazuva ishipa i sa'avu. Canaa niyi ica waru diga o ukosu wu uvaɗi. Canayi a̱ɗu aza a na a̱ ri a mmalu a mala, ni ili i na i ri suru a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi. Canayi a̱ɗu nɗa m memere ma̱ mini, na aza a na a̱ ri nden suru a̱tsuma̱ e le. <verse eid="ISA 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 42:11" />Lyawa a̱tsumona ni ilyuci ya̱ yi i 'ya̱sa̱n ɗyo le. Lyawa aza a na a̱ ri na̱ nden a̱ mɓa̱nga̱ ma Keda, na ama a Sela a cana ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱. Lyawa le o oruwo diga zuva vu nsasan. <verse eid="ISA 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 42:12" />Lyawa le a ca A̱sulazuva tsugbain, e revetyo ica ya̱ yi a nɗa m memere ma̱ mini. <verse eid="ISA 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 42:13" />A̱sulazuva a̱ to uta̱ tsa vuma vu ucira, tsa vuma vu uvon, u ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱n upan wa̱ yi. U yuwan ta̱ ɗesu yorori vu uvon va̱ yi, reve u roco aciya̱yi za vu ucira ɗa uba̱ta̱ a n'yuwatan ma̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 42:14" />A̱sulazuva a damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;N jima ta̱ kpen, agba n yuwan adanshi shi waru n kaɓa ta̱ asuvu. Amma gogo n ta saala na̱ ma̱nga̱ tsu mɓa̱la̱ mu ka limatan. N te ivuwan fe'eku fe'eku babu uyo'o. <verse eid="ISA 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 42:15" />N ta̱ lungusa̱ nsasan na agaɗi, reve n 'yeweto itana yi ca̱'a̱n le suru. N ta zuwa ɗolu le 'yewe a̱ka̱mba̱ iɗa i memere ma̱ mini, reve waru n 'yeweto oko'o e le. <verse eid="ISA 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 42:16" />Waru n to rono nrumba̱ aɗanga o ure u na e revei shi, e re na e revei shi ɗa ma̱a̱ kuru ne ele. N ta̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ irumbu yo o'wo ekan a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n me le, ba̱ta̱ na ri ulobonu shi o o'wo pete. Ele ɗa ili i na maa yuwan, maa vari le shi. <verse eid="ISA 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 42:17" />Amma aza a na a zuwayi a̱ma̱li a na e she'ein ucira, aza a na aa dansaa a̱ma̱li a na a̱ zuɗa̱i, &lt;A̱ɗu ɗa musula̱ n tsu,&gt; a ta zuwa le o uwwa wono suru suru.<verse eid="ISA 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsurumba̱ na̱ tsugulani tsa Isra'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 42:18" />&lt;&lt;Poloi atsuvu a̱ɗu agulani waru a̱ɗu nrumba̱ i ka̱lyuwa̱ adama yee ene. <verse eid="ISA 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 42:19" />Zane ɗa buwai irumba̱ agba aagbashi a̱ va̱ a ɗa ko zane ɗa buwai aagulani tsa malingata ma̱ va̱ za na n lyunguyi? Zane ɗa irumba̱ tsa vuma na cayi aciya̱yi ya̱'a va̱ ko irumba̱ tsa aagbashi a̱ A̱sulazuva? <verse eid="ISA 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 42:20" />U tse ene ta̱ ili na̱ a̱bunda̱, agba u tsu ka̱mbuwa̱ ugbozu shi. Atsuvu a̱ yi a̱ tu ukpa̱tu'u, agba u tsu uwwa shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 42:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 42:21" />Adama a̱ a̱ɓula̱ a̱ A̱sulazuva u yo'ono yi ta̱ u ca wila̱ wa̱ yi ucira na̱ tsugbain. <verse eid="ISA 42:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 42:22" />Amma ama a nda aza a na a̱ pura̱i waru a usa nle ili i ɗa, suru nle a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ka̱ri a ɗa e geshe nle, reve o soko le o u'wa wa ali. O o'wo ta̱ itana i na a pura̱i uba̱ta̱ o uvon za na babu za na aa wawa le, tse itana i na usai i na babu za na a̱a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ le o u'wa. <verse eid="ISA 42:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 42:23" />Zane ɗa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu woo polo atsuvu ko u ka̱mbuwa̱ ugbozu a mantsa ma na ma̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ elime? <verse eid="ISA 42:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 42:24" />Zane ɗa cayi Yakubu uba̱ta̱ wu za va a'usa ndolo, aza a Isra'ila uba̱ta̱ wa aza a usa o ndolo? A̱sulazuva a ɗa na aciya̱yi, uba̱ta̱ wu za na tsu yuwain unusu. Adama a na a̱yi ɗa za na a̱ kuɗa̱i a̱ kuru ure wa̱ yi, waru a yuwan tsutoni na̱ wila̱ wa̱ yi shi. <verse eid="ISA 42:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 42:25" />Adama o ndolo u tsuwa̱n le ta̱ usuɗuwu wu upan wa̱ yi, nu ucira wu uvon. U ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ le ta̱ na akina, amma suru na̱ ne e reve shi, u kula̱to le ta̱ amma a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ ugbozu shi.<verse eid="ISA 42:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="ISA 43" />
  <para style="s">Za vi Iwawi ta̱ goon va Isra'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 43:1" />Amma gogo, nda ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, a̱yi za na ma'an nuwu, a̱vu Yakubu, a̱yi za na yuwan nuwu, a̱vu Isra'ila, &lt;&lt;She vu uwwa wovon wan, adama a na n tsupaa wu ta̱, n ɗe wu ta̱ na ala, waru a̱vu za va̱ ɗa. <verse eid="ISA 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 43:2" />Mantsa ma na vu kurula̱i a̱ mini ma̱ a̱ru'un n ta̱ da̱na̱ oɓolo na̱ a̱vu, waru na̱ vu kuru o ɗolu a̱ pura̱ wu shi. Na̱ vu kuru e memere ma akina wa̱a̱ kula̱to wu shi, waru elentsu a̱ yi a lyuwa wu shi. <verse eid="ISA 43:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 43:3" />Adama a na a̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva, A̱sula̱ a̱ wu, Za va Akiza va Isra'ila, Za vi Iwawi ya̱ wu. N ca ta̱ Masar o una̱ wa̱ wu, Kush na̱ Seba waru o una̱ wa̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 43:4" />Ana wo o'woi vu ta̱ ulobonu na̱ tsugbain o urewesu u va̱, waru n ciga wu ta̱, n ca ta̱ ama o una̱ wa̱ wu no u una̱ u wuma wa̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 43:5" />She vu uwwa wovon wan, adama a na n to oɓolo na̱ a̱vu, n to ɓoloto wu na̱ muwun ma̱ wu diga asana na̱ a̱livu. <verse eid="ISA 43:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 43:6" />N ta damma ugana, &lt;Ka̱mbuwa̱ le.&gt; N damma uyagi, &lt;She vu guza̱ le wan.&gt; Ta̱wa̱yi na̱ muwun mo olobo n va̱ diga a nɗa ma alanga, waru muwun me esheli n va̱ diga o ukosu wu uvaɗi, <verse eid="ISA 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 43:7" />suru za na e ɗeyi na ala a̱ va̱, za na n yuwain adama a tsugbain tsa̱ va̱, za na n ma'ain waru n yuwain.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 43:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 43:8" />Uta̱yi aza a na a̱ ri nrumba̱, agba a̱ ta̱ ne esu, aza a na a̱ ri agulani agba a̱ ta̱ na̱ atsuvu. <verse eid="ISA 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 43:9" />Nɗa suru m ɓoloto ta̱ uba̱ta̱ u ta̱, ama o ɓoloto ta̱. Zane ɗa a̱tsuma̱ e le aa gura damma ili yu usokowu i nda, waru zane ɗa aa damma tsu ili i na i ka̱ra̱i? Lyawa le a̱ ta̱wa̱ na aza a na oo o'wo esu e le o roco a̱ ta̱ mejege, waru lyawa le a uwwa reve a damma, &lt;&lt;Amayun a ɗa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 43:10" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma, &lt;&lt;A̱ɗu ɗa esu a̱ va̱ na aagbashi a̱ va̱ za na n ɗangulai, adama i reve waru i usu mu waru i reve a na a̱mu goon a̱mu ɗa A̱sula̱. Kafu a̱mu a yuwan A̱sula̱ o ro shi, waru aa yuwan za ro a̱ca̱pa̱ a̱ va̱ shi. <verse eid="ISA 43:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 43:11" />A̱mu, a̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva, babu na̱ a̱mu za vi iwawi ro lo shi. <verse eid="ISA 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 43:12" />A̱mu ɗa n dammai a̱vu n wawa reve waru n cuɗuwa, waru babu mocin n ma̱sula̱ mo ro ma na ma̱ shi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu. A̱ɗu ɗa esu a̱ va̱, a na a̱mu ɗa A̱sula̱,&gt;&gt; A̱sulazuva a ɗa a dammai, <verse eid="ISA 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 43:13" />&lt;&lt;A̱mu ɗa A̱sula̱, ne ɗa waru n ri babu ukotu, babu za na aa wawa diga e ekere a̱ va̱. A mantsa ma na n yuwain ili i ro, zane ɗa aa gura vadala yi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 43:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isa'ani ya̱ A̱sula̱ nu ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ wa Isra'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 43:14" />Mpa ili i na A̱sulazuva za na Tsupaa nɗu Za va Akiza a Isra'ila a dammai, &lt;&lt;Adama a̱ ɗu n ta lyungu a̱soja a̱ tyo Babila, waru n to lo le suru ni ilaɗi, hali na aza a Kaldiya a na a̱ ri a̱tsuma̱ a antsun a na a yuwusan ma̱za̱nga̱. <verse eid="ISA 43:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 43:15" />A̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva, Za va Akiza a̱ ɗu, za na yuwan nuwu Isra'ila, mogono ma̱ ɗu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 43:16" />Mpa ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, a̱yi za na yuwain ure a̱tsuma̱ a mala, ure a̱ mini mo ucira, <verse eid="ISA 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 43:17" />za na o utusa̱a̱ na̱ a̱soja a na a gurai uvon ni ikeke yi ido ni ido, o von ta̱, waru aa gura 'yowisa̱n shi a̱ kuwa̱ ta̱. A̱ kimusa̱ le ta̱ tso logoni. <verse eid="ISA 43:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 43:18" />&lt;&lt;Yi icina ni ili yu ufaru, waru she i cuwan ili i na i ka̱ra̱i wan. <verse eid="ISA 43:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 43:19" />Uwwai nda, n ta zama n yuwan ili i sa'avu i ro! Gogo u fara ta̱ ɗe, ye ene yi shi? N ta yuwan ure a̱ a̱tsumona na̱ ɗolu e iɗa yu u'yewu. <verse eid="ISA 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 43:20" />Inama yu una i ta ca mu tsugbain, na̱ musa̱n mu una na azamina, adama a na n ca ta̱ mini a̱ a̱tsumona na̱ ɗolu e iɗa yu u'yewu, adama n ca ama a na n ɗangulai mini mo oso, <verse eid="ISA 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 43:21" />ama a na n yuwain adama a aciya̱va̱ adama a cuɗuwa ica i va̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 43:22" />&lt;&lt;Suru na̱ ne vu ɗe a̱ tyo ya̱'a̱ va̱ shi, a̱vu Yakubu, agba m makan wu ta̱, a̱vu Isra'ila. <verse eid="ISA 43:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 43:23" />Vu ta̱wa̱a̱ mu ni ikyon adama a̱ kucci vu ukula̱tosu shi, ko vu ca mu tsugbain na̱ kucci va̱ wu shi. N damaton wu adama a̱ kucci vi ishina shi, ko n kuna̱to wu adama a furenkisen shi. <verse eid="ISA 43:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 43:24" />I tsula aturare a̱ ma̱guru adama a̱ va̱ shi, ko i cuwa̱ton mu na̱ mani'in me inama ma̱ kucci ɗu shi. Amma a̱vu i damaton mu waru i kuna̱to mu na̱ nusu ɗu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 43:25" />A̱mu, A̱mu ɗaɗa za na aa tawa nusu ɗu adama a aciya̱va̱, waru ma̱a̱ da̱shi cuwan nu unusu u ɗu shi. <verse eid="ISA 43:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 43:26" />Cuwaan numu na̱ a̱ca̱pa̱, lyawa tsu yuwain mawasan oɓolo. Ɗarayi adanshi adama u roco i ri nu unusu shi. <verse eid="ISA 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 43:27" />Kaka ɗu vu ufaru yuwan ta̱ unusu, ama a na a yuwusan adanshi o una̱ u ɗu a yuwaan mu ta̱ unusu. <verse eid="ISA 43:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 43:28" />Adama o ndolo n ca ta̱ azagbain a̱ a̱a̱'isa̱ a̱ ɗu wono, waru n ca ta̱ Yakubu adama o ukototosu, Isra'ila waru adama o wono.<verse eid="ISA 43:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="ISA 44" />
  <para style="s">Isra'ila za na A̱sulazuva a ɗangwai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 44:1" />&lt;&lt;Amma gogo she vu polo atsuvu, a̱vu Yakubu aagbashi a̱ va̱, Isra'ila za na n ɗangwai. <verse eid="ISA 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 44:2" />Mpa ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, a̱yi za na yuwan nuwu, za na ruma nuwu diga a̱ a̱a̱tsuma̱, za na aa kambusa wu. She vu uwwa wovon wan, a̱vu Yakubu aagbashi a̱ va̱, Jeshurun za na n ɗangwai. <verse eid="ISA 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 44:3" />Adama a na n ta̱ tsun mini e iɗa i na i ri na akuli, ɗolu waru e iɗa yu u'yewu. N ta̱ tsun ruhu va̱ a aci a̱ muwun n ɗu, waru aba'un a̱ va̱ o gundo ɗu. <verse eid="ISA 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 44:4" />O to topo waru a̱tsuma̱ a anlya, tsu ɗanga vu nkyun mu ɗolu na ri e meyene. <verse eid="ISA 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 44:5" />Za ro ta damma, &lt;A̱mu za va̱ A̱sulazuva ɗa,&gt; za ro waru te ɗe aciya̱yi na aala a Yakubu. Waru za ro ta ɗana o ukere wa̱ yi, &lt;Za va̱ A̱sulazuva,&gt; u ca aciya̱yi na aala a Isra'ila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva agba a̱ma̱li shi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 44:6" />&lt;&lt;Mpa nda ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, mogono ma Isra'ila na̱ za na tsupaa niyi, A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva. A̱mu ɗa ufaru, a̱mu ɗa ukosu. A̱ca̱pa̱ a̱ va̱ A̱sula̱ o ro o lo shi. <verse eid="ISA 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 44:7" />Zane ɗa ri lo tsa̱ va̱? Lyawa wu uta̱ u damma. Waru lyawa u damma a̱vu u pa̱lu'wa̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ va̱ ili i na i farai diga a mantsa ma na n yuwain ama ɗe o ufaru a̱ va̱ ni ili i na koto i farai shi. Lyawa u damma ili i na ya̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ a̱ca̱pa̱. <verse eid="ISA 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 44:8" />She yi da'wan ko yu uwwa wovon wan. Koto n damma wu hali n cuɗuwa wu ɗe nu ujumu shi? Waru a̱ɗu ɗa esu a̱ va̱. Ma̱sula̱ mo ro ta̱ lo a̱ca̱pa̱ a̱ va̱? Babu Aatali o ro, n reve ko za ta̱ shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 44:9" />Suru aza a na aa yuwusan a̱ma̱li pere ɗa, waru itana aa yuwusan ma̱za̱nga̱ ne ele a̱ ri nu urana shi. Aza a na aa yuwan adanshi o una̱ u le nrumba̱ n ɗa, waru a̱za̱ o ulambu wu urevu wi ili ɗa, a ta uwwa wono. <verse eid="ISA 44:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 44:10" />Zane ɗa ee she'en ma̱sula̱ mo ro ko u zuɗa a̱ma̱li, za na a̱a̱ da̱shi yi ili i ro shi? <verse eid="ISA 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 44:11" />Uwwai, a̱yi na ama a̱ yi a ta uwwa wono, a̱za̱ o ulinga wu ukere, ama a ɗa goon. Lyawa suru nle o ɓoloto uba̱ta̱ u ta̱ reve e isawan mishin, a̱ ta̱ gba uwwa wovon na̱ wono. <verse eid="ISA 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 44:12" />Maruma ma tsu tara ta̱ rumu a̱vu u yuwan ulinga na̱ a̱yi a akinkina, u tsu ruma ta̱ a̱ma̱li na̱ ma̱ka̱ta̱, u tsu lapusa yi ta̱ nu ucira wu ukere wa̱ yi. U tsu uwwa ta̱ ambulu hali u lamba ucira wa̱ yi, waru u tsu sowo mini shi hali u ta̱ka̱lyuwa̱. <verse eid="ISA 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 44:13" />Za vu ulinga wa akpata tsu rito ta̱ akpata, u tsu rono ta̱ iɗana ɗe na agita e iɗana, reve u she'en yi ni itana yu ulinga ya̱ yi. Reve u yuwan yi oroci a vuma ulobonu, adama a̱ shuwa̱ yi uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱ga̱nda̱. <verse eid="ISA 44:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 44:14" />U tsu koɗo ta̱ uɗanga u sida ko u ɗangula uɗanga u fir ko za oku waru u tsu lyawa ta̱ uɗanga u kungwa ugbamu a̱tsuma̱ a ɗanga va̱ a̱rumbu. U tsu shuwa̱ ta̱ uɗanga u sida waru iro'i i ɗa i tsu kungwato yi. <verse eid="ISA 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 44:15" />Vuma tsu daɓa yi ta̱ akina, upasu u ro adama u lyasuwa, upasu u ro waru u tsu kangala ta̱ opopofu. Waru u tsu yuwan ta̱ ma̱sula̱ reve u yuwaan yi a̱ga̱nda̱, u tsu yuwan ta̱ a̱ma̱li na̱ a̱yi reve u kingyo a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 44:16" />U tsu kula̱to ta̱ uɓatsulai wa̱ yi, zuva vu uɓatsulai u nda'a u tsu zun ta̱ ɗe inama a̱vu u tama hali u cuwa̱n. Waru u tsu lyasuwa ta̱ hali u damma, &lt;&lt;Ehee mu uwwa ta̱ sheshen, mu uwwa ta̱ uyo'o wa akina!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 44:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 44:17" />Nu uɓatsulai wa̱ yi u ɗa u tsu yuwan ma̱sula̱ a̱ma̱li a̱ yi, u tsu kingyowa̱ yi ta̱ u yuwaan yi a̱ga̱nda̱. U tsu yuwan ta̱ avasa a̱ tyo ya̱'a̱ yi u damma, &lt;&lt;Wawa mu, adama a na a̱vu ɗa ma̱sula̱ ma̱ va̱!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 44:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 44:18" />E reve ili i ro shi, ko a̱ tsura̱ urevu wi ili i ro shi. A̱ ɓa̱ru ta̱ esu e le tsa̱ra̱ e ene wan, waru a̱ ɓa̱ru ta̱ okolo e le tsa̱ra̱ e reve wan. <verse eid="ISA 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 44:19" />Babu za na yuwain majiyan a asuvu a̱ yi, ko u ri nu ugbozu ko urevu u na waa damma, &lt;&lt;N kula̱to ta̱ uɓatsulai u ta̱ wu uɗanga u nda, waru n kangala ta̱ opopofu zuva va akinkina a̱ yi, n zun ta̱ inama reve n tama. N ta yuwan ili yi idaba na akapi a na a buwai? N ta̱ kingyowa̱ a̱a̱gba̱la̱ o uɗanga?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 44:20" />Okomo a ɗa waa lyuwusa, majiyan ma̱ wulumu ma̱ yi ma̱ pusa̱n yi ta̱, waru waa gura wawa aciya̱yi shi ko we ece, &lt;&lt;Ashe epen ɗa a̱ ri o ukere u sa'ani u va̱ shi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 44:21" />&lt;&lt;Vu cuwan ni ili i nda, a̱vu Yakubu adama a na a̱vu aagbashi a̱ va̱ a ɗa a̱vu Isra'ila. N yuwan wu ta̱, a̱vu ɗa aagbashi a̱ va̱ a̱vu Isra'ila, me icina na̱ a̱vu shi. <verse eid="ISA 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 44:22" />Mi iza̱ ta̱ unusu wa̱ wu tse eleshe waru tsa̱ megeve mo usana. She vu ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ u va̱ adama a na n tsupaa wu ta̱ ɗe. <verse eid="ISA 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 44:23" />Yuwain ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱, a̱ɗu zuva, adama a na A̱sulazuva a ɗa a yuwain ili i nda! Oruwoi lon a̱ɗu iɗa ya̱ a̱ru'un! Ɓosoi ni ishipa, a̱ɗu nsasan, a̱ɗu a̱rumbu, na̱ ɗanga na ri pe suru, adama a na A̱sulazuva a tsupaa ta̱ Yakubu, waru u ta̱ tsura̱ tsugbain pe Isra'ila.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱ ta̱ da̱nu Urishelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 44:24" />Mpa ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, za na Tsupaa nɗu, za na yuwan nɗu diga a̱ a̱a̱tsuma̱, &lt;&lt;A̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva za na yuwain ili suru, za na a̱yi ɗa goon wu ba̱ruwa̱i zuva, a̱mu ɗa goon n valai uvaɗi na aciya̱va̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 44:25" />Za na tsu kacara iroci ya ama̱sula̱ e epen, za na tsu ka̱mba̱to a̱za̱ a̱ yindi olo. Za na tsu vadala urevu wa̱ a̱za̱ o urevu, reve u ka̱mba̱to urevu u le tsulo. <verse eid="ISA 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 44:26" />Za na tsu shiton adanshi a agbashi a̱ yi waru u shiton ili i na nlingata n va̱ n dammai. Za na dammai adama a̱ Urishelima, &lt;&lt; &lt;U ta̱ da̱na̱ na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ nden pe,&gt; waru e ilyuci ya Yahuda, &lt;A ta suwisa le,&gt; waru, &lt;N ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱n okongo e le,&gt; <verse eid="ISA 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 44:27" />za na dammai a̱ru'un a mala, &lt;Vu 'yewe! Waru n ta̱ 'yeweto ɗolu va̱ wu,&gt; <verse eid="ISA 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 44:28" />za na dammai Sayiru, &lt;A̱yi ɗa za va aguɓa a̱ va̱ waru u to shiton ifoɓi i va̱ suru,&gt; u ta damma adama a̱ Urishelima, &lt;Lyawa a suwisa yi,&gt; &gt;&gt; na adama a̱ A̱a̱'isa̱, &lt;&lt;Lyawa a̱ shuwa̱ ikyun ya̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 44:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="ISA 45" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 45:1" />&lt;&lt;Mpa nda ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai Sayiru Mogono ma na u tsuwa̱yin mani'in. Za na m ɓanai ukere u sa'ani wa̱ yi reve n ca yi ucira u na waa lyuwa nɗa n na n ri a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi waru u ba̱ɗa̱ gbakala vu ngono. Waru adama a̱ kpa̱tu'wa̱ na̱ntsu a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi tsa̱ra̱ a̱ ɓa̱ru na̱ntsu'u wan. <verse eid="ISA 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 45:2" />N ta̱ ka̱ra̱ elime a̱ wu n vala nsasan, n ta kuɗa na̱ntsu vu rumushili waru mu kuɗa aɗanga e irumu'u. <verse eid="ISA 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 45:3" />N ta ca wu utsuru u na u ri e irumbu, utsuru u na a zuwai usokowu, adama vu reve a na a̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva, A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila, za na ɗe nuwu na aala. <verse eid="ISA 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 45:4" />Adama a aagbashi a̱ va̱ Yakubu, Isra'ila za na n ɗangulai, n ɗe wu ta̱ na aala a̱ wu, n ca wu ta̱ aala a tsugbain, ko na wo o'woi vu reve mu shi. <verse eid="ISA 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 45:5" />A̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva, waru babu za ro, babu na̱ a̱mu A̱sula̱ o ro o lo shi. N ta casu wu ucira ko na vu reve numu shi, <verse eid="ISA 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 45:6" />adama ama e reve a na diga asana a̱ tyo alivu babu A̱sula̱ o ro a̱ca̱pa̱ a̱ va̱. A̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva, waru babu za ro. <verse eid="ISA 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 45:7" />N yuwan ta̱ ekan, a̱vu waru n yuwan irumbu. N tsu ta̱wa̱ ta̱ na̱ nden mu uyo'o, a̱vu waru n zuwa a̱tsuma̱lima̱. A̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva za na yuwain ili i nda suru.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 45:8" />&lt;&lt;A̱ɗu zuva na ri zuva, ro'oi a̱ɓula̱ diga zuva, lyawa eleshe o oco yi. Lyawa iɗa i kpa̱tu'wa̱ ulobonu a na iwawi na̱ a̱ɓula̱ yaa matsan muwun. Lyawa iɗa i zuwa le o uta̱. A̱mu A̱sulazuva, a̱mu ɗa n yuwan niyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 45:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 45:9" />&lt;&lt;A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a ta cina za na aa yuwusan mawasan na̱ za na yuwan niyi, upondo a̱tsuma̱ o pondo vo olo'o! Olo'o a ta damma za na yuwan niyi, &lt;Nye i ɗa vaa yuwusan?&gt; Ko, &lt;Ekere a̱ wu e reve ulinga u le shi?&gt; <verse eid="ISA 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 45:10" />A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a ta cina za na dammai dada, &lt;Nye vu matsain tsunda?&gt; ko u damma mma, &lt;Nye i ɗa vu matsain?&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 45:11" />Mpa ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, Za va Akiza a Isra'ila, za na yuwan niyi, &lt;&lt;Vu te ece mu adama e ili i na maa yuwaan muwun n va̱, ko vu damma mu ili i na maa yuwan adama o ulinga we ekere a̱ va̱? <verse eid="ISA 45:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 45:12" />A̱mu ɗa za na yuwain uvaɗi reve n yuwan vuma a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi. Ekere a̱ va̱ a ɗa a̱ ba̱ruwa̱i zuva, waru n ta yuwusan tsugbain tsi ili i na i ri zuva suru. <verse eid="ISA 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 45:13" />N ta 'ya̱sa̱n Sayiru a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱ a̱ va̱, waru n ta̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ suru re va̱ yi mejege. U ta suwisa lyuci gbain va̱, waru u wawa agbashi a̱ va̱ pere, babu atsupu ko iliyinkapa, A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a ɗa a dammai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 45:14" />Mpa ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai: &lt;&lt;Utsuru wa Masar na̱ za va Kush, na ama o ugaɗi aza a Seba waru o to o'wo agbashi a̱ ɗu, o to toni ɗu ele wunlu na akani. A̱ ta̱ kingyo a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ ɗu reve a pati ɗu, a dansa, &lt;Amayun A̱sula̱ o to oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu, waru babu za ro, babu ma̱sula̱ mo ro.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 45:15" />Amayun a̱vu A̱sula̱ a ɗa za na tsu soko aciya̱yi, A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila Zamawawa. <verse eid="ISA 45:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 45:16" />Suru aza a na aa yuwusan a̱ma̱li a ta uwwa wono ni ili yi izo'oshi, suru nle a ta uwwa wono. <verse eid="ISA 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 45:17" />Amma Isra'ila ta̱ tsura̱ iwawi diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva ni iwawi i babu ukotu. Yaa uwwa wono shi ko yo o'wo ili yi izo'oshi shi, babu ukotu. <verse eid="ISA 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 45:18" />Adama a na apa ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, za na yuwain zuva. A̱yi ɗa A̱sula̱, a̱yi ɗa za na ma'ain uvaɗi waru u yuwan niyi. U yuwan uvaɗi u da̱na̱ lya̱nga̱ shi. U yuwan yi ta̱ adama a̱ da̱nu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi. U damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;A̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva, waru babu za ro. <verse eid="ISA 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 45:19" />N yuwan adanshi usokowu a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa yi irumbu shi. N damma ugundo wa Yakubu &lt;Zami numu pere shi.&gt; A̱mu A̱sulazuva n tsu damma ta̱ amayun, n ta dansa ili i na i ri mejege.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 45:20" />&lt;&lt;Ɓolotoi uba̱ta̱ u ta̱ reve i ta̱wa̱, i rawa zuzu oɓolo, a̱ɗu aza a na a la'ai a nɗa. A̱ ri nu urevu shi, aza a na a̱ ri utanuwu na̱ a̱ma̱li a ɗanga, aza a na a yuwusan avasa a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u musula̱ n na n tsu wawa shi. <verse eid="ISA 45:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 45:21" />Dammai waru i ta̱wa̱ na adanshi a̱ ɗu, i ɓoloto a̱vu i sa̱la̱la̱i ili i na yaa damma. Zane ɗa dammai ne nu ujumu? Zane dammai ne ɗe a̱ca̱pa̱? A̱mu A̱sulazuva a ɗa shi? Waru babu A̱sula̱ o ro a̱ca̱pa̱ a̱ va̱, A̱sula̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱ na̱ Zamawawa. Babu za ro she a̱mu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 45:22" />&lt;&lt;Vadalai ya̱'a̱ va̱ adama i tsura̱ iwawi, suru a̱ɗu ama o kosu vu uvaɗi, adama a na a̱mu ɗa A̱sula̱, waru babu za ro. <verse eid="ISA 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 45:23" />N kucina ta̱ na aciya̱va̱, adanshi o uta̱ ta̱ ɗe diga o una̱ u va̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱, adanshi a na aa vadala shi. A̱lu suru a̱ ta̱ kingyo a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ va̱, elentsu suru a taraa mu akucunu. <verse eid="ISA 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 45:24" />A ta damma adama a̱ va̱, &lt;Uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva a ɗa goon a̱a̱ tsura̱ a̱ɓula̱ nu ucira.&gt; &gt;&gt; Aza a na a yuwain upan na̱ a̱yi a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ ya̱'a̱ yi waru a ta uwwa wono. <verse eid="ISA 45:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 45:25" />Uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva a ɗa gundo va Isra'ila suru va̱a̱ tsura̱ uge'etosu wa amayun no ogoɗiyo.<verse eid="ISA 45:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="ISA 46" />
  <para style="s">Musula̱ ma Babila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 46:1" />Bel kingyo ta̱, Nebo waru ka̱ɗa̱to ta̱, a̱ma̱li e le a ta tanusu le e iliyamunga ni inan. Ili i na a tanusu nda o o'wo ta̱ itana yu ume e ekere e iliyamunga i na i kuna̱i. <verse eid="ISA 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 46:2" />A̱ kingyo ta̱ a̱vu a̱ ka̱ɗa̱to suru nle, aa gura tara itana'a shi, waru ele a aciyele a̱ ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱ tsugbashi. <verse eid="ISA 46:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 46:3" />&lt;&lt;Uwwa numu, a̱ɗu u'wa wa Yakubu, suru nɗu aza a na a pasai o u'wa wa Isra'ila. A̱mu ɗa ma̱a̱ guzusa̱ ɗu diga a mantsa ma na a yuwain a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu. Waru maa tanusu ɗu diga a mantsa ma limatan ma̱ ɗu. <verse eid="ISA 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 46:4" />Hali a rawa tsukutsa tsa̱ ɗu, a̱mu ɗa a̱yi'i. Hali mantsa mo yono ma̱ ɗu a̱mu ɗa ma̱a̱ ka̱lyuwa̱ ɗu. A̱mu ɗa n yuwan nɗu waru n ta tanu ɗu, n ta̱ ka̱lyuwa̱ ɗu a̱vu n wawa ɗu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 46:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 46:5" />&lt;&lt;Na̱ zane ɗa yoo o'woto mu una̱ta̱ na̱ a̱yi ko i kurato mu na̱ a̱yi? Na̱ zane ɗa yoo ɓolo mu za na tsu rotsuloi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 46:6" />Ozo o ro a̱ tsu za̱la̱ ta̱ zinariya diga e itsa̱n i le reve a̱ kunzu azurufa e ili yu ukunzusu wu ume. Reve a tsupa maruma ma zinariya u rumaa le ma̱sula̱, a̱vu a̱ ka̱ɗa̱to a yuwaan yi a̱ga̱nda̱. <verse eid="ISA 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 46:7" />A tsu tanu yi ta̱ a̱ nlyungu n le a̱vu e sheɗe yi, a̱vu a zuwa yi, waru lo ɗa u tsi isawan. U tsu gura sheɓenu uba̱ta̱ shi. Ko na̱ vuma showen yi, u tsu usu shi, waa gura wawa yi a̱tsuma̱ a addama a na u ri shi. <verse eid="ISA 46:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 46:8" />&lt;&lt;Cuwain ni ili i nda, i guza̱ yi ugbamu. I zuwa yi o okolo, a̱ɗu a̱za̱ o unusu. <verse eid="ISA 46:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 46:9" />Cuwain ni ili yu ufaru ya̱ a̱ca̱pa̱, a̱mu ɗa A̱sula̱ agba za ro lo shi. A̱mu ɗa A̱sula̱, waru za ro lo tsa̱ va̱ shi. <verse eid="ISA 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 46:10" />N tsu roco ta̱ ukosu wi ili diga o ufaru waru diga a mantsa mo ufaru, n tsu roco ta̱ ili i na koto a yuwain shi. N tsu damma ta̱, &lt;Ifoɓi i va̱ i ta shiwan, waru n ta yuwan ili i na suru n cigai.&gt; <verse eid="ISA 46:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 46:11" />N te ɗe asala a na a̱ tsu ka̱ɗa̱ inama diga e iɗa ya alanga, vuma na oo shiton ifoɓi i va̱. A̱mu ɗa n dammai, ne ɗa waru maa zuwa u shiwan. A̱mu ɗa n foɓoi, ne ɗa waru ma yuwan yi. <verse eid="ISA 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 46:12" />Uwwa numu, a̱ɗu aza a aciyogbamu, a̱ɗu aza a na i ri alanga na̱ a̱ɓula̱. <verse eid="ISA 46:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 46:13" />N ta rawatosu a̱ɓula̱ a̱ va̱ zuzu, u ri alanga shi, waru iwawi i va̱ waa tara mantsa shi. N ta zuwa iwawi i va̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Sihiyona, tsugbain tsa̱ va̱ waru a̱tsuma̱ a Isra'ila.<verse eid="ISA 46:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="ISA 47" />
  <para style="s">A̱risa̱ a Babila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 47:1" />&lt;&lt;Cipa̱, vu da̱nu a̱ ma̱buta̱, Usheli Babila u na u revei vali shi, danu e iɗa babu ootogu o tsugono, Usheli wa aza a Kaldiya. A buwa e ɗe wu usheli wa azagbain ili i sa'ani shi. <verse eid="ISA 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 47:2" />Tara aatali a yira vi ira yira, vu palu'wa aapalutsu a̱ wu! Vu foɗo utugu wu uga'an wa̱ wu, vu kpa̱tu'wa̱ ana a̱ wu, vu pasalai na̱ ɗolu. <verse eid="ISA 47:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 47:3" />E te ene ataɓu a̱ wu, waru e te ene wono wa̱ wu. N ta tsupa wu, agba ko za maa lyawa shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 47:4" />Za na tsupaa ntsu, A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a ɗa ala a̱ yi, a̱yi ɗa Za va Akiza a Isra'ila. <verse eid="ISA 47:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 47:5" />&lt;&lt;Da̱nu kuci, a̱vu vu da̱nu a̱tsuma̱ e irumbu, Usheli wa aza a Kaldiya. A buwa e ɗe wu egbere lyuci tsugono vu nɗa n ro shi. <verse eid="ISA 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 47:6" />N shi ta̱ a yuwusan upan na ama a̱ va̱ a̱vu n lungusa̱ le agadu a̱ va̱. N ca le ta̱ e ekere a̱ wu, agba ve ene iliyali i le shi. Hali na aza a na a kutsai fo vu zuwaa le ta̱ ulinga wu usa̱n. <verse eid="ISA 47:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 47:7" />Vu damma, &lt;N ta̱ da̱na̱ egbere lyuci kukuci!&gt; Agba vu ka̱lyuwa̱ ili nda ko vu cuwan ni ili i na yaa fara shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 47:8" />&lt;&lt;Gogo vu uwwa nda, a̱vu za vi icigi vu uyo'o, za na ri nden gbaga, a̱vu na vaa dansaa aciya̱wu, &lt;A̱mu ɗa, waru babu za ro lo she a̱mu, moo o'wo ma̱runa̱ shi ko gba mawun ma̱a̱ kuwa̱ mu shi.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 47:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 47:9" />Agba ili i nda ra i ta cina wu gbagbalu, urana u ta̱: tsukwa̱ tsa̱ muwun na̱ tsuruna̱. A ta cina wu vere, suru na̱ a̱bunda̱ o oboci a̱ wu nu ucira u yindi ya̱ wu suru. <verse eid="ISA 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 47:10" />&lt;&lt;Vu zuwa ta̱ ucira e iwuya ya̱ wu a̱vu vu damma, &lt;Ko vuma e inda mu shi.&gt; Ugbozu wa̱ wu nu urevu wa̱ wu u pusa̱n wu ta̱ a̱vu vu damma o okolo a̱ wu, &lt;A̱mu ɗa, waru ko za ro lo shi she a̱mu.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 47:11" />A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ wu, agba vee reve cine vaa takatsuwa yi shi. A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a̱ ta̱ riya̱a̱ wu a na vaa gura takatsuwato na atsupu shi. A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a na vaa gura cinkaya shi a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ wu gbagbalu. <verse eid="ISA 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 47:12" />Lyuwa elime na̱ tsuboci tsa̱ wu na̱ yindi ya̱ a̱bunda̱ ya̱ wu, aza a na vaa yuwusan diga a̱vu wa'a. U ta yuwan vu gura lyuwa aci ko gba vu gura ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ wovon. <verse eid="ISA 47:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 47:13" />Vu ta̱ka̱lyuwa̱ ta̱ na̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱ a̱sa̱la̱ a na aa casu wu! Lyawa aza a na e revei mmalu mi italyo'o ma̱ wu a rawa zuzu a kamba wu, aza a na a̱ tsu ka̱lyuwusa̱ italyo'o, aza a na a tsu dansa ili i na yaa fara woto woto. Lyawa le a wawa wu e ili i na yaa cina wu. <verse eid="ISA 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 47:14" />Amayun, ele tsa̱ tsu'yuwa̱ tsa ɗa a̱ ri, akina a̱ ta̱ kula̱to le. Aa gura wawa aciyele e ekere o ucira we elentsu a akina'a shi. Va̱a̱ tsura̱ ikambi ya̱'a̱ le shi ko ke'en, agba uba̱ta̱ wa akina a na a̱a̱ da̱nu zuzu na̱ a̱yi ɗa shi. <verse eid="ISA 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 47:15" />A̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa ili i na aa yuwaan wu, aza a na vu yuwain tsugbashi ne ele aza a na vu da̱na̱i a mmalu ne ele a̱vu wa'a. E te bete'we za suru reme ure wa̱ yi, ko vuma ta̱ aa gura wawa wu shi.<verse eid="ISA 47:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="ISA 48" />
  <para style="s">Isra'ila va aciyogbamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 48:1" />&lt;&lt;Uwwai nda, u'wa wa Yakubu, a̱ɗu na e ɗesu na ala a Isra'ila a̱ɗu na yu uta̱i o ugundo wa Yahuza. A̱ɗu na i tarai akucunu na ala a̱ A̱sulazuva yee ɗesu A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila, agba a̱tsuma̱ a amayun ko na̱ a̱ɓula̱ shi. <verse eid="ISA 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 48:2" />A̱ɗu na yee ɗesu aciya̱ɗu ama a̱ lyuci va akiza a̱ɗu na yaa zuwusaa ala a̱ A̱sula̱ a Isra'ila ucira. A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a ɗa ala a̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 48:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 48:3" />N yuwan ta̱ adanshi e ili i na i ka̱ra̱i ɗe, ɗe nu ujumu. Una̱ u va̱ u ɗa u damma nle reve n revetyo le, reve n yuwushin nle go'o, a̱vu gba a shiwan. <verse eid="ISA 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 48:4" />Adama a na n reve ta̱ cine i ri na aciyogbamu, yinlu i ɗu tsa aruva a̱ rumu ɗa, icin i ɗu tsa̱ rumushili. <verse eid="ISA 48:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 48:5" />A̱yi ɗa i zuwai n damma nuwu ili i nda ɗe nu ujumu. Kafu a fara n damma nɗu ele adama she vu ta̱wa̱ vu damma, &lt;A̱ma̱li a̱ va̱ a ɗa a yuwan nle wan, ushe'en wa akpata a̱ va̱ na̱ ruma na n zuɗa̱i ele ɗa a yuwan nle wan.&gt; <verse eid="ISA 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 48:6" />Yu uwwa ta̱ ili i nda, ka̱lyuwa̱ nle suru. Ya̱a̱ usu a fara ta̱ shi? Diga gogo a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ n ta damma ɗu ili i sa'avu e ili yu usokowu i na i reve ne ele shi. <verse eid="ISA 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 48:7" />Gogo ɗa a yuwan nle, ɗe nu ujumu u ɗa shi. Kafu ana'an koto shi yu uwwa aɗa e le shi, adama o ndolo yaa damma, &lt;Amayun n reve ta̱ ne ele shi.&gt; <verse eid="ISA 48:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 48:8" />Koto vu uwwa ko vu reve, diga o ufaru atsuvu a̱ wu a̱ shi ukpa̱tu'u ne'en shi. Adama a na n reve ta̱ cine vu ri za vi ikpa'a. A̱ ta̱ ɗesu wu za va aciyogbamu diga o umatsun wa̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 48:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 48:9" />Adama a ala a̱ va̱ n ta̱ rutsusa̱ upan u va̱, adama e ica i va̱ i ɗa m putsa niyi a rawa wu, adama n tawa wu wan. <verse eid="ISA 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 48:10" />Uwwai nda, n lapula wu ta̱, agba tsa azurufa tsa ɗa shi, n lyungwa̱ wu ta̱ na akina a̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱. <verse eid="ISA 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 48:11" />Adama a̱ va̱, adama a̱ va̱, n yuwain ili i nda. Cine maa lyawa tsugbain tsa̱ va̱ vama? Maa ca nanza tsugbain tsa̱ va̱ shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isra'ila o'wo ta̱ fa̱a̱n</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 48:12" />&lt;&lt;Uwwa mu a̱ɗu u'wa wa Yakubu, Isra'ila za na n ɗeyi! A̱mu ɗa a̱yi. A̱mu ɗa za vu ufaru a̱mu ɗa za vu ukosu. <verse eid="ISA 48:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 48:13" />Ukere u va̱ u ɗa u varai ikyun yu uvaɗi, ukere u sa'ani u va̱ u ɗa wu ba̱ruwa̱i zuva, a mantsa ma na n ɗe nle suru o tsu ɓoloto ta̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 48:14" />&lt;&lt;Ɓolotoi, suru nɗu, a̱vu yu uwwa. Zane ɗa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ma̱li dammai ɗe ili i nda? Za na A̱sulazuva a ɗangwai a̱yi ɗa waa yuwan ifoɓi ya̱ yi e ekere a Babila. Ukere wa̱ yi u ta̱ da̱na̱ a̱ nla̱ngi na aza a Kaldiya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">48:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kaldiya aala o ro a ɗa a Babila</char></note> <verse eid="ISA 48:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 48:15" />A̱mu, a̱mu na aciya̱va̱ ɗa n yuwain adanshi. A̱vu n ɗe yi a̱vu n ta̱wa̱ na̱ a̱yi, waru u ta lyuwa aci e ili i na u cigai u yuwan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 48:16" />Rawai zuzu na̱ a̱mu yu uwwa nda, &lt;&lt;Diga o ufaru koto n yuwan adanshi usokowu shi. Diga a mantsa ma na u farai n ta̱ lo.&gt;&gt; Waru gogo A̱sulazuva Zagbain a̱ lyungu mu ta̱, na̱ Ruhu va̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 48:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 48:17" />Apa nda ili i na A̱sulazuva Za va Atsupu va̱ wu, Za va Akiza a Isra'ila a dammai, &lt;&lt;A̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ wu, za na oo rocosu wu ili i na i la'aa nuwu ulobonu, za na o rocosu wu ure u na va̱a̱ kuru. <verse eid="ISA 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 48:18" />Na̱ a̱ shi a damma vu polo ta̱ atsuvu e ili i na n zuwai, asuvu nden ma̱ wu n shi to o'wo tsu uɗolu, a̱ɓula̱ a̱ wu waru tsi ikeɗu i mala. <verse eid="ISA 48:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 48:19" />Ugundo wa̱ wu u shi ta̱ a̱ da̱na̱ she damma wuyun, muwun ma̱ wu she damma ma̱bula̱ ma na ma̱ ri n kece shi, ala e le a̱ ri n koɗo shi ko o kototo le e ekere a̱ va̱ shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 48:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 48:20" />Uta̱i a̱tsuma̱ a Babila, jika̱i i lyawa Kaldiya! Dammai ili i nda nu uɗyo u ma̱za̱nga̱ lon, i revetyo aɗa a̱ yi. I rawato yi hali ukosu wu uvaɗi. Dammai, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a tsupaa ta̱ aagbashi a̱ yi Yakubu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 48:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 48:21" />A mantsa ma na u kuruyi ne ele na̱ a̱tsumona a uwwa akuli shi. U zuwa ta̱ mini mo uta̱ a aatali adama e le. U ɓatsa ta̱ aatali a̱vu mini mo uta̱. <verse eid="ISA 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 48:22" />A̱sulazuva a damma, &lt;&lt;Za vi iwuya a̱a̱ da̱na̱ na asuvu nden shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="ISA 49" />
  <para style="s">Aagbashi a̱ A̱sulazuva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 49:1" />Uwwa numu a̱ɗu nɗa m memere ma̱ mini, poloi atsuvu a̱ɗu nɗa ma alanga. A̱sulazuva e ɗe mu ta̱ kafu a matsan mu a̱vu u ca mu aala a̱mu pe ubuwu a̱ a̱a̱tsuma̱ a mma va̱. <verse eid="ISA 49:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 49:2" />U zuwa ta̱ una̱ u va̱ wali tsa matsun me pe'eni, u soko mu ta̱ o ululu wu ukere wa̱ yi. U yuwan mu ta̱ tsu liya na o foɓoi, a̱vu u soko mu a̱tsuma̱ o ujin wa̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 49:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 49:3" />A̱vu u damma mu, &lt;&lt;A̱vu aagbashi a̱ va̱ a ɗa, Isra'ila. E ekere a̱ wu a ɗa ma̱a̱ tsura̱ tsugbain.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 49:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 49:4" />Agba a̱vu n damma, &lt;&lt;N yuwan ta̱ tsugbashi tse pere, n lungusa̱ ta̱ ucira u va̱ pere waru ko ili. Agba suru na̱ ne ili i na yi ntsaa numu u te e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva, atsupu a̱ va̱ waru a̱ ta̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 49:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 49:5" />Reve gba gogo A̱sulazuva a damma, a̱yi za na yuwan numu pe a̱ a̱a̱tsuma̱ moo o'wo aagbashi a̱ yi adama n ka̱mbuwa̱ Yakubu uba̱ta̱ wa̱ yi a̱vu m ɓoloto Isra'ila ya̱'a̱ yi, n tsura̱ ta̱ tsugbain e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva waru A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱ ɗa ucira u va̱, <verse eid="ISA 49:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 49:6" />u damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Ili i ke'en i ɗa vo o'wo aagbashi a̱ va̱ adama vu ka̱mbuwa̱ gundo va Yakubu waru vu ka̱mbuwa̱ aza a Isra'ila a na n geshei. Waru n ta zuwa vo o'wo ekan e ekere a nɗa, adama vu rawato iwawi i va̱ a̱ tyo o ukosu wu uvaɗi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 49:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 49:7" />Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva Za va Atsupu na̱ Za va Akiza a Isra'ila a dammai, a̱ tyo ya̱'a̱ yi za na nɗa n tarai ili i ro shi waru a 'yuwan niyi, aagbashi a aza a tsugbain: &lt;&lt;Ngono n te ene wu a̱vu a̱ 'yon, muwun mu ngono n te ene wu a̱vu a̱ ka̱ɗa̱to, adama a̱ A̱sulazuva, za va̱ a̱ɓula̱, Za va Akiza a Isra'ila, za na ɗangwa nuwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱ ka̱mba̱to ta̱ Isra'ila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 49:8" />Apa nda ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, &lt;&lt;A mantsa me isa'ani ma̱ va̱ n ta̱ usu wu, waru a mantsa me iwawi n ta kamba wu, n ta̱ guza̱ wu a̱vu n zuwa wu vo o'wo akucunu e ekere a ama. Vu ka̱mbuwa̱ iɗa'a waru vu ka̱mbuwisa̱a̱ ama agadu e le a na o o'woi okongo. <verse eid="ISA 49:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 49:9" />A damma aza na a̱ ri o u'wa wa ali, &lt;Uta̱i,&gt; aza a na waru a̱ ri a̱tsuma̱ e irumbu, &lt;O'woi fa̱a̱n!&gt; A ta lyuwa a̱ nge'en mu ure a̱vu a̱ tsura̱ uba̱ta̱ wa alyuna a aagaɗi a na a̱ ri nu wunlya shi. <verse eid="ISA 49:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 49:10" />Aa uwwa ambulu ko akuli shi, ko upepu wu usuɗuwu ko urana u lapa le shi. A̱yi za na e inda iliyali i le u to rono le aɗanga, a̱vu u kuru ne ele a̱ tyo e esu a̱ mini. <verse eid="ISA 49:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 49:11" />N ta̱ ka̱mba̱to nsasan n va̱ suru re, a̱vu waru n lapula re gbain va̱. <verse eid="ISA 49:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 49:12" />Uwwai nda, a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ diga alanga, ozo o ro diga ugana, ozo o ro a̱livu, ozo o ro diga upasu wu uyagi wa Masar.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 49:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 49:13" />Canai ishipa yi ica, a̱ɗu zuva, a̱vu i za̱nga̱na̱ a̱ɗu uvaɗi, ɓosoi ni ishipa, a̱ɗu nsasan! Adama a na A̱sulazuva a ta casu ama a̱ yi asuvu nden waru u te ene iliyali ya ama a̱ yi na a̱ ri a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱. <verse eid="ISA 49:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 49:14" />Agba Sihiyona damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a vari mu ta̱, Zagbain icina ta̱ na̱ a̱mu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 49:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 49:15" />&lt;&lt;Ka ta gura icina na̱ ba̱ba̱ va̱ yi na waa casu maani na wa̱a̱ kuɗa̱ ene iliyali i mawun ma na u matsain? Ko nu u shi aa gura icina, a̱mu maa gura icina na̱ a̱ɗu shi! <verse eid="ISA 49:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 49:16" />Uwwai nda, n she'en ta̱ aala a̱ wu a aapata o ukere u va̱, ɓaɓu va̱ wu ta̱ da̱na̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ va̱ kuci. <verse eid="ISA 49:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 49:17" />Muwun ma̱ wu n ta̱ jika̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱, aza a na oo kototosu wu a ta kasa na̱ a̱vu. <verse eid="ISA 49:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 49:18" />'Ya̱sa̱n esu a̱ wu vu ka̱lyuwa̱ a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱, muwun ma̱ wu suru m ɓoloto ta̱ a̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱ ya̱'a̱ wu. N kucina ta̱ na̱ wuma u va̱,&gt;&gt; A̱sulazuva a dammai, &lt;&lt;vu to oto le tsi itana i tsulolobo. Vu ta̱ nla̱ le tsa kasa'avu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 49:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 49:19" />&lt;&lt;O una̱ wo okongo a̱ wu na̱ ba̱ta̱ na a̱ lungusa̱i ni iɗa ya̱ wu i na yo o'woi ofoli, gogo vu ta̱ ka̱la̱ma̱ lon adama a̱ a̱bunda̱ a ama, waru aza a na a̱ shi o soɗu nuwu a ta yuwan alanga na̱ a̱vu. <verse eid="ISA 49:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 49:20" />Muwun n na a matsain mantsa ma̱ nden ma̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu ma̱ wu a̱ ta̱ gba a damma a atsuvu a̱ wu, &lt;Uba̱ta̱ u nda u ka̱la̱ma̱ tsu ta̱ lon, da̱shi ntsu uba̱ta̱ wu nden.&gt; <verse eid="ISA 49:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 49:21" />Reve vu damma a̱tsuma̱ o okolo a̱ wu, &lt;Zane matsaan numu ele? A mantsa ma na n shi a̱ nden ma̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu idari, a̱ shi ta̱ a̱ gba̱ra̱ mu a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ ugana a̱vu a 'yuwan mu. Zane ɗa kungwaton nle? A̱ shi ta̱ a lyawa mu a̱ nde'en, agba ele nda, te ɗa o uta̱i?&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 49:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 49:22" />Apa nda ili i na A̱sulazuva Zagbain a dammai, &lt;&lt;Uwwai nda, n ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱n ukere u va e ekere a nɗa, waru n ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱n atuta a̱ va̱ iroci e ekere a ama. A̱ ta̱ gba a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ no olobo a̱ ɗu a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n me le, a̱vu a tanu esheli a̱ ɗu a̱ nlungu n le. <verse eid="ISA 49:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 49:23" />Ngono n ta̱ ka̱lyuwa̱ muwun n ɗu, nan egbere a ɗa a̱a̱ guza̱ le. A̱ ta̱ ka̱ɗa̱ta̱wa̱ ɗu nu urewesu u le e iɗa. Reve e peɗe ma̱buta̱ ma ana ma̱ wu. Ɗaɗa yee reve a na a̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva, aza a na a zuwaa numu ucira a uwwa wono shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 49:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 49:24" />A ta gura usa za na gurai uvon ili i na u pura̱i diga uba̱ta̱ wu uvon, ko a wawa aza a na e remei uba̱ta̱ wu uvon e ekere a za na ri usuɗuwu? <verse eid="ISA 49:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 49:25" />Amma apa ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, &lt;&lt;Ee aza a na e remei uba̱ta̱ wu uvon a ta usa le e ekere a za na gurai uvon. Ili i na a̱ pura̱i uba̱ta̱ wu uvon a ta wawa le e ekere a za na ri usuɗuwu. N ta yuwan nla̱ngi na aza a na a yuwusan nla̱ngi na̱ a̱vu, a̱vu n wawa muwun ma̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 49:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 49:26" />N ta zuwa aza a na o ɓongishi wu a tama inama i lipu le. Reve o o'wo usowu na̱ mpasa n le cine ama a̱ tsu da̱na̱ usowu na̱ ma̱ra̱. Ɗaɗa vaɗilima̱ suru vee reve a na a̱mu A̱sulazuva a̱mu ɗa Iwawi ya̱ wu, za na Tsupaa nuwu na̱ Za vu Ucira va Yakubu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 49:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="ISA 50" />
  <para style="s">Unusu wa Isra'ila na̱ tsutoni tsa aagbashi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 50:1" />Apa nda ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai: &lt;&lt;Te ɗa aatagada a wukasu u lolo wa mma va̱ wu za na m gba̱ra̱a̱ niyi? Ko zane oo tono mu utan u ɗa n winaa niyi a̱ɗu? Adama o unusu u ɗa a wina nɗu, waru adama e iwuya i ɗu i ɗa a̱ gba̱ra̱i mma ɗu. <verse eid="ISA 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 50:2" />Adama a̱ nye a mantsa ma na n ta̱wa̱i ko za shi lo shi? A mantsa ma na n ɗeyi, nye i zuwai ko za shi lo na wa̱a̱ usu shi? Ukere u va̱ u ta̱ mokoɗi na maa gura tsupa shi ko n ri nu ucira u na maa gura wawa shi? Uwwai nda, na̱ tsuɓari tsa̱ va̱ tsa ɗa mu ukwatoin mala, n ka̱mba̱to ta̱ ɗolu a̱tsumona, mugula n le n shama ta̱ o ulambu u mini reve a̱ kuwa̱ na akuli. <verse eid="ISA 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 50:3" />N yuwaan ta̱ zuva amuna ni irumbu a̱vu n ka̱mbuwa̱ akashamuna aapalutsu a̱ yi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 50:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 50:4" />A̱sulazuva Zagbain ca mu ta̱ eelentsu a aza a na o ritoi, adama n reve idanshi i na maa gbamato aza a na a̱ ri ukunu. U tsu 'ya̱sa̱n mu ta̱ usana biti, u tsu 'ya̱sa̱n ta̱ atsuvu a̱ va̱ adama mu uwwa tso oojoro. <verse eid="ISA 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 50:5" />A̱sulazuva Zagbain u kpa̱tu'wa̱ ta̱ atsuvu a̱ va̱, agba n yuwaan yi aciyogbamu shi, waru n rono na̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ shi. <verse eid="ISA 50:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 50:6" />N ca ta̱ aza a na a̱a̱ ru'wusa̱ mu ucina̱, agbaguzu a̱ va̱ waru aza a na oo ronuso ntsuka̱ n va̱. N sokowo wisulusa na̱ a̱za̱ o ucuwusa̱n u ma̱tsa̱n urewesu u va̱ shi. <verse eid="ISA 50:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 50:7" />Adama a na A̱sulazuva Zagbain ta kambusa mu, a ca mu wono shi. A̱yi ɗa i zuwai n zuwai urewesu u va̱ tsa aatali o ucira, agba n reve ta̱ maa uwwa wono shi. <verse eid="ISA 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 50:8" />A̱yi za na a dansa n ri nu unusu shi u ta̱ zuzu. Zane ɗa gba aa gura ta̱wa̱ na adanshi a aci a̱ va̱? Lyawa tsi isawan tsu ka̱lyuwula̱i! Zane ɗa za mawasan na̱ a̱mu? Lyawa u rawa zuzu na̱ a̱mu! <verse eid="ISA 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 50:9" />Uwwai nda, A̱sulazuva Zagbain u ta kambusa mu. Zane ɗa aa damma n ta̱ nu unusu? Suru nle o to kporo she damma utugu, azun a ɗa aa tama le. <verse eid="ISA 50:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 50:10" />Zane ɗa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu aa uwwusa wovon wa̱ A̱sulazuva waru waa yuwusan tsutoni na adanshi a aagbashi a̱ yi? Lyawa a̱yi za na ri a mmalu a̱tsuma̱ e irumbu u ri ne ekan shi, u zuwaa ala a̱ A̱sulazuva ucira a̱vu u zuwaa A̱sula̱ a̱ yi okolo. <verse eid="ISA 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 50:11" />Agba a̱ɗu na yaa daɓusa akina, yaa foɓusoo aciya̱ɗu ekan a akata, walai a̱tsuma̱ e ekan a akina a̱ ɗu na̱ za va akata a na i daɓai. Apa nda ili i na ya̱a̱ tsura̱ uba̱ta̱ u va̱, i to von a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱.<verse eid="ISA 50:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="ISA 51" />
  <para style="s">Iwawi i babu ukotu wa̱ Sihiyona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 51:1" />&lt;&lt;Poloo numu atsuvu, a̱ɗu aza na a zama a̱ɓula̱ waru a zama A̱sulazuva: Yuwain majiyan ma aatali uba̱ta̱ u na yu uta̱i, na̱ a̱a̱ka̱ri a aatali a na a̱ ka̱pa̱ nɗu. <verse eid="ISA 51:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 51:2" />Yuwain majiyan Ibrahim akaya a̱ ɗu, na̱ Saratu za na matsan nɗu. Adama a na a mantsa ma na n ɗe niyi a̱yi ɗa u da̱na̱i a̱ nde'en, reve n zuwaa yi aba'un reve n zuwa yi u bala. <verse eid="ISA 51:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 51:3" />Adama a na A̱sulazuva a ta ca Sihiyona adanshi, u te ene iliyali yo okongo a̱ yi suru. Waru u ta̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ a̱tsumona a̱ yi tsa Adini, iɗa yu u'yewu ya̱ yi tsa̱ a̱a̱rumbu a̱ A̱sulazuva. A̱ ta̱ tsura̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ na̱ mere a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi, ugodyusho nu uɗyo wi ishipa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 51:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 51:4" />&lt;&lt;Poloo numu atsuvu, ama a̱ va̱, yu uwwa mu a̱vu iɗa i va̱, adama a na wila̱ u ta̱ o uta̱ diga̱ ya̱'a̱ va̱, waru amayun a̱ va̱ o to o'wo ekan uba̱ta̱ wa ama. <verse eid="ISA 51:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 51:5" />A̱ɓula̱ a̱ va̱ a ta rawa zuzu ni ilaɗi, iwawi i va̱ i ta̱ lo a̱ ta̱wa̱, waru ukere u va̱ u ta yuwaan ama uge'etosu. Nɗa m memere ma̱ mini n ta puro ya̱'a̱ va̱ waru o to puro n yuwan uge'etosu nu ukere wu ucira a̱ va̱. <verse eid="ISA 51:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 51:6" />'Ya̱sa̱in esu a̱ ɗu zuva, waru i ka̱lyuwa̱ iɗa za̱la̱, zuva ta̱ puwa̱n tsa̱ mikyon, waru iɗa i to kporo tsu utugu, waru aza a na a̱ ri pe na̱ nden a̱ ta̱ kuwa̱ ne. Amma iwawi i va̱ i ta̱ da̱na̱ lo babu ukotu, waru a̱ɓula̱ a̱ va̱ a̱a̱ kuɗa̱ shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 51:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 51:7" />&lt;&lt;Poloo numu atsuvu, a̱ɗu aza a na e revei a̱ɓula̱, a̱ɗu ama a na a ɓanai wila̱ u va̱ o okolo, she yu uwwa wovon wu ucasu u wono wu vaɗilima̱ wan ko yi da'wan adama a wisulusa u le wan. <verse eid="ISA 51:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 51:8" />Adama a na nfirikici n ta tama le tsu utugu, waru aran a ta tama le cine a tsu tama itana i na a yuwain na̱ tsikilu. Amma a̱ɓula̱ a̱ va̱ a̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ lo babu ukotu, waru iwawi i va̱ mantsa suru.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 51:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 51:9" />Jiwan jiwan! Vu roco ucira wa̱ wu adama vu wawa tsu, A̱sulazuva. Jiwan, tsa rana na ka̱ra̱i, tsa mantsa ma na ma̱ ka̱ra̱i. A̱vu ɗa za na kukoɗoi Rahapu mukoɗi mukoɗi shi, za na kukoɗoi ididi'i a̱ mini mukoɗi mukoɗi shi? <verse eid="ISA 51:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 51:10" />A̱vu ɗa za na 'yewotoi mala shi, mini ma̱ a̱ru'un lon, za na ka̱mbuwa̱i mala ure adama aza a na vu tsupayi a pasa shi? <verse eid="ISA 51:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 51:11" />Aza a na A̱sulazuva a tsupayi a̱ ta̱ ka̱mba̱. A ta uwa Sihiyona ni ishipa, o to o'wo na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ ma babu ukoto. A̱ ta̱ tsura̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ na̱ mere, mɓa̱la̱ na̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu o to koto. <verse eid="ISA 51:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 51:12" />&lt;&lt;A̱mu ɗa za na a̱a̱ ta̱na̱to wu asuvu. Nye i zuwai vaa uwwusa wovon wu vaɗilima̱ na a̱a̱ kuwa̱, mawun ma vuma za na a yuwain tsa wunlya, <verse eid="ISA 51:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 51:13" />waru vi icinai na̱ A̱sulazuva za na yuwan nuwu, za na buba̱ruwa̱i zuva waru u yuwain ikyun yu uvaɗi. Waru vaa uwwusa wovon urana suru adama o upan wu za vi iɓongi, mantsa ma na u foɓoi aciya̱yi adama o ukotosu? Waru te ɗa upan wu za vi iɓongi? <verse eid="ISA 51:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 51:14" />Aza a na a̱ ri uka̱ɗa̱ta̱wu aa jima shi a ta lyawa le. Waru a̱a̱ kuwa̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ka̱ri u'wa wa ali shi, ko a lamba ilyalya i na a cigai shi. <verse eid="ISA 51:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 51:15" />A̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ wu, za na 'ya̱sa̱in mala hali ikeɗu i mini i yuwan ilama lon, A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a ɗa ala a̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 51:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 51:16" />Waru n zuwa ta̱ adanshi a̱ va̱ o una̱ wa̱ wu, waru m pala wu ta̱ nu ululu wu ukere u va̱. A̱mu za na buba̱ruwa̱i zuva waru n varai ikyun yu uvaɗi, a dansa Sihiyona, &lt;A̱ɗu ɗa ama a̱ va̱.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mokkoto mo upan wa̱ A̱sulazuva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 51:17" />Jiwan, Jiwan, vu 'yon mishin, a̱vu Urishelima. A̱vu na vu sowoi diga o ukere wa̱ A̱sulazuva mokkoto mo upan wa̱ yi, vu sowo niyi suru reve u zuwa wu vo o'wo a takalyuwusa. <verse eid="ISA 51:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 51:18" />Babu za na oo roco yi ure a̱tsuma̱ o olobo a na u matsain suru, a̱tsuma̱ o olobo a na u kungwatoi suru babu za na aa ɓana ukere wa̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 51:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 51:19" />Ili i re i nda a cina wu ta̱, zane ɗa aa ca wu adanshi? Ulungusu ko ukototosu ko ambulu ko uvon, zane ɗa aa ca wu adanshi? <verse eid="ISA 51:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 51:20" />Olobo a̱ wu a̱ lima̱ ta̱, o von ta̱ o ukosu wu ure suru tsa̱ nre'on n na igolo i remei. A̱sulazuva a̱ tsuwa̱n le ta̱ upan wa̱ yi na̱ tsuɓari tsa̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 51:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 51:21" />Adama o ndolo uwwai ili i nda, a̱ɗu aza a na oo sowuso a̱tsuma̱lima̱, a̱ɗu na i sowoi, agba na̱ masayan ma ɗa shi. <verse eid="ISA 51:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 51:22" />Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva Zagbain A̱sula̱ a̱ wu, za na ee gesheshe ama a̱ yi a dammai: &lt;&lt;Uwwai nda, n ushiyi mokkoto mo utakalyusa diga o ukere wa̱ wu, va̱a̱ da̱shi sowo o mokkoto mo upan ma̱ va̱ shi. <verse eid="ISA 51:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 51:23" />N ta zuwa yi e ekere a aza a na aa casu ɗu a̱tsuma̱lima̱, aza a na a damma nuwu, &lt;Von ma̱kpa̱ɓa̱ adama tsu wala zuva va̱ wu.&gt; Waru vu ka̱mbuwa̱ ta̱ ucina̱ wa̱ wu tsi iɗa, tsu ure u na aa yuwan mmalu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 51:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="ISA 52" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 52:1" />Jiwan, jiwan, a̱vu Sihiyona, vu pupala aciya̱wu nu ucira. Vo oto itana i sa'ani ya̱ wu, a̱vu Urishelima lyuci gbain va akiza. Aza a na koto a paɗai uryumbu shi na̱ a̱za̱ e idaba a̱a̱ da̱shi uwa a̱ na̱ntsu va̱ wu shi. <verse eid="ISA 52:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 52:2" />Ka̱pa̱tsa̱ aciya̱wu ma̱buta̱, reve vu 'yon mishin. Vu da̱nu o ootogu o tsugono, a̱vu Urishelima. Ba̱ɗa̱ akani a̱ yinlu ya̱ wu, a̱vu Sihiyona na e remei.<verse eid="ISA 52:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 52:3" />Adama a na apa ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai: &lt;&lt;A wina ɗu ta̱ pere ko ili shi, ne ɗa waru aa tsupaa ɗu ni ikebe shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 52:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 52:4" />Adama a na A̱sulazuva Zagbain a damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Nu ufaru ama a̱ va̱ a̱ zura̱ ta̱ a̱ tyo Masar adama a yuwan ɗe nden n tsumocin. Na̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ reve aza a Asuriya o ɓongi le.<verse eid="ISA 52:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 52:5" />&lt;&lt;Waru gogo nye i ɗa maa yuwusan pa?&gt;&gt; A̱sulazuva a ɗa a dammai, &lt;&lt;Adama a na a̱ ta̱ purusa̱ ama a̱ va̱ pere, waru aza a na a̱ ri o tsugono tse le a ta yuwusaan le yorori ya afalu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">52:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ozo o tsugono tse le a na a yuwusaan afalu'u aza a Babila a ɗa aza a na a̱ pura̱ nle</char></note>,&gt;&gt; A̱sulazuva a ɗa a dammai ne, &lt;&lt;Waru usana suru a tara ala a̱ va̱ ili i ro shi. <verse eid="ISA 52:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 52:6" />Adama o ndolo ama a̱ va̱ e te reve ala a̱ va̱, a̱vu o urana u ndolo ee reve a na a̱mu ɗa n yuwain adanshi. Amayun a̱mu ɗaɗa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 52:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 52:7" />Ili i ma̱za̱nga̱ i ɗa lon na̱ za na a̱a̱ ta̱wusa̱ na alabari a sa'ani a̱ ri a mmalu zuva masasan, za na ta̱wa̱i na̱ nden ma asuvu, na alabari a sa'ani a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱, za na ta̱wa̱i ni iwawi. Za na tsu dansaa Sihiyona, &lt;&lt;A̱sula̱ a̱ wu a ɗa a̱ ri o tsugono!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 52:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 52:8" />Zuwai atsuvu, a̱za̱ e ipiri a̱ ɗu a̱ ta̱ 'ya̱susa̱n ɗyo le, a ta canasa ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱ oɓolo, adama a na ne esu e le a ɗa ee ene uka̱mbu wa̱ A̱sulazuva Sihiyona. <verse eid="ISA 52:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 52:9" />Ɓosoi ni ishipa i ma̱za̱nga̱ oɓolo, a̱ɗu pasu va̱ Urishelima na a̱ lungusa̱i, adama a na A̱sulazuva a ca ta̱ ama a̱ yi adanshi, u tsupaa ta̱ Urishelima. <verse eid="ISA 52:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 52:10" />A̱sulazuva a ta canana ukere wa akiza wa̱ yi o urewesu wa ama suru, waru ukosu wu uvaɗi suru e te ene iwawi ya̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu. <verse eid="ISA 52:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 52:11" />Uta̱i, uta̱i, uta̱i ɗe! She i ju'wa̱n ili yi idaba wan. Uta̱i e memere ma̱ yi, i ka̱mba̱to aciya̱ɗu cece, a̱ɗu aza a na yaa tanusu itana ya̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="ISA 52:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 52:12" />Amma ya̱a̱ jika̱ o uta̱ shi, waru yoo uta̱ ni ilaɗi shi, adama a na A̱sulazuva a ta uwa elime a̱ ɗu, A̱sula̱ a aza a Isra'ila o to o'wo za vi ipiri a̱ca̱pa̱ a̱ ɗu.<verse eid="ISA 52:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱tsuma̱lima̱ na̱ tsugbain tsa aagbashi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 52:13" />Uwwai nda, aagbashi a̱ va̱ a ta yuwan ili nu ugbozu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">52:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">uvadalusa u ro u damma ta̱ &lt;&lt;u lyuwa elime&gt;&gt;</char></note> A ta cuwa yi, a tara yi na̱ tsugbain waru a ta ca yi tsugbain lon. <verse eid="ISA 52:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 52:14" />Ama na̱ a̱bunda̱ a da'wan ta̱ adama a̱ yi, cine a̱ lyungusa̱i lipu va̱ yi hali wo o'wo tso oroci a vuma shi. <verse eid="ISA 52:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 52:15" />Ne ɗa woo kyo'onu nɗa na̱ a̱bunda̱, ngono n te keɗe na̱ le adama a̱ yi. Adama a na e te ene ili i na koto a damma nle shi, waru e te reve ili i na koto a uwwai shi.<verse eid="ISA 52:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 52" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="ISA 53" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 53:1" />Zane ɗa usuyi ikaka i tsu? Waru zane ɗa o rocoi ukere wa̱ A̱sulazuva? <verse eid="ISA 53:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 53:2" />U kungwa ta̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi tso ototopi, tsa aaralu a na o uta̱i e iɗa yu u'yewu. U ri nu uruma ko ulobonu u na tsa̱a̱ ka̱lyuwa̱ yi shi, u ri no oroci a maluwa ma na tsaa ciga yi shi. <verse eid="ISA 53:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 53:3" />A tara yi ili i ro shi waru ama a 'yuwan yi ta̱, vuma na ri tapu na̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu, waru a̱tsuma̱lima̱ o o'wo niyi lipu. Tsa vuma na ama a tawai esu e le a tara yi ili i ro shi, a̱tsu waru tsu ka̱mbuwa̱ yi ili i ro shi. <verse eid="ISA 53:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 53:4" />Suru na̱ ne u tara ta̱ banakun tsu, reve waru u tanu a̱tsumola̱ngu a̱ tsu, reve tsu jiyan a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a̱ yi uge'etosu u ɗa, waru a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a̱ yi uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱ a ɗa wu uta̱i. <verse eid="ISA 53:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 53:5" />Amma a sapa yi ta̱ adama o unusu u tsu, a amaton yi ta̱ adama e iwuya i tsu. A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a na a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ ntsu na̱ nden ma asuvu u ta a aci a̱ yi, waru adama o usa̱n wa̱ yi u ɗa tsu ka̱mba̱i gbaga. <verse eid="ISA 53:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 53:6" />Suru ntsu tsu tsi ikyon i na i puwa̱yin, koyan reme ta̱ ure wa̱ yi, a̱vu A̱sulazuva a̱ tanu yi unusu u tsu suru. <verse eid="ISA 53:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 53:7" />Reve o ɓongi yi waru a ca yi a̱tsuma̱lima̱, suru na̱ ne u damma ili i ro shi. O rono yi ta̱ tso mokyokyon a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u mapaɗa, waru tsu kyon na ri a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma za na oo koɗuso yi eleme ri kpaku, ne ɗa ko una̱ wa̱ yi u kpa̱tu'wa̱ shi. <verse eid="ISA 53:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 53:8" />Adama e iɓongishi nu ulambu wu uge'etosu wa amayun ɗaɗa a̱ ka̱ra̱i na̱ a̱yi. Waru zane ɗa aa yuwan adanshi adama o ugundo wa̱ yi? Adama a na o koɗoi wuma wa̱ yi a̱tsuma̱ o uva̱ɗi, a̱ ga̱la̱ yi ta̱ adama o unusu wa ama a̱ va̱. <verse eid="ISA 53:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 53:9" />A yuwaan yi ta̱ aason oɓolo na̱ a̱za̱ e iwuya, waru na̱ za vu utsuru ɗa u ri pe o ukwa̱ wa̱ yi, ko na wo o'woi u 'ya̱sa̱n ugbozu wu za shi, waru wu luma̱ za shi. <verse eid="ISA 53:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 53:10" />Suru na̱ ne ucigu wa̱ A̱sulazuva a ɗa a amaton yi, waru u zuwa yi ta̱ u sowo a̱tsuma̱lima̱, adama ko na wuma wa̱ yi wo o'woi kucci vu unusu, u te ene gundo va̱ yi. Waru u ta̱ da̱shi rana va̱ yi, a̱vu ucigu wa̱ A̱sulazuva u shiwan e ekere a̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 53:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 53:11" />Mantsa ma na a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a̱ yi o kotoi, u ta̱ da̱shi ene ekan a̱vu u rawa yi, nu urevu wa̱ yi aagbashi a̱ a̱ɓula̱ a̱ va̱ a̱ ta̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ ama na̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱za̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱, waru u ta tara unusu u le. <verse eid="ISA 53:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 53:12" />Adama o ndolo n ta ca yi akunda a̱ yi oɓolo na azagbain. Waru u te ne'eshen itana yu uvon i na a̱ pura̱i oɓolo na̱ a̱za̱ o ucira, adama a na u ca ta̱ wuma wa̱ yi u kuwa̱, e kece yi ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱za̱ o unusu. Adama a na u tara ta̱ unusu wa ama a̱ a̱bunda̱, reve u yuwan ipati adama a̱ a̱za̱ o unusu.<verse eid="ISA 53:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 53" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="ISA 54" />
  <para style="s">Tsugbain tse elime tsa̱ Sihiyona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 54:1" />&lt;&lt;Cana ishipa, a̱vu idari yi ka. Ɓoso ni ishipa na̱ yorori i ma̱za̱nga̱, a̱vu za na koto revei ili i na a̱ tsu ɗe limatan shi. Adama a na muwun mu ka vu ulambu u limatan, a ta yuwan a̱bunda̱ a la'a muwun mu za na ri na̱ vali,&gt;&gt; A̱sulazuva a ɗa a dammai ne. <verse eid="ISA 54:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 54:2" />Da̱shi washin wo oogodo a̱ wu, vu buba̱ruwa̱ umuna wo oogodo a̱ wu washin, she vu ɓana a̱ca̱pa̱ wan. Vu da̱shi ugaɗi wa amunga a̱ wu, waru vu da̱shi gbamato irumu i ma̱shuwa̱ ma̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 54:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 54:3" />Adama a na vu to ɓoso a̱ tyo upasu wu usa'ani nu ugula̱. Waru gundo va̱ wu to o'wo na̱ nɗa, a̱ ta̱ da̱nu a nɗa n na n ri na ama shi. <verse eid="ISA 54:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 54:4" />&lt;&lt;She vu uwwa wovon wan, adama a na vaa uwwa wono shi. She vu uwwa wovon u na oo zo'oso wu wan, adama a na aa ca wu wono shi. Vu te icina na̱ wono wa akungu a̱ wu, waru va̱a̱ da̱shi cuwan na̱ wono wu nden n tsuruna̱ tsa̱ wu shi. <verse eid="ISA 54:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 54:5" />Adama a na Za na Yuwan nuwu a̱yi ɗa vali va̱ wu. A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a ɗa ala a̱ yi, waru Za va Akiza va Isra'ila ɗa Za va Atsupu a̱ wu. A̱yi ɗa a̱ tsu ɗe A̱sula̱ o uvaɗi suru. <verse eid="ISA 54:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 54:6" />Adama a na A̱sulazuva e ɗe wu ta̱ vu ka̱mba̱ tsu ka na a variyi, za na a uwwusa mɓa̱la̱ o okolo a̱ yi, tsu ka na vali va̱ yi 'yuwan niyi a̱yi o usheli,&gt;&gt; A̱sula̱ a̱ wu a ɗa a dammai ne. <verse eid="ISA 54:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 54:7" />&lt;&lt;A mantsa wa'a n vari wu ta̱, amma a̱tsuma̱ e mene me iliyali ya̱ a̱bunda̱ i ɗa ma̱a̱ ka̱mba̱to wu. <verse eid="ISA 54:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 54:8" />A̱tsuma̱ o upan wa̱ a̱bunda̱ n sokowo wu ta̱ urewesu u va̱ mantsa wa'a, amma ni icigi i babu ukotu moo roco wu iliyali,&gt;&gt; A̱sulazuva Za va Atsupu va̱ wu ɗa a dammai. <verse eid="ISA 54:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 54:9" />&lt;&lt;Ya̱'a̱ va̱ a̱yi nda tsu rana va̱ Nuhu ɗa, cine n kucinai a̱a̱ da̱shi soɗu uvaɗi na̱ mini shi. Ne ɗa gogo n kucina̱i ma̱a̱ da̱shi yuwan upan na̱ a̱vu shi, waru maa ɓara wu shi. <verse eid="ISA 54:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 54:10" />Adama a na nsasan n ta gura puwa̱n waru a ta gura tawa agaɗi, amma icigi ya amayun i va̱ yaa gura kakasa na̱ a̱vu shi, waru maa tawa akucunu a̱ nden ma asuvu a̱ va̱ shi,&gt;&gt; A̱sulazuva za na o rocosu wu iliyali a ɗa a dammai ne. <verse eid="ISA 54:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 54:11" />&lt;&lt;A̱vu lyuci gbain na sowoi a̱tsuma̱lima̱, a na wunla̱ nu upepu wa̱a̱ vugula̱sa̱. Waru babu za na aa ca yi adanshi. N ta suwisa wu na atali e ikebe, ikyun ya̱ wu na̱ safaya. <verse eid="ISA 54:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 54:12" />N ta suwa uɓaɓu wa̱ wu na atali e ikebe, na̱ntsu va̱ wu waru na atali e imaɗatsu, waru ɓaɓu va̱ wu suru na atali a sa'ani. <verse eid="ISA 54:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 54:13" />Muwun ma̱ wu suru A̱sulazuva a ɗa oo rito le, waru muwun ma̱ wu n ta̱ da̱na̱ na̱ nden ma asuvu ma amayun. <verse eid="ISA 54:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 54:14" />A̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱ a ɗa vee isawan, vu ta̱ da̱na̱ alanga ni iɓongi, vaa uwwa wovon wi ili i na shi. A ta tawa wu wovon alanga, wa̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ zuzu na̱ a̱vu shi. <verse eid="ISA 54:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 54:15" />Na̱ za ro 'ya̱wa̱a̱ wu na̱ nla̱ngi, a̱mu ɗa n lyungu nle shi. Suru aza a na o ɓolotoi adama a yuwan uvon na̱ a̱vu a̱ ta̱ riya̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 54:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 54:16" />&lt;&lt;Uwwai nda, a̱mu ɗa za na yuwain maruma za na tsu fa̱la̱sa̱ akinkina adama u dala, a̱vu u yuwan itana yu uvon adama o ulinga u le. Waru a̱mu ɗa za na yuwain za vu ulungusu adama u yuwan ulinga u mona. <verse eid="ISA 54:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 54:17" />Babu itana yu uvon i na o foɓoi adama a̱ wu i na yaa lyuwa aci, waru elentsu a na suru a̱ 'yoyin adanshi na̱ a̱vu a̱tsuma̱ o uge'etosu vu ta lyuwa aci a̱ yi. A̱yi ɗa agadu a agbashi a̱ A̱sulazuva, waru uneꞌe u ɗa u matawa mo unusu uba̱ta̱ u va̱,&gt;&gt; A̱sulazuva a ɗa a dammai ne.<verse eid="ISA 54:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 54" />
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="ISA 55" />
  <para style="s">A ta banusu aza a na a̱ ri na akuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 55:1" />&lt;&lt;Suru za na a uwwusa akuli u ta̱wa̱, mpa nda mini. A̱ɗu waru a na i ri ni ikebe shi i ta̱wa̱, i tsula adama i lyuwa. Ta̱wa̱i i tsula masayan na̱ maani babu ikebe waru babu udeyi. <verse eid="ISA 55:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 55:2" />Nye i zuwai yoo unusa ikebe e ili i na i ri ilyalya shi. Waru nye i zuwai yaa yuwusan ulinga adama e ili i na ya̱a̱ cuwa̱ton ɗu shi? Poloo numu atsuvu a̱ ɗu ulobono, waru i lyuwa ili i na i ri ulobonu, waru yu uwwa uyo'o wo okolo a̱ ɗu ni ilyalya i sa'ani. <verse eid="ISA 55:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 55:3" />Poloi atsuvu i ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ u va̱, yu uwwa. Okolo a̱ ɗu a̱ ta̱ tsura̱ wuma. Waru n ta yuwaan ɗu akucunu a babu ukotu, n ta ca ɗu icigi ya amayun i na n yuwayin Da̱wuda. <verse eid="ISA 55:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 55:4" />Uwwai nda, n zuwa yi ta̱ wo o'wo lyusu uba̱ta̱ wa ama, zagbain na̱ yali uba̱ta̱ wa ama. <verse eid="ISA 55:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 55:5" />Uwwa nda, vu ta̱ ɗe nɗa n na vu revei shi. Nɗa n na waru n reve nuwu shi a ta suma a̱ ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ wu, adama a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ wu, Za va Akiza va Isra'ila. Adama a na u ca wu ta̱ tsugbain.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 55:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 55:6" />Zamiyi A̱sulazuva a mantsa ma na a̱a̱ tsura̱ yi, ɗe niyi a̱yi zuzu. <verse eid="ISA 55:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 55:7" />Lyawa za vi iwuya lyawa ure wa̱ yi, za vu ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ waru u lyawa majiyan ma̱ yi. Lyawa u ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱yi waru u ta yuwaan yi gafura. Lyawa u ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu, adama a na u tsu yuwan ta̱ gafura pere. <verse eid="ISA 55:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 55:8" />&lt;&lt;Majiyan ma̱ va̱ ma̱ ri una̱ta̱ na̱ za ɗu shi, re va̱ waru ta̱ ko'o na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ ɗu,&gt;&gt; A̱sulazuva a ɗa a dammai ne. <verse eid="ISA 55:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 55:9" />&lt;&lt;Cine zuva ri alanga ni iɗa, ne ɗa re va̱ ri alanga na̱ re ɗu waru majiyan ma̱ va̱ ko'o na̱ za ɗu. <verse eid="ISA 55:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 55:10" />Adanshi a̱ va̱ tsa atayan ni iro'i i na i tsu cipa̱ diga zuva u re'weto uvaɗi. A tsu zuwa ta̱ icu'un yu uta̱, reve a ca icu'un yi ca̱'a̱n ni ilyalya adama a alya. <verse eid="ISA 55:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 55:11" />Ne ɗa adanshi a na o uta̱i o una̱ u va̱ a̱ ri. Wa̱a̱ ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ u va̱ pere shi, amma u ta shiton ili i na maa jiyasan waru u to shiton ili i na n lyungu niyi u yuwan. <verse eid="ISA 55:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 55:12" />I to uta̱ na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ waru a̱ ta̱ kuru na̱ a̱ɗu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ nden ma asuvu. Nsasan na agaɗi o to ɓoso ni ishipa elime a̱ ɗu, suru ɗanga va atsusa a ta ɓasa ekere. <verse eid="ISA 55:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 55:13" />O una̱ wa awanda ɗanga na a̱ tsu ɗe sida to topo, waru o una̱ u ma̱lyo murtil ta kungwa. Ele nda o to o'wo iroci yu ulinga u na a̱mu A̱sulazuva n yuwain, iroci i na yoo koto ɗa shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 55:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 55" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="ISA 56" />
  <para style="s">Iwawi adama o ozo o ro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 56:1" />Apa nda ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, &lt;&lt;I guza̱ ili i na i ri mejege, a̱vu i yuwan amayun, adama a na aa jima shi iwawi i va̱ i ta rawa waru aa jima shi ili ya̱ a̱ɓula̱ i na n yuwain a̱ to uta̱a̱ yi eteshe. <verse eid="ISA 56:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 56:2" />Za va aba'un a ɗa vuma na aa yuwusan ili i nda, za na guza̱ niyi ugbamu, za na a̱a̱ kurusu urana wa Ashibi waru wa̱a̱ lungususa̱ yi shi. Za na aa putsusa ekere a̱ yi na̱ mayan me iwuya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 56:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 56:3" />She mocin n na ɓoloi aciya̱yi na̱ A̱sulazuva u damma, &lt;&lt;Amayun A̱sulazuva a ta ɓatsuwa mu na ama a̱ yi wan.&gt;&gt; Waru she vali na tsu matsan shi u damma, &lt;&lt;A̱mu ukpori u ɗa wan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 56:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 56:4" />Adama a na apa ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, &lt;&lt;Ali a na a tsu matsan shi aza a na a̱ guza̱i Ashibi a̱ va̱, aza a na a ɗangwai ili i na n cigai, a̱vu a̱ guza̱ akucunu a̱ va̱ ulobonu, <verse eid="ISA 56:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 56:5" />n ta ca le ili yu ucuwusan a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa u va̱ ala a na aa la'a olobo ne esheli. N ta ca le ala a na a̱ ri nu ukosu shi za na a̱a̱ puwa̱n shi. <verse eid="ISA 56:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 56:6" />Waru omocin a na o ɓoloi aciyele na̱ A̱sulazuva na aa yuwaan yi a̱ga̱nda̱, a ciga ala a̱ A̱sulazuva. Waru oo o'wo agbashi a̱ yi, aza a na a̱a̱ guzusa̱ Ashibi agba a̱ lungusa̱ yi shi, reve waru a̱ kuru akucunu a̱ va̱ ulobonu. <verse eid="ISA 56:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 56:7" />Ele ɗa ma̱a̱ ta̱wa̱to a masasan ma akiza ma̱ va̱, a̱vu n ca le ma̱za̱nga̱ o u'wa u va̱ wa avasa. Kucci vu ukula̱tosu le nu ucasu u le o to o'wo ili yu ususu a masa'a ma̱ va̱, adama a na e te ɗe u'wa u va̱ u'wa wa avasa wu nɗa suru.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 56:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 56:8" />A̱sulazuva Zagbain a̱yi na u ɓolotoi aza a Isra'ila a na a̱ pura̱i, a damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;M buwa ta̱ a̱ da̱shi ɓoloto ozo o ro na aza a na m ɓolotoi ɗe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 56:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Azagbain a Isra'ila o ulambu wa̱ a̱ɓula̱</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 56:9" />A̱ɗu inama yu una suru, a̱ɗu inama ya̱ a̱rumbu suru ta̱wa̱i! Ta̱wa̱i i soɗu ama a̱ va̱! <verse eid="ISA 56:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 56:10" />A̱za̱ e ipiri a Isra'ila nrumba̱ n ɗa, suru nle a̱ ri nu urevu shi. Suru nle musa̱n m kpaku n ɗa, aza a na a tsu gura ɓara shi. A̱ tsu da̱na̱ ta̱ nven a yuwusan alavu, a ciga ta̱ nlavu lon. <verse eid="ISA 56:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 56:11" />Ele musa̱n mu utsa̱n n ɗa, a̱ tsu cuwa̱n shi. Aza a aguɓa a ɗa a na a̱ ri nu urevu shi. Suru nle a vadala ta̱ koyan ɗa reme ure wa̱ yi, za suru a zama ili i na wa̱a̱ tsura̱a̱ aciya̱yi. <verse eid="ISA 56:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 56:12" />Za suru a dansa &lt;&lt;Ta̱wa̱i, lyawa n tsura̱ masayan! Lyawai tsu sowoi hali tso o'woi usowu na̱ ma̱ra̱! Nfa'an waru to o'wo tsa ana'an, hali gba u la'a ne.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 56:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 56" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="ISA 57" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 57:1" />A̱za̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱ a̱ ta̱ tsukwa̱, agba ko za dama shi. A̱ pura̱ ta̱ ama a na a cayi aciyele, agba ko za reve a na a tarai za va̱ a̱ɓula̱ adama a wawa le e iwuya i na i ri a̱ ta̱wa̱ ɗa shi. <verse eid="ISA 57:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 57:2" />Aza a na a̱ ri a mmalu mejege a uwa a̱tsuma̱ a̱ nden ma asuvu e ivuwusan a̱tsuma̱ o ukwisa̱. <verse eid="ISA 57:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 57:3" />Agba a̱ɗu, rawai zuzu, a̱ɗu muwun mu za yindi, a̱ɗu umatsun wu za tsipere na aashakala! <verse eid="ISA 57:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 57:4" />Zane yaa yuwusaan ulamu? Zane ya̱a̱ kpa̱tu'wusa̱ una̱ yo utusa̱a̱ elentsu a tarasa yi ili ye pere? A̱ɗu muwun ma aza a aciyogbamu a ɗa shi, umatsun wa̱ a̱za̱ e epen shi? <verse eid="ISA 57:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 57:5" />I ta̱ ni icigi i tsipere e memere ma ɗanga oku na a ɗanga na ri upa̱mu, aza a na aa paɗasa muwun n le a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ka̱ri, na a pa'atan va atali. <verse eid="ISA 57:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 57:6" />A̱tsuma̱ a atali e shembu shembu o uka̱ri ɗe ɗa akunda a̱ wu a̱ ri, ele ɗa akunda a̱ wu. Ele ɗa vu tsuwa̱yin kucci vo oso na̱ kucci vi ishina. Adama e ili i nda n ta̱ bula̱ ili i na n cigai n yuwan? <verse eid="ISA 57:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 57:7" />Vu yuwan ta̱ a̱a̱ga̱da̱ a̱ wu a masasan mo uga'an zuva, ɗe ɗa vu gawain vu ca kucci va̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 57:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 57:8" />O ucina̱ wu na̱ntsu va̱ wu na a akpata a̱ na̱ntsu va̱ wu vu zuwa ta̱ iroci ya̱ a̱za̱ a̱ a̱ma̱li. Vu vari mu, vu palu'wa ta̱ a̱a̱ga̱da̱ a̱ wu, vu kumba yi ta̱ a̱vu vu kpa̱tu'wa̱ yi washin. Reve vu taraa aciya̱wu akucunu ne ele, vu ciga ta̱ a̱ga̱da̱ e le, a̱vu ve ene ataɓu e le. <verse eid="ISA 57:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 57:9" />Vu 'ya̱wa̱ ta̱ uba̱ta̱ u Molek na̱ mani'in ma̱ zetun a̱vu vu da̱shi aturare a̱ wu a̱bunda̱. Vu lyungu ta̱ ajiya a̱ wu alanga. Hali vu cipa̱ a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱. <verse eid="ISA 57:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 57:10" />Ko na vu kuna̱i na̱ a̱bunda̱ a mmalu, agba vu damma, &lt;&lt;Ili ye pere i ɗa shi.&gt;&gt; Vu tsura̱ ta̱ ucira u sa'avu, adama o ndolo vu ta̱ka̱lyuwa̱ shi. <verse eid="ISA 57:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 57:11" />&lt;&lt;Zane vaa uwwusa wovon na̱ ma̱riya̱ mo okolo hali na vaa yuwusaan mu epen. A̱vu vu kuɗa̱ a cuwan na̱ a̱mu ko vu yuwan majiyan ma̱ va̱ o okolo a̱ wu? Adama a na n jimai n yuwain adanshi ɗa shi, ɗaɗa vu kuɗa̱i a uwwa wovon u va̱ shi? <verse eid="ISA 57:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 57:12" />N ta̱ pa̱lu'wa̱ a̱ɓula̱ a̱ wu na̱ linga va̱ wu, waru aa kamba wu shi. <verse eid="ISA 57:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 57:13" />Na̱ vu saala izami yi ikambi, lyawa musula̱ n na vu ɓolotoi a wawa wu! Upepu u ta̱ pura̱ le suru, wivuwun u ta tawa le. Vuma na gba tara numu upa'atan wa̱ yi u to o'wo ni iɗa'a a̱vu waru u ka̱mba̱to masasan ma akiza ma̱ va̱ za va̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 57:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nden ma asuva ma aza a na okolo e le a kuɗai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 57:14" />Reve gba a damma: &lt;&lt;Suwai, suwai, foɓoi ure! Tawai ili i na yee gesheshe ure wa ama a̱ va̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 57:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 57:15" />Adama a na apa ili i na Za va zuva za tsugbain dammai, a̱yi za na ri wuma babu ukotu, za na ala a̱ yi a̱ ri akiza, &lt;&lt;N ta̱ nden zuva nu uba̱ta̱ wa akiza. Oɓolo na̱ a̱yi za na ri no okolo o uvadalasa no okolo a na a tarai aciya̱yi ili i ro shi, adama u jisan ruhu vu za na tarai aciya̱yi ili shi. Waru u jisan okolo a za vu udalasa. <verse eid="ISA 57:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 57:16" />Maa lyuwa elime na̱ nla̱ngi shi, ko n da̱na̱ o upan kuci shi. Na̱ ne ɗa shi ruhu vu vaɗilima̱ to uta̱a̱ okolo uba̱ta̱ u va̱, wivuwun u vuma na n yuwain. <verse eid="ISA 57:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 57:17" />Adama e iwuya yu utsa̱n i le i ɗa n shi n yuwain upan. N ca le ta̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱, a̱vu n soko urewesu u va̱ a̱tsuma̱ o upan, suru na̱ ne a̱vu a lyuwa elime ni ili i na a cigai a̱ ka̱mba̱sa̱ a̱ca̱pa̱. <verse eid="ISA 57:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 57:18" />N ka̱lyuwa̱ ta̱ re le, agba n ta̱ ka̱mba̱to le gbaga. N to rono le aɗanga a̱vu n ka̱mbuwa̱a̱ le na asuvu nden aza a na a̱ ri a̱ nden ma̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu oɓolo ne ele. <verse eid="ISA 57:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 57:19" />N ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ ni ica a̱ na̱ le. Lyawa aza a na a̱ ri alanga na aza a na a̱ ri zuzu a̱ tsura̱ asuvu nden lon,&gt;&gt; A̱sulazuva a ɗa a dammai. &lt;&lt;Waru n ta̱ ka̱mba̱to le gbaga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 57:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 57:20" />Amma a̱za̱ e iwuya a̱ ta̱ tsa mala mo ujaaru, za na tsi ivuwan shi, za na ikeɗu ikeɗu ya̱ yi i tsu ta̱ɓa̱luwusa̱ a̱shinda̱ na̱ yiyanɓa zuva. <verse eid="ISA 57:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 57:21" />&lt;&lt;A̱za̱ e iwuya a̱a̱ tsura̱ asuvu nden shi,&gt;&gt; A̱sulazuva a ɗa a dammai.<verse eid="ISA 57:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 57" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="ISA 58" />
  <para style="s">Akuli a amayun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 58:1" />&lt;&lt;Salai lon, she i ɓa̱na̱ yi o okolo wan. 'Ya̱sa̱in uɗyo u ɗu zuva tsa aavana. Dammai ama a̱ va̱ u'wa wa Yakubu iwuya i le na̱ waru unusu u le. <verse eid="ISA 58:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 58:2" />Adama a na a ta zama mu urana suru. O rotso ta̱ she damma a ta a maluwa mo ure u va̱ na amayun. She damma ele iɗa i na yaa yuwusan ili i na i ri mejege ma ɗa koto a lyawa wila̱ wa̱ A̱sula̱ e le shi. E te eceshe mu a̱sa̱la̱ a na a̱ ri mejege a̱vu a yuwan she damma a̱ ta maluwa A̱sula̱ a rawa zuzu ne ele. <verse eid="ISA 58:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 58:3" />A̱vu a damma, &lt;Adama a̱ nye tsu yuwain akuli, agba ve ene shi? Adama a̱ nye tsu ka̱ɗa̱toi aciya̱tsu, agba vu reve shi?&gt; &gt;&gt; A̱vu A̱sulazuva a̱ usu u damma, &lt;&lt;Uwwai nda, a̱tsuma̱ o urana wa akuli u ɗu i tsu kurusu ta̱ ili i na i cigai, a̱vu i paalasa aza a na aa yuwusaan ɗu ulinga. <verse eid="ISA 58:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 58:4" />Akuli a̱ ɗu o tsu koso ta̱ na̱ mawasan na̱ nla̱ngi na̱ nlapulai na̱ likuku vi iwuya. Cu'un va akuli a na yaa yuwusan ana'an waa zuwa aa uwwa uɗyo u ɗu zuva shi. <verse eid="ISA 58:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 58:5" />Cu'un va akuli na n ɗangwai ɗa nda'a urana u ta̱ vuma ca aciya̱yi a̱tsuma̱lima̱? Ko u ka̱ɗa̱to aaci a̱ yi goon tsa apumpu na adama o uvosun na akashamuna utsuwun no okomo? Ili i ndolo i ɗa yee ɗesu akuli, urana u na A̱sulazuva a̱a̱ usu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 58:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 58:6" />&lt;&lt;O'o apa nda cu'un va akuli na n ɗangwai, a̱ ba̱ɗa̱ akani e iwuya, reve waru a̱ ba̱ɗa̱ amunga a̱ a̱a̱gba̱la̱ a aza a na a tsugbai. A̱vu waru a lyawa aza a na oo ɓongishi fa̱a̱n. A̱vu a kuɗa a̱a̱gba̱la̱ biti. <verse eid="ISA 58:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 58:7" />A̱yi ɗa vu ne'eshen ilyalya ya̱ wu na̱ za na ri na ambulu. A̱vu vu ta̱wa̱ na̱ za na ri nu u'wa shi a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa. Na̱ ve ene za na ri ataɓu vo oto yi itana. Waru she vu suma lipu va̱ wu na̱ za na ri mpasa ma̱ wu wan. <verse eid="ISA 58:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 58:8" />Ɗaɗa ekan a̱ wu ee ikana tsa̱ a̱ wutu wu urana, reve vo o'wo gbaga ni ilaɗi. A̱vu a̱ɓula̱ a̱ wu a wala elime a̱ wu, reve tsugbain tsa̱ A̱sulazuva tsa yuwaan wu mapari a̱ca̱pa̱. <verse eid="ISA 58:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 58:9" />Ɗaɗa vee ɗe a̱vu A̱sulazuva a̱ usu. Vu ta yuwan mesun me izami yi ikambi, a̱vu u damma, &lt;A̱mu ɗa nda.&gt; Na̱ vu tawa a̱a̱gba̱la̱ e iɓongi nu usapishi wa akatsu na adanshi a vama. <verse eid="ISA 58:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 58:10" />Na̱ vu ca aciya̱wu o una̱ wu za va ambulu, a̱vu vu kamba za na ri a̱tsuma̱ e iɓongi, ɗaɗa ekan a̱ wu ee ikana a̱tsuma̱ e irumbu. A̱vu ayin a̱ wu o o'wo tsu urana a aci. <verse eid="ISA 58:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 58:11" />A̱sulazuva o to rono wu aɗanga kuci. U ta ca wu ili i na vu cigai biti a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i na urana wa̱a̱ kula̱tosu, reve u gbamato etele a̱ wu. Vu to o'wo tsa̱ a̱a̱rumbu a na a̱a̱ tsurusa̱ mini ulobonu, tsa̱ lyusu mini ma na mini ma̱ yi ma tsu kasa shi. <verse eid="ISA 58:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 58:12" />Waru vu ta suwisa akuci a sa'a a̱ wu a na o o'woi okongo mantsa ɗe nu ujumu reve a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n akuci a̱ nkyun mu ufaru. A̱ ta̱ ɗe wu Za vu Ulapulu vu Uɓaɓu u na wo Ocoi, Za vu Ulapulu wu re na̱ ba̱ta̱ a̱ Nden.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 58:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 58:13" />&lt;&lt;Vu tawa ana a makuɗa ma Ashibi waru na̱ mayan cine vu cigai o urana wa akiza u va̱. Vu reme e ɗesu Ashibi ili i ma̱za̱nga̱ nu urana wa akiza wa̱ A̱sulazuva ili i tsugbain. Vu ca yi tsugbain vu lyawa a̱ kurusu ure wa̱ wu waru vu lyawa a yuwusan ili i na okolo a̱ wu a cigai na adanshi a vama. <verse eid="ISA 58:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 58:14" />Ɗaɗa va̱a̱ tsura̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva. Reve n zuwa wu vo o'wo zuva vu uvaɗi, a̱vu n zuwa wu vu lyuwa a agadu a dada va̱ wu Yakubu.&gt;&gt; Una̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva a ɗa a dammai.<verse eid="ISA 58:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 58" />
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="ISA 59" />
  <para style="s">Unusu nu udansa wu unusu na atsupu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 59:1" />Uwwai nda, ukere wa̱ A̱sulazuva u ri mokoɗi shi na wa̱a̱ kuɗa̱ wawa, ko atsuvu a̱ yi u'ulu na waa uwwa shi. <verse eid="ISA 59:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 59:2" />Agba iwuya i ɗu i ɗa yi kasa nɗu na̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu. Reve unusu u ɗu u sokoo ɗu urewesu wa̱ yi, adama wu uwwa wan. <verse eid="ISA 59:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 59:3" />Adama a na ekere a̱ ɗu a̱ shinda̱la̱ ta̱ na̱ mpasa, akatsu a̱ ɗu waru ni iwuya. Na̱ ɗu yuwan ta̱ epen, elentsu a̱ ɗu waru a ta a dansa iwuya. <verse eid="ISA 59:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 59:4" />Ko za a zama uge'etosu u mejege shi, ko za a̱a̱ kurusu amayun uba̱ta̱ wu uge'etosu shi. A zuwa ta̱ ucira u le e ili ye pere a yuwusan adanshi e epen. A tsu yuwan ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ e iwuya a̱vu a matsan unusu. <verse eid="ISA 59:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 59:5" />A tsu gyu'wan ta̱ okowo a apili, a̱vu a ɗava u'wa wu natan. Za na suru tamai okowo e le u ta̱ kuwa̱, waru no o ɓoso za ta̱ reve a gyu'wan aapili. <verse eid="ISA 59:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 59:6" />Uɗava wu natan le waa gura o'wo a̱tugu shi. Aa gura pala aciyele ni ili i na a yuwain shi. Linga le linga vi iwuya i ɗa, linga vu u'ya̱susa̱n wu ugbozu ta̱ e ekere e le. <verse eid="ISA 59:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 59:7" />Ana e le a̱ tsu suma ta̱ a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a yuwan iwuya. A̱ tsu jika̱ ta̱ adama o oco mpasa mu za na ri nu unusu shi. Majiyan me le majiyan me iwuya ma ɗa, ulungusu nu ukotosu u shiton ta̱ re le. <verse eid="ISA 59:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 59:8" />E reve ure wu nden wa asuvu nden shi, uge'etosu wa amayun u ri e re le shi. A ka̱mba̱to ta̱ re le vo o'wo ugondoru. Za na a̱a̱ kuru le ri na asuvu nden shi. <verse eid="ISA 59:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 59:9" />Adama o ndolo uge'etosu wa amayun u yuwan ta̱ alanga na̱ a̱tsu, a̱ɓula̱ waru a rawa tsu shi. Tsu ta zamishi ekan, agba a̱yi ɗa nda irumbu i ɗa suru. Tsu ta zama hawun reve tso o'wo a mmalu a̱tsuma̱ o ululu da̱n. <verse eid="ISA 59:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 59:10" />Tsu ta papurusa uɓaɓu tse irumba̱, a zamishi ure tsa ama a na a̱ ri ne esu shi. Tsu ta̱ ta̱ɗa̱tsa̱ nu urana a aci she damma ayin uɓatsu. E memere ma̱ a̱za̱ o ucira tso o'wo ta̱ tsa̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱. <verse eid="ISA 59:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 59:11" />Suru ntsu tsu ta sali she damma biya, tsu te mesun ma̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu she damma muɗa. Tsu te izami yu uge'etosu wa amayun, agba tsu tsura̱ shi, e izami yi iwawi, agba u ta alanga na̱ a̱tsu. <verse eid="ISA 59:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 59:12" />Adama a na nusu tsu ta̱ a̱bunda̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ wu, waru nusu tsu ta yuwusan adanshi a aci a̱ tsu. Nusu tsu to oɓolo na̱ a̱tsu, waru tsu ta̱ nu urevu na̱ nusu tsu, <verse eid="ISA 59:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 59:13" />na aciyogbamu na̱ mawasan ma̱ A̱sulazuva. Tsu vadalaa ta̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu ucina̱. Tsu to foɓuso iɓongi nu u'ya̱susa̱n wu ugbozu, nu udansa we epen a na okolo a̱ tsu o foɓoi. <verse eid="ISA 59:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 59:14" />Mayan me mejege a̱tsuma̱ o uge'etosu a̱ ca̱co yi ta̱ a̱ nge'en, a̱ɓula̱ waru a̱ ta̱ mishin alanga. Amayun a̱ ta̱ɗa̱tsa̱ e re, waru mayan me mejege ma gura uwa shi. <verse eid="ISA 59:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 59:15" />Amayun a̱ puwa̱n ta̱, waru za na suru 'yuwain iwuya wo o'wo ta̱ ilyalya. A̱sulazuva a̱ ka̱lyuwa̱ ta̱ agba wu uwwa uyo'o shi a na babu uge'etosu wa amayun. <verse eid="ISA 59:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 59:16" />We ene ta̱ ko za lo shi, a̱vu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ la̱nga̱ yi a na ko za lo aa kamba shi. Ɗaɗa ukere wa̱ yi u ta̱wa̱a̱ niyi ni iwawi, reve a̱ɓula̱ a̱ yi a ɓana niyi. <verse eid="ISA 59:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 59:17" />Wo oto ta̱ a̱ɓula̱ tsa̱ utugu wu rumu, na̱ melezu ma̱ rumu me iwawi a aaci a̱ yi, wo oto ta̱ a̱tugu a atsupu. Reve u katala aciya̱yi nu ukadu tso umuna. <verse eid="ISA 59:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 59:18" />Cine linga na a yuwain ri, ne ɗa waa tsupa n'yuwatan ma̱ yi nu upan. U ta tsupa nɗa m memere ma̱ mini ili i na yi ntsaa nle. <verse eid="ISA 59:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 59:19" />Ama a̱ mɓa̱nga̱ ma̱ a̱livu a ta uwwa wovon wa ala a̱ A̱sulazuva waru diga asana a ta uwwa wovon u tsugbain tsa̱ yi. Adama a na u ta̱ ta̱wa̱ tsu uɗolu wi ilaɗi lon, za na upepu wa̱ A̱sulazuva woo losu. <verse eid="ISA 59:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 59:20" />&lt;&lt;Za va Atsupu ta̱ ta̱wa̱ Sihiyona, uba̱ta̱ wa aza a Yakubu a na a vadalai a̱ nusu le,&gt;&gt; A̱sulazuva a ɗa a dammai.<verse eid="ISA 59:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 59:21" />&lt;&lt;Ya̱'a̱ va̱ gba, a̱yi nda a̱yi ɗa akucunu a̱ va̱ ne ele,&gt;&gt; A̱sulazuva a ɗa a dammai. &lt;&lt;Ruhu va̱ na ri oɓolo na̱ a̱ɗu na adanshi a̱ va̱ a na n zuwai o una̱ u ɗu waa kasa nu una̱ u ɗu shi, ko na̱ muwun n ɗu shi ko a̱ na̱ m muwun mu gundo le shi diga a mantsa ma nda a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ waru hali hali hali,&gt;&gt; A̱sulazuva a ɗa a dammai.<verse eid="ISA 59:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 59" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="ISA 60" />
  <para style="s">Tsugbain tsa̱ Sihiyona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 60:1" />&lt;&lt;'Yon Urishelima vu ca ekan, adama a na ekan a̱ wu a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱, tsugbain tsa̱ A̱sulazuva tsa̱ te ikanasa a aci a̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 60:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 60:2" />Uwwai nda, irumbu i ɓa̱ru ta̱ uvaɗi waru irumbu pici i ɓa̱ru ta̱ ama, agba A̱sulazuva a̱ te ikana a aci a̱ wu waru e te ene tsugbain tsa̱ yi a aci a̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 60:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 60:3" />Nɗa n ta̱ ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ we ekan a̱ wu, ngono waru n ta̱ ta̱wa̱ e ene ekan o u'yowun wa̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 60:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 60:4" />'Ya̱sa̱n esu a̱ wu vu ka̱lyuwa̱ a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ wu. Ama a̱ wu suru o ɓoloto ta̱ a̱vu a̱ ta̱wa̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ wu. Olobo a̱ wu a̱ ta̱ a̱ ma̱ta̱wa̱ diga alanga, esheli a̱ wu waru usheɗu e ekere. <verse eid="ISA 60:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 60:5" />Vu te ene vi ikana, okolo a̱ wu a ta shiwan na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱, adama a na a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ wu nu utsuru u mala, utsuru wu nɗa u ta̱ ta̱wa̱ ya̱'a̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 60:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 60:6" />Oɓolo a arakumi a̱ ta̱ ɓa̱ru wu, murakumi ma Midiya na̱ Efa. Suru nle suru a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ diga Sheba. A̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ zinariya na̱ furenkisen, waru a ta damma alabari a sa'ani e ili i na A̱sulazuva a yuwain. <verse eid="ISA 60:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 60:7" />Oɓolo e ikyon ya Keda suru o to ɓolotowo wu ele, a̱giri'i a Nebayo waru a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ ne ele adama a yuwaan wu a̱ga̱nda̱. A̱ ta̱ ushi le a̱ga̱nda̱ a masa'a ma̱ va̱, waru n to lobonoto u'wa u tsugbain tsa̱ va̱. <verse eid="ISA 60:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 60:8" />Nan zane a ɗa nda'a aza a na a̱ ri a tsu'yan tse eleshe, a tsu'yan tsa muɗa a̱ tyo e nkinda i le? <verse eid="ISA 60:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 60:9" />Amayun nɗa m memere ma̱ mini n ta zuwaa mu okolo, na antsun a Tarshishi elime e le a̱ ta̱wusa̱ na̱ muwun ma̱ wu diga alanga, utanuwu na̱ azurufa na̱ zinariya le adama a ca ala a̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ wu Za va Akiza a Isra'ila tsugbain, adama a na u zuwa wu ta̱ vu lobono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 60:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 60:10" />&lt;&lt;Omocin a ta suwisa ɓaɓu va̱ wu, a̱vu ngono n le n yuwaan wu a̱ga̱nda̱. Ko na n ga̱la̱ nuwu a̱tsuma̱ o upan, agba a̱tsuma̱ e isa'ani i va̱ n te ene iliyali ya̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 60:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 60:11" />Na̱ntsu va̱ wu ta̱ da̱na̱ ukpa̱tu'u kuci, urana na ayin a̱a̱ ɓa̱ru le shi, adama ama a̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ wu nu utsuru wu nɗa, na̱ ngono n le ugeru elime. <verse eid="ISA 60:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 60:12" />Adama a na iɗa na̱ tsugono tsa na tsaa yuwaan wu tsugbashi shi u to koto, nɗa n ndolo o to kototo le suru suru.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 60:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 60:13" />&lt;&lt;Tsugbain tsa Lebanon tsa̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ ya̱'a̱ wu, ɗanga fir na̱ amon na aza a seda, adama a kakala A̱a̱'isa̱ a̱ va̱. Reve n zuwa udasata wa ana a̱ va̱ a̱ tsura̱ tsugbain. <verse eid="ISA 60:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 60:14" />Muwun ma aza a na a ca nuwu a̱tsuma̱lima̱ n ta̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱ ka̱ɗa̱ta̱wa̱ wu. Aza a na waru a tara nuwu ili i ro shi a̱ ta̱ ka̱ɗato a ana a̱ wu. A̱vu e ɗe wu Lyuci Gbain va̱ A̱sulazuva, Sihiyona lyuci vu Za va Akiza va Isra'ila.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 60:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 60:15" />&lt;&lt;Ko na wo o'woi a lyawa wu ta̱ a̱vu waru a 'yuwan wu, babu ko za na o utula̱i a̱tsuma̱ a̱ wu, n ta̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ wu ili i tsugbain babu ukotu, ili i ma̱za̱nga̱ hali hali. <verse eid="ISA 60:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 60:16" />Vu to sowo maani ma nɗa a̱vu a kungwato wu a maani mo tsugono. Reve vu reve a na a̱mu, A̱sulazuva, a̱mu ɗa Iwawi ya wu, Za va Atsupu va̱ wu, Za vu Ucira va Yakubu. <verse eid="ISA 60:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 60:17" />N ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ zinariya o una̱ wu rumushili, azurufa waru o una̱ wu rumu. O una̱ wa akpata waru n ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ wu na̱ rumushili, na̱ rumu o una̱ wa atali. N ta zuwa nden ma asuvu wo o'wo zagbain va̱, a̱ɓula̱ waru aa yuwan tsugbain a aci a̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 60:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 60:18" />A̱a̱ da̱shi uwwa u'ya̱susa̱n wu ugbozu e iɗa ya̱ wu shi, ko ulungusu ko ukototosu a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa ya̱ wu shi. Agba vu te ɗe ɓaɓu va̱ wu Iwawi, na̱ntsu va̱ wu waru Ica. <verse eid="ISA 60:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 60:19" />Urana wa̱a̱ da̱shi o'wo ekan a̱ wu nu urana shi, ko gba ekan o woto e ikana a aci a̱ wu shi, adama a na A̱sulazuva o to o'wo ekan a̱ wu babu ukotu. A̱sula̱ a̱ wu o to o'wo tsugbain tsa̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 60:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 60:20" />Urana wa̱ wu u buwa a̱a̱ da̱shi riya̱ shi, woto wa̱ wu waru wa̱a̱ ka̱mba̱ na̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ shi, adama a na A̱sulazuva o to o'wo ekan a̱ wu a babu ukosu, rana wa̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ va̱ wu waru to koto. <verse eid="ISA 60:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 60:21" />Reve ama a̱ wu suru oo o'wo a̱za̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱ reve iɗa'a yo o'wo za le hali hali. Ele eten a na n cu'wa̱in ɗa, ulinga we ekere a̱ va̱, adama a ca mu tsugbain. <verse eid="ISA 60:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 60:22" />Za na ri uka̱la̱mu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu u to o'wo a̱bunda̱ lon, za na waru la'ai uka̱la̱mu u to o'wo iɗa yu ucira. A̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva a mantsa ma na ma ntsayi n ta zuwa ili'i u yuwan go'o.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 60:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 60" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="ISA 61" />
  <para style="s">Aa'wan e isa'ani ya̱ A̱sulazuva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 61:1" />Ruhu va̱ A̱sulazuva Zagbain to oɓolo na̱ a̱mu, adama a na A̱sulazuva a tawa mu ta̱ adama n yuwaan a̱za̱ a̱ iliyali adanshi a alabari a sa'ani. U lyungu mu ta̱ adama n ka̱mba̱to aza a na o uta̱i okolo gbaga. Waru adama n yuwan adanshi a na aa lyawa aza a na a̱ ri a tsugbashi fa̱a̱n waru a̱ ba̱ɗa̱ aza na a̱ ri a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wa ali diga a̱tsuma̱ e irumbu, <verse eid="ISA 61:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 61:2" />n yuwan adanshi a aa'wan e isa'ani a̱ A̱sulazuva nu urana wa atsupu a̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu. Reve n ca aza a na a̱ ri na̱ ma̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu adanshi. <verse eid="ISA 61:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 61:3" />Reve waru n ca aza a na a̱ ri a̱tsumola̱ngu a̱tsuma̱ a Sihiyona, n ca le okokolo a sa'ani o una̱ wo ogbondo, na̱ mani'in ma̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ o una̱ wa̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu, nu utugu u gbain wi ica o una̱ u ruhu u makuɗa mo okolo. E te ɗe le ɗanga oku gbagbain va̱ a̱ɓula̱, ca̱'a̱n va̱ A̱sulazuva adama a ca yi tsugbain. <verse eid="ISA 61:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 61:4" />A ta suwisa akuci a̱ ba̱ta̱ na o ocoi, a̱vu a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n ba̱ta̱ na vo o'woi okongo. A ta lapula ilyuci i na a̱ shi a̱ rukutsa̱i, ba̱ta̱ na a̱ rukutsa̱i ɗe mantsa nu ujumu. <verse eid="ISA 61:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 61:5" />Omoci a ta guɓa oɓolo e ikyon i ɗu, omocin a ɗa aa cimba a̱ɗuma̱ a̱ ɗu reve a lapula ataci a ina̱bi a̱ ɗu. <verse eid="ISA 61:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 61:6" />E te ɗe ɗu nan ganu va̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu a ca ɗu ala a̱za̱ a̱ a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu. I ta lyuwa utsuru wu nɗa, reve i yuwan uvaɗu nu utsuru u le. <verse eid="ISA 61:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 61:7" />O una̱ u wono a̱ ta̱ tsura̱ akunda ure, waru o una̱ u na aa tara le ili i ro shi, a ta yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ ni ili i na i ri za le, adama o ndolo a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa i le a̱ ta̱ tsura̱ akunda ure, waru o to o'wo na̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ babu ukotu. <verse eid="ISA 61:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 61:8" />&lt;&lt;Adama a na a̱mu A̱sulazuva n ciga ta̱ ili i na i ri mejege, n 'yuwan ta̱ a'usa ni iwuya. A̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱ a̱ va̱ n ta ca le iliyinkapa, reve n yuwan akucunu a na a̱ ri n koto shi ne ele. <verse eid="ISA 61:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 61:9" />E te reve nu ugundo u le a̱tsuma̱ a nɗa waru e te reve na̱ muwun n le e memere ma ama. Za na suru e ene nle, u te reve ne ele a na ele ɗa ama a na A̱sulazuva a zuwayi aba'un.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 61:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 61:10" />N ta yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ lon na̱ A̱sulazuva, okolo a̱ va̱ a ta yuwan mere na̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱, adama a na wo oto mu ta̱ a̱tugu e iwawi. Reve wu pala mu nu utugu wu uga'an wa̱ a̱ɓula̱, cine vali vu kasa'avu tsu yuwaan aciya̱yi tsulolobo tsa ganu, waru cine kasa'avu tsu yuwan tsusheli ni iyeɗi ya̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 61:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 61:11" />Adama a na cine ma̱bula̱ ma̱ tsu uta̱a̱ no ototopi, waru cine a̱a̱rumbu a tsu zuwa ili i na a̱ cu'wa̱in pe wu uta̱, ne ɗa A̱sulazuva Zagbain aa zuwa a̱ɓula̱ ni ica yu uta̱ uba̱ta̱ suru a̱tsuma̱ a nɗa.<verse eid="ISA 61:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 61" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="ISA 62" />
  <para style="s">Aala a sa'avu a̱ Sihiyona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 62:1" />Adama a̱ Sihiyona ma̱a̱ rungwa̱ kpen shi, adama a̱ Urishelima ma̱a̱ da̱na̱ kpen shi, hali she na̱ a̱ɓula̱ a̱ yi e ikana o uta̱ tse ekan, iwawi ya̱ yi tsa aakata a akina a madala. <verse eid="ISA 62:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 62:2" />Nɗa n te ene a̱ɓula̱ a̱ wu, waru ngono suru me ene tsugbain tsa̱ wu, a̱vu e ɗe wu na aala a sa'avu a na una̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva waa ca. <verse eid="ISA 62:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 62:3" />A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ ɓa̱na̱ wu o ukere wa̱ yi tso ookokolo o ulobonu, tso ookokolo o tsugono e ekere a̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 62:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 62:4" />Aa buwa a̱ da̱shi ɗe wu Alyawi shi iɗa ya̱ wu Ofoli shi. Amma e te ɗe wu Hefiziba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">62:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na̱ Tsuyahuda urevu wa̱ yi u ɗa, &lt;&lt;N ta uwwusa uyo'o wa̱ yi&gt;&gt;</char></note>, iɗa ya̱ wu waru Bewula<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">62:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na̱ tsuyahuda urevu wa̱ yi u ɗa, &lt;&lt;Lolo&gt;&gt;</char></note>, adama a na A̱sulazuva a ta uwwa uyo'o wa̱ wu, waru u ta zuwa iɗa ya̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 62:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 62:5" />Cine ulobo u tsu zuwa usheli, ne ɗa olobo a̱ wu a zuwa wu. Waru cine vali vu kasa'avu tsu za̱nga̱na̱a̱ kasa'avu va̱ yi, ne ɗa A̱sula̱ a̱ wu a̱ za̱nga̱na̱a̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 62:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 62:6" />A ɓaɓu va̱ wu, Urishelima, n zuwa ta̱ a̱za̱ e ipiri, urana na ayin suru a̱ da̱na̱ kuci shi. A̱ɗu na yaa cuwusan na̱ A̱sulazuva she i bula̱ wan. <verse eid="ISA 62:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 62:7" />Waru she i ca yi wivuwun wan hali she nu u shuwa̱ Urishelima, a̱vu wo o'woto yi ili yi ica o uvaɗi. <verse eid="ISA 62:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 62:8" />A̱sulazuva a kucina ta̱ nu ukere u sa'ani wa̱ yi nu ukere wu ucira wa̱ yi waru: &lt;&lt;Ma̱a̱ da̱shi ca n'yuwatan ma wu ishina ya̱ wu wo o'wo le ilyalya shi. Omocin a̱a̱ da̱shi sowo masayan ma̱ sa'avu ma̱ wu na vu sowoi a̱tsuma̱lima̱ o ulinga wa̱ yi shi. <verse eid="ISA 62:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 62:9" />Amma aza a na a gasai ishina a ta lyuwa a̱vu a cuwa A̱sulazuva. Aza a na waru o ɓolotoi ina̱bi adama a masayan o to sowo yi o ukowo wa̱ A̱a̱'isa̱ a̱ va̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 62:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 62:10" />Utula̱i, utula̱i na̱ na̱ntsu! Lapulai ure adama a ama. Yuwain, yuwain ure! Tatawai atali. 'Ya̱sa̱in atuta adama a ama. <verse eid="ISA 62:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 62:11" />Uwwai nda, A̱sulazuva a damma ta̱ a̱ tyo o ukosu wu uvaɗi, &lt;&lt;Damma Usheli Sihiyona, &lt;Uwwa nda, Za vi iwawi va̱ wu ta̱ lo a̱ ta̱wa̱! Uwwai nda, gba iliyinkapa ya̱ yi i to oɓolo na̱ a̱yi, atsupu a̱ yi oɓolo na̱ a̱yi.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 62:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 62:12" />E te ɗe le, Ama a Akiza, aza a na A̱sulazuva a Tsupayi. Waru e te ɗe ɗu Aza a na a̱ Zamiyi, Lyuci na a Lyawai shi.<verse eid="ISA 62:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 62" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="ISA 63" />
  <para style="s">Urana wa atsupu wa̱ A̱sula̱ ni iwawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 63:1" />Zane ɗa nda'a zane ri a̱ ta̱wa̱ diga Edom, zane ri a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ a̱tugu a̱ shili diga Bozura? Zane ri nu utugu wu ulobonu zane ri a mmalu a̱tsuma̱ a tsugbain tsu ucira tsa̱ yi? &lt;&lt;A̱mu ɗa n ri a adanshi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ɓula̱, za na ri nu ucira u na waa gura wawa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 63:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 63:2" />Nye i zuwai itana ya̱ wu i ri ushili, a̱tugu a̱ wu tsu za na aa dasasa umatsun u ina̱bi? <verse eid="ISA 63:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 63:3" />&lt;&lt;Mu dasa ta̱ uba̱ta̱ u mokpoko u ina̱bi a̱mu a̱ nde'en, agba a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ama ko za shi oɓolo na̱ a̱mu shi. Mu dasa le ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ o upan u va̱, a̱vu mu kpoko le a̱tsuma̱ o upan wu usuɗuwu u va̱. Mpasa n le n lakata ta̱ a̱tugu a̱ va̱, reve n lakata itana i va̱. <verse eid="ISA 63:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 63:4" />Adama a na urana wa atsupu u to o okolo a̱ va̱, waru aa'wan a atsupu a̱ va̱ a rawa ta̱. <verse eid="ISA 63:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 63:5" />N ka̱lyuwa̱ ta̱ agba ko za lo na aa kamba shi. Reve n yuwan asalama a na ko za ri lo na waa kamba shi, ɗaɗa ukere u va̱ u ta̱wa̱a̱ numu ni iwawi, a̱vu upan u va̱ u guza̱ mu. <verse eid="ISA 63:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 63:6" />Mu dasa ta̱ ama a̱tsuma̱ o upan u va̱. N zuwa le ta̱ o o'wo usowu a̱tsuma̱ o upan wu usuɗuwu u va̱, a̱vu mo oco mpasa n le e iɗa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 63:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 63:7" />N ta yuwan adanshi e icigi ya̱ A̱sulazuva i na i tsu vadala shi, ica ya̱ A̱sulazuva, o una̱ wi ili i na suru A̱sulazuva a yuwaan ntsu. Isa'ani ya̱ a̱bunda̱ i na u yuwayin u'wa wa Isra'ila i na u yuwaan nle a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱bunda̱ e isa'ani ni icigi ya̱ yi i na i tsu vadala shi. <verse eid="ISA 63:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 63:8" />U damma ta̱, &lt;&lt;Amayun ele ama a̱ va̱ a ɗa, muwun n na maa yuwaan mu epen shi.&gt;&gt; Reve gba wo o'wo Za vi Iwawi i le. <verse eid="ISA 63:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 63:9" />A̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ e le suru a̱yi fo wu uwwa ta̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱, reve malingata ma̱ yi ma wawa le. A̱tsuma̱ e icigi ya̱ yi ni isa'ani ya̱ yi u tsupaa le ta̱. U 'ya̱sa̱n le ta̱ a̱vu u tanu le suru diga ɗe o ufaru. <verse eid="ISA 63:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 63:10" />Agba a̱vu a̱ 'ya̱sa̱a̱n yi aci a̱vu a̱ lungusa̱ Ruhu va Akiza va̱ yi a̱tsuma̱. Ɗaɗa gba u vadalai wo o'woi ma'yuwatan me le, reve a̱yi na aciya̱yi u yuwan uvon ne ele. <verse eid="ISA 63:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 63:11" />Reve ama a̱ yi a cuwan nu ufaru, mantsa ma Musa na ama a̱ yi. Reve a saala, &lt;&lt;Te ɗa za na utula̱i ne ele a̱tsuma̱ a mala'a, na̱ za va aguɓa vo oɓolo a̱ yi? Te ɗa za na zuwai Ruhu va Akiza va̱ yi e memere me le? <verse eid="ISA 63:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 63:12" />Te ɗa za na zuwai ukere wu ucira wa̱ yi u da̱na̱ o ukere u sa'ani wa Musa, za na ɓatsalai mini elime e le, adama u yuwaan aciya̱yi ala a na a̱ ri nu ukosu shi? <verse eid="ISA 63:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 63:13" />Te ɗa za na kuruyi ne ele a̱tsuma̱ a̱ a̱ru'un? Tso do a̱tsumona, a̱ ta̱ɗatsa̱ shi. <verse eid="ISA 63:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 63:14" />Tse inan i na i tsu wala a agalaci, ne ɗa Ruhu va̱ A̱sulazuva ca nle wivuwun. Ne ɗa vu kuruyi na ama a̱ wu, adama vu yuwaan aciya̱wu ala a tsugbain.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 63:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 63:15" />Ka̱lyuwa̱ diga zuva ve ene diga a̱ nda̱na̱ta̱ ma akiza n sa'ani ma̱ wu. Te ɗa uzuwu wo okolo a̱ wu nu ucira wa̱ wu? Icigi yo okolo a̱ wu na̱ yeni yi iliyali ya̱ wu vu tawa le ta̱ uba̱ta̱ u tsu. <verse eid="ISA 63:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 63:16" />Agba a̱vu ɗa dada tsu ko na wo o'woi Ibrahim reve tsu shi, waru Isra'ila reve na̱ a̱tsu shi. A̱vu A̱sulazuva dada tsu ɗa, Za va Atsupu a̱ tsu a ɗa diga ɗe o ufaru. <verse eid="ISA 63:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 63:17" />A̱sulazuva, adama a̱ nye vu zuwa ntsu agara diga o ure wa̱ wu reve vu gbawato okolo a̱ tsu, hali tsu kuɗa̱i a uwwa wovon wa̱ wu? Ka̱mba̱ adama a agbashi a̱ wu, gundo na ri agadu a̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 63:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 63:18" />Ama a akiza a̱ wu o o'wo ta̱ nu uba̱ta̱ wa akiza wa̱ wu a mamantsa, a̱vu gba n'yuwatan n tsu mu dasa A̱a̱'isa̱ a̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 63:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 63:19" />Tso o'wo ta̱ she damma aza a na vu shi vu yuwain tsugbain tse ele shi, she damma aza a na e ɗesuyi na ala a̱ wu shi.<verse eid="ISA 63:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 63" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="ISA 64" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 64:1" />A damma de vu ta ɓatsa zuva a̱vu u cipa̱ e iɗa, a̱vu nsasan n je'en elime a̱ wu! <verse eid="ISA 64:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 64:2" />Cine akina a̱ tsu reme ɗanga a̱vu akina'a u zuwa mini ma̱ puna̱, adama n'yuwatan ma̱ wu n reve ala a̱ wu, waru tsa̱ra̱ nɗa n jinga̱ɗa̱ elime a̱ wu! <verse eid="ISA 64:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 64:3" />Na̱ vu yuwan ili i wovon i na tsu zamiyi shi, vu cipa̱ ta̱ e iɗa, a̱vu nsasan n je'en lipu elime a̱ wu. <verse eid="ISA 64:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 64:4" />Nu ujimu ɗe babu za na uwwai ko u reve na atsuvu, babu lyusu na enei ɗe A̱sula̱ babu na̱ a̱vu, za na tsu linga o una̱ wa aza a na a pura yi. <verse eid="ISA 64:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 64:5" />Vu tsu ta̱wa̱ ta̱ ikambishi ya aza a na aa yuwusan amayun, aza a na a cuwain na̱ re va̱ wu. Uwwa nda, vu yuwan ta̱ upan, a̱tsu waru tsu yuwan ta̱ unusu, o unusu u tsu tsu jima ta̱. Cine tsa ɗa aa wawa tsu? <verse eid="ISA 64:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 64:6" />Tso o'wo ta̱ tsa ama a na a̱ ri idaba, waru linga va̱ a̱ɓula̱ a̱ tsu suru tsa akashamuna a̱ a̱shinda̱. Suru ntsu tsu 'yewe ta̱ tsa̱ a̱vu'un, waru tsu upepu, unusu u tsu u pura̱ ntsu a̱ ka̱ra̱. <verse eid="ISA 64:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 64:7" />Babu vuma ta̱ na ɗeyi a̱tsuma̱ a ala a̱ wu, za na 'yoyin adama u tsura̱ ikambishi ya̱ wu, adama a na vu sokoo tsu ta̱ urewesu wa̱ wu, a̱vu vu zuwa tsu tsu jeruwe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ nusu tsu. <verse eid="ISA 64:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 64:8" />Agba gogo, A̱sulazuva, a̱vu Dada tsu ɗa. A̱tsu olo'o a ɗa, a̱vu ma'in ɗa, suru ntsu a̱tsu ulinga wu ukere wa̱ wu u ɗa. <verse eid="ISA 64:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 64:9" />She vu yuwan upan usuɗuwu a̱bunda̱ wan, A̱sulazuva. She vu cuwan na̱ nusu tsu wan hali hali. Ka̱lyuwa̱, a̱yi ɗa nda, suru ntsu ama a̱ wu a ɗa. <verse eid="ISA 64:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 64:10" />Ilyuci ya akiza a̱ wu yo o'wo ta̱ a̱tsumona. Sihiyona o o'wo ta̱ a̱tsumona, Urishelima gba okongo. <verse eid="ISA 64:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 64:11" />U'wa wa akiza u tsu waru wu ulobonu, uba̱ta̱ u na nkaya n tsu n cuwa nuwu, u kula̱ ta̱ na akina. Waru ba̱ta̱ mawwa mo uyo'o ma̱ tsu o o'wo ta̱ okongo. <verse eid="ISA 64:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 64:12" />A̱sulazuva, vu to rono na̱ a̱ca̱pa̱ adama e ili i nda? Vu ta̱ rungwa̱ kpaku, a̱vu vu ca tsu a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a̱ a̱bunda̱?<verse eid="ISA 64:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 64" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="ISA 65" />
  <para style="s">Uge'etosu ni iwawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 65:1" />&lt;&lt;N roco ta̱ aciya̱va̱ a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa aza a na e ece numu shi, aza a na a zami numu shi a̱ tsura̱ mu ta̱. A̱ tyo e iɗa i na i ɗeyi a ala a̱ va̱ shi, n damma ta̱, &lt;Apa mu, apa mu.&gt; <verse eid="ISA 65:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 65:2" />Urana ma̱ɓula̱ n canana ta̱ ekere a̱ va̱ a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa ama a na a̱ 'ya̱susa̱n ugbozu, aza a na a walai o ure u na u ri ulobonu shi, o tonishi majiyan me ele. <verse eid="ISA 65:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 65:3" />Ama a na a tsu zuwa mu upan a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ va̱ mantsa suru, a casu kucci a aruma va̱ a̱ma̱li e le. Waru a̱a̱ kula̱tosu a̱tsuka̱ a̱ ma̱guru e iponu, <verse eid="ISA 65:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 65:4" />aza a na a̱ tsu da̱nu a ason reve a asa uba̱ta̱ wu usokowu ayin ma̱ɓula̱. Aza a na a tamusa inama yu ngurusumu, na̱ pondo na ri na̱ mayan vi inama yi idaba. <verse eid="ISA 65:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 65:5" />Aza a na a dammai, &lt;Yi isawan alanga. She i ta̱wa̱ zuzu na̱ a̱mu wan, adama a na n ta̱ na akiza lon a̱ tyo e ekere a̱ ɗu!&gt; Icu'un ya ama a nda mikyon n ɗa a̱ vunu va̱, akina a na a̱ tsu kima̱ shi hali usana. &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 65:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 65:6" />Uwwai nda, u tu uɗanu e ekere a̱ va̱, &lt;&lt;Ma̱a̱ rungwa̱ shi, amma n ta tsupa, n ta tsupa le na amayun, <verse eid="ISA 65:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 65:7" />nusu ɗu na̱ nusu vu nkaya n ɗu,&gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai. &lt;&lt;Adama a na a̱ kula̱toi kucci a nsasan a̱vu o rono mu e iɗa a agaɗi, n ta tsupa le na amayun a akuci a linga le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 65:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 65:8" />Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, &lt;&lt;Cine a̱ tsu tsura̱ masayan ma sa'avu a̱ a̱kutsu a̱ ina̱bi, a̱vu a damma, &lt;She i lungusa̱ yi wan, aba'un a̱ ta̱ pe a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi,&gt; &gt;&gt; tsundolo tsa ɗa maa yuwaan yi o una̱ wa agbashi a̱ va̱. Moo kototo le suru shi. <verse eid="ISA 65:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 65:9" />N ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱n ugundo diga ya Yakubu, waru diga ya Yahuza za na aa tara agadu a nsasan n va̱. Aza a na n ɗangwai o to o'wo ne ele, a̱vu agbashi a̱ va̱ a̱ da̱nu ɗe. <verse eid="ISA 65:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 65:10" />Sharon to o'wo uba̱ta̱ wa aguɓa wi ikyun, waru uka̱ri wa Ako uba̱ta̱ u na oɓolo e ikyon o von, adama a ama a̱ va̱ a na a zami numu. <verse eid="ISA 65:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 65:11" />&lt;&lt;Amma a̱ɗu na i wasain A̱sulazuva, aza a na e icinai na̱ masasan ma akiza ma̱ va̱, za na foɓoi aapada adama a̱ ma̱sula̱ mo Utsuru a̱vu u shiton mokoto ma na a̱ ja̱mba̱ra̱i na̱ masayan me Ili i na yaa Cina Vuma. <verse eid="ISA 65:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 65:12" />Ili i na yaa Cina ɗu n na maa zuwa ɗu a̱yi ɗa ukwa̱ u matsun me pe'eni. Reve suru nɗu i ka̱ɗa̱to uba̱ta̱ u na aa paɗa ɗu, adama a na mantsa ma na n ɗeyi, i usu shi, ana n yuwain adanshi, i zuwa atsuvu shi. Amma reve i yuwan ili yu uwuyanu e esu a̱ va̱, reve i ɗangwa ili i babu ulobonu i na n cigai shi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 65:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 65:13" />Adama o ndolo apa ili i na A̱sulazuva Zagbain dammai, &lt;&lt;Uwwai nda, agbashi a̱ va̱ a ta lyuwa, amma a̱ɗu i ta̱ da̱na̱ na ambulu. Uwwai nda, agbashi a̱ va̱ o to sowo, amma a̱ɗu i ta̱ da̱na̱ na akuli. Uwwai nda, agbashi a̱ va̱ a ta yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱, amma a̱ɗu i to sowo wono. <verse eid="ISA 65:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 65:14" />Uwwai nda, agbashi a̱ va̱ a ta cana adama a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ mo okolo, amma a̱ɗu i ta̱ shon adama a̱ mɓa̱la̱ mo okolo a̱vu i yuwan a̱tsumola̱ngu adama o ukuɗu u ruhu. <verse eid="ISA 65:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 65:15" />I ta lyawa ala a̱ ɗu a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ wa aza a na n ɗangwai tsu una̱. Reve A̱sulazuva Zagbain o una ɗu, agba agbashi a̱ yi u ta̱ ɗe le na aala o ro. <verse eid="ISA 65:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 65:16" />Adama za na suru patiyi aba'un e iɗa'a u ta zuwaa aciya̱yi aba'un e ekere a̱ A̱sula̱ a amayun. Reve za na yuwain akucunu e iɗa'a u ta yuwan akucunu na̱ A̱sula̱ a amayun, adama a na e icina ta̱ akuci a addama waru o soko le ta̱ e esu a̱ va̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 65:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zuva sa'avu nu uvaɗi u sa'avu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 65:17" />&lt;&lt;Uwwai nda, n ta yuwan zuva sa'avu nu uvaɗi u sa'avu, waru ko za a̱a̱ da̱shi cuwan na akuci e ili ko a cuwan ne ele shi. <verse eid="ISA 65:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 65:18" />Amma i yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ i yuwan mere hali hali e ili i na maa yuwan. Uwwai nda, n ta yuwan Urishelima wo o'wo ili i ma̱za̱nga̱, ama a̱ yi waru o to o'wo a̱za̱ a̱ ma̱za̱nga̱. <verse eid="ISA 65:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 65:19" />N ta yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ a aci a̱ Urishelima reve n yuwan mere na ama a̱ va̱. A̱a̱ da̱shi uwwa yisaali i mesun ko mesun ma̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ shi. <verse eid="ISA 65:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 65:20" />A̱a̱ da̱shi tsura̱ mereɓu ma na maa yuwan wuma rana meketeci goon shi, ko aabara a na o shitoyin rana va̱ yi shi. Za na yuwain a'wan ukpaku (100) a ta tara yi u buwa ta̱ mawun. Reve za na kuwa̱i a̱yi na a'wan ukpaku a damma una̱ u ɗa u reme niyi. <verse eid="ISA 65:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 65:21" />Ama ta̱ a̱ da̱nu a 'wa na a suwai. A̱ ta̱ cu'wa̱n a̱ɗuma̱ a ataci reve a lyuwa umatsun u le. <verse eid="ISA 65:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 65:22" />A̱a̱ da̱shi suwa a̱vu ozo o ro a̱ da̱nu pe shi, a̱a̱ da̱shi cu'wa̱n reve ozo o ro a lyuwa shi. Cine vu revei rana vu ɗanga ri ne ɗa rana va ama a̱ va̱ a̱a̱ da̱na̱. Ama a̱ va̱ a na n ɗangwai a ta jima a uwwusa uyo'o wu ulinga we ekere e le. <verse eid="ISA 65:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 65:23" />Aa yuwan ulinga we pere ko a matsan muwun n na ee ene a̱a̱ kuwusa̱ shi. Adama a na o to o'wo muwun ma aba'un ma̱ A̱sulazuva, oɓolo na̱ gundo le. <verse eid="ISA 65:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 65:24" />Kafu e ɗe n ta̱ usu. Ele ubuwu a adanshi n ta uwwa le. <verse eid="ISA 65:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 65:25" />Mekerenkesu na̱ mokyokyon a ta lyuna oɓolo, kamu ta tama anlya tsa nan, ma̱buta̱ mo to o'wo ilyalya yi yo. A uwwa usa̱n ko o kototo le a masasan ma akiza ma̱ va̱ suru shi,&gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai.<verse eid="ISA 65:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 65" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="ISA 66" />
  <para style="s">Uge'etosu nu uzuwu wo okolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 66:1" />Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, &lt;&lt;Zuva nda̱na̱ta̱ n tsugono n va̱ n ɗa, uvaɗi waru udasata u va̱ u ɗa. Cu'un vu u'wa u ne u ɗa yaa gura suwaa mu? Te ɗa uba̱ta̱ u wivuwun u va̱ wa̱a̱ da̱na̱? <verse eid="ISA 66:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 66:2" />Ili i nda suru ukere u va̱ u ɗa u yuwan nle, ɗaɗa ili i nda suru yo o'woi.&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai. &lt;&lt;Apa vuma na okolo a̱ va̱ a cigai, za na tarai aciya̱yi ili i ro shi na̱ za na tsu la̱pa̱ vadala shi reve u je'en na adanshi a̱ va̱. <verse eid="ISA 66:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 66:3" />Za na cayi kucci vu nan suru u ta̱ tsa vuma na unai vuma, za na waru cayi kucci mokyokyon, tsu za na kuɗai yinlu i musa̱n. Za na cayi ishina tsa̱ kucci, tsa vuma na cayi kucci vu mpasa m ma̱gurusumu. Za na cayi kucci vu ucuwusan vi ili i ma̱guru i na a̱ tsu ɗe furenkise, tsa vuma na zuwayi ma̱sula̱ aba'un. Ele nda a ɗangwa ta̱ re le, reve asuvu e le a ciga idaba i le, <verse eid="ISA 66:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 66:4" />adama o ndolo n ta ɗangwa oforo o usa̱n adama e le reve n ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ ili i wovon a aci e le. Adama a na mantsa ma na n ɗeyi, babu vuma na usuyi, ana n yuwain adanshi babu vuma na zuwai atsuvu. Amma reve a yuwan ili i wuya e esu a̱ va̱ reve a ɗangwa ili i na n cigai shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 66:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 66:5" />Uwwai adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva, aza a na e je'eshen a adanshi a̱ yi, &lt;&lt;A̱za̱ a̱ ɗu a na a 'yuwan nɗu reve o lo ɗu adama a ala a̱ va̱ a damma ta̱, &lt;Lyawa A̱sulazuva a̱ tsura̱ tsugbain, adama tse ene ma̱za̱nga̱ ma̱ ɗu.&gt; &gt;&gt; Agba ele ɗa aza a na e ene wono u le. <verse eid="ISA 66:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 66:6" />Yu uwwa elemu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lyuci, yu uwwa elemu diga a̱ A̱a̱'isa̱! Elemu a̱ A̱sulazuva, a tsupusa n'yuwatan ma̱ yi ili na yi ntsaa nle. <verse eid="ISA 66:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 66:7" />&lt;&lt;Kafu u uwa mɓa̱la̱ n limatan u matsan ta̱, kafu mɓa̱la̱ n ta̱wa̱ yi u matsan ta̱ ulobo. <verse eid="ISA 66:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 66:8" />Zane ɗa uwwai ɗe cu'un vi ili i nda? Zane ɗa e enei ɗe cu'un vi ili i nda? Ko a ta gura matsan iɗa o urana u ta̱? Agba na̱ mɓa̱la̱ n limatan n remeshi Sihiyona, a̱vu u matsashin muwun ma̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 66:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 66:9" />N ta̱ ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ limatan zuzu a̱vu n zuwa a̱ kuɗa̱ matsan?&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai. A̱mu na n tsu ta̱wa̱a̱ na̱ limatan ma̱a̱ ɓa̱ru umatsutsun shi, ne ɗa A̱sula̱ a̱ ɗu a dammai. <verse eid="ISA 66:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 66:10" />&lt;&lt;I yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ na̱ Urishelima a̱vu i yuwan mere adama a̱ yi, suru nɗu aza a na a ciga niyi. Yuwain ma̱za̱nga̱ na̱ a̱yi na̱ mere, suru aza a na a̱ showen niyi. <verse eid="ISA 66:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 66:11" />Adama a na i ta apa reve waru i cuwa̱n na̱ maani ma̱ yi, i to sowo a̱bunda̱ lon na asuvu a̱ ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a tsugbain tsa̱ a̱bunda̱ tsa̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 66:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 66:12" />Adama a na ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai: &lt;&lt;Uwwai nda, n ta zuwa asuvu nden a̱ tyo ya̱'a̱ yi tsu uɗolu, reve utsuru wu nɗa wo o'wo tsu uɗolu u meyene. I ta tsura̱ nden ma asuvu na̱ nden nu uyo'o cine wa̱a̱ ɓa̱na̱sa̱ ɗu, yu uwwa uyo'o cine wee sheɗeshe ɗu e ekere a̱ yi, cine vu revei mereɓu ma tsu uwwa uyo'o a agutsu a mma va̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 66:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 66:13" />Cine mma tsu ɓa̱na̱ mawun ma̱ yi ne ɗa ma̱a̱ ɓa̱na̱ ɗu. I ta̱ tsura̱ ucasu wa adanshi a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ISA 66:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 66:14" />I te ene, a̱vu okolo a̱ ɗu a̱ za̱nga̱na̱, etele a̱ ɗu o to lobono tsa anlya. Reve waru agbashi a̱ yi e reve nu ukere wa̱ A̱sulazuva, reve u roco upan wa̱ yi e ekere a n'yuwatan ma̱ yi. <verse eid="ISA 66:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 66:15" />Uwwai nda, A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ na akina, ni ikeke yi ido ya̱ yi tsu lipa̱. A̱vu u roco upan wa̱ yi nu usuɗuwu, na̱ tsuɓari tsa̱ yi ne elentsu a akina. <verse eid="ISA 66:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 66:16" />Adama a na na akina oɓolo na̱ matsun me pe'eni ma ɗa A̱sulazuva aa yuwan uge'etosu wa̱ yi a ci a ama suru. Aza a na A̱sulazuva aa paɗa a̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ a̱bunda̱.<verse eid="ISA 66:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 66:17" />&lt;&lt;Aza a na a̱ ka̱mba̱toi aciyele na akiza reve waru a̱ ka̱mba̱to aciyele cece adama a uwa a̱ a̱rumbu, o tono za na ri e memere ma aza a na aa tamusa inama yu ngurusumu na̱ a̱ga̱ɗa̱ na akapi e ili yi idaba i na i buwai, a̱ ta̱ kuwa̱ suru nle,&gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai.<verse eid="ISA 66:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 66:18" />&lt;&lt;Adama a na n reve ta̱ linga le oɓolo na̱ majiyan me le, waru mantsa ma̱ to lo a̱ ta̱wa̱ a na moo ɓoloto nɗa suru ne elentsu. A̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ reve e ene tsugbain tsa̱ va̱.<verse eid="ISA 66:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 66:19" />&lt;&lt;N ta zuwa iroci a̱tsuma̱ e le, reve n lyungu aza a na a la'ai a nɗa, a̱ tyo Tarshishi na aza Libiya na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ Lud, aza a na o ronoi utan, a̱ tyo Tubala na̱ Heleni, a̱ tyo a nɗa m memere ma̱ mini ma alanga, n na koto a uwwai ala a̱ va̱ shi waru koto e enei tsugbain tsa̱ va̱ shi. Reve ele a damma tsugbain tsa̱ va̱ a̱tsuma̱ a nɗa. <verse eid="ISA 66:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 66:20" />Reve a̱ ta̱wa̱ na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ ɗu suru, diga a nɗa suru, a̱ tyo a masasan ma akiza ma̱ va̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima cine vu revei kucci e ekere a̱ A̱sulazuva. A̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ zuva vi ido, zuva vi ikeke yi ido ni ikeke yi inan, oɓolo na̱ mololi mo do oɓolo na arakumi,&gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai. &lt;&lt;A̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ ne ele, cine aza a Isra'ila a̱ tsu ta̱wa̱ na̱ kucci vi ishina, a̱ tyo a̱ a̱a̱'isa̱ a̱ A̱sulazuva a ntaɗa n cece. <verse eid="ISA 66:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 66:21" />Reve n zagwa ozo o ro e le o o'wo nan ganu oɓolo nan Levi,&gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai.<verse eid="ISA 66:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 66:22" />&lt;&lt;Cine zuva sa'avu nu uvaɗi u sa'avu u na n yuwain aa jima a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ va̱,&gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai. &lt;&lt;Ne ɗa umatsun wa̱ wu na ala a̱ wu aa jima. <verse eid="ISA 66:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 66:23" />Diga o Woto u Sa'avu a̱ tyo Woto u Sa'avu, waru diga Ashibi a̱ tyo Ashibi, ama suru a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ a yuwan a̱ga̱nda̱ a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ va̱,&gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai. <verse eid="ISA 66:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 66:24" />&lt;&lt;Reve o uta̱ a alanga a̱vu a̱ ka̱lyuwa̱ a̱kwa̱kwa̱ a ama a na a yuwaan numu aciyogbamu. Adama a na azun a na aa tamasa le a̱a̱ kuwa̱ shi, akina a na a̱a̱ kula̱tosu le a̱a̱ kima̱ shi, o to o'wo ili yi idaba e ekere a vaɗilima̱ suru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ISA 66:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 66" />
</usx>